ist.","PT Prasetia Dwidharma to provide sanitized handover and weekly project report templates.","Virtuenet to prepare draft use cases, fit-gap, and simple prototype after receiving customer templates.","Conduct a business workshop with representatives from sales, presales, project management, resource management, and finance approver.","Conduct a separate technical workshop with IT covering security, API, SSO, integration, AI data handling, and offline validation.","Prepare pilot proposal with scope options for six and eight weeks, success metrics, assumptions, exclusions, and business justification.","If prototype shows value, Kodrat will involve decision makers in a later session."],"missing_information":["Approved budget or budget range is not available.","Final names of decision makers are not available; only roles were discussed.","Final IT PIC names are not available.","Final pilot scope is not confirmed, especially resource request approval.","Detailed procurement process, commercial evaluation criteria, and vendor registration requirements are not fully available.","Data residency, retention, DLP, and detailed security requirements are not available.","Identity provider and internal directory details are not available.","API, webhook, and integration technical requirements are not fully defined.","Offline capability requirements and Lark technical fit are not validated.","Baseline metrics are not finalized; customer prefers measuring baseline during the first two weeks of pilot.","Actual current templates and sanitized sample data are pending.","Final participant list for business workshop is not available.","CRM, ERP, project system, and automation tool details are not available.","Formal company KPI tied to this initiative is not available."]},"meeting_type_sections":{"discovery_objectives":["Understand PT Prasetia Dwidharma's current collaboration and project execution workflows.","Identify operational pain points across sales, presales, implementation, finance, procurement, and project management.","Prioritize use cases suitable for a limited Lark Suite pilot.","Define boundaries, risks, success metrics, and next validation steps for business and technical stakeholders."],"current_state":["Fast communication mostly uses WhatsApp.","Formal communication uses email.","Documents are stored across Google Drive and OneDrive depending on division.","Work tracking is split between spreadsheets and non-standard task management applications.","Approvals happen through email, chat, manual forms, and some forms depending on process.","Project reporting is manually consolidated weekly from multiple files.","Project workspace and kickoff artifacts are manually copied from prior projects, with no automatic provisioning.","Resource availability is tracked in a spreadsheet but not always updated in real time."],"business_challenges":["Fragmented channels cause missing context and inconsistent information flow from opportunity to delivery.","Sales-to-project handover is delayed or incomplete because proposal versions, presales notes, and important decisions are scattered.","Delivery teams may misunderstand scope because sales context and delivery context are not aligned.","Management dashboards require significant manual work behind the scenes.","Approval evidence is hard to retrieve during audit or monthly reviews.","Knowledge depends heavily on individuals; when the information owner is on leave, others struggle to find context.","Adoption of previous tools has been inconsistent due to complexity, excessive configuration, difficult integrations, and users returning to WhatsApp and spreadsheets."],"primary_use_cases_identified":[{"use_case":"Sales-to-project handover","priority":"High","details":["Sales submits structured handover data.","Presales confirms technical scope.","Project manager checks completeness and accepts or returns handover with reasons.","Finance may validate terms or purchase order conditionally for certain projects.","After acceptance, system should create a project workspace or project record from a selected template.","Proposal and scope documents should be referenced as single sources, not copied into multiple uncontrolled versions."]},{"use_case":"Project tracking and workspace","priority":"High","details":["Each project should have milestones, tasks, owners, due dates, status, risks, issues, blockers, and weekly updates.","Dashboards should show overdue tasks, blockers, upcoming milestones, project health, and management-level visibility.","Project templates should support implementation, managed service, integration, and proof of concept categories.","Project health should be based on transparent rules and actual data, with AI only as supporting insight."]},{"use_case":"Resource request approval","priority":"Medium to High, subject to validation","details":["Project manager requests role, skill, number of people, start date, duration, location, allocation, and urgency.","Approval should follow agreed routing.","Availability verification remains manual by resource manager during pilot.","Integration with full capacity planning is deferred to a later phase."]},{"use_case":"AI meeting summary and action items","priority":"Supporting feature","details":["Generate meeting summary, decisions, pain points, action items, PICs, due dates, and recommendations.","User review is required before tasks are created or records are updated.","Meeting summaries should support Indonesian and English templates where possible.","Sensitive customer meeting data should not be used before security review."]}],"pilot_scope":{"proposed_core_scope":["Structured sales-to-project handover","Project workspace and project tracking","Dashboard for project health and management visibility"],"candidate_scope":["Resource request approval, subject to validation with resource manager"],"supporting_capabilities":["AI meeting summary with human review","Mobile approval and mobile task update","Notifications and reminders for overdue tasks and stalled approvals"],"pilot_users":"Estimated 40 to 60 users total, with 20 to 30 core users and remaining users as approvers or stakeholders.","pilot_duration":"Six to eight weeks under consideration.","pilot_mode":"Internal only for the first pilot; no customer guest access initially.","out_of_scope":["Payroll","Core finance replacement","Customer credential management or secret management","Full historical document migration","Full resource capacity planning","Email migration","Replacing ERP or core financial system"]},"success_metrics":["Reduction in time to prepare weekly project reports.","Reduction in time to prepare and administer meeting minutes.","Improvement in handover completeness.","Time from closed-won or ready-to-handover status to project accepted.","Percentage of mandatory handover fields completed.","Number of handovers returned for missing information.","Number of clarifications required after kickoff.","Visibility of overdue action items and blockers.","Approval turnaround time.","User adoption, including active users, number of processes actually run in the platform, and whether users return to legacy tools.","Percentage of action items with PIC and due date."],"stakeholders":{"customer_participants":["Kodrat Santoso, Project Manager, PT Prasetia Dwidharma"],"vendor_participants":["Dimas Pranata, Solutions Consultant, Virtuenet","Sinta Maharani, Lark Presales Engineer, Virtuenet"],"champion_or_evaluator":"Kodrat Santoso is the evaluator and likely project owner from the use case side; he can recommend if the pilot succeeds.","decision_makers":"Likely related director and Head of IT; exact names not available.","commercial_stakeholders":"Finance and procurement will join during commercial stage.","technical_stakeholders":"Head of IT and one infrastructure representative should join the technical session; names pending.","business_workshop_stakeholders":["Sales representative","Presales representative","Project management representative","Resource manager","Finance approver"],"estimated_business_workshop_size":"Approximately six to eight people."},"technical_requirements":["Project and process templates with flexibility by project type.","Conditional approval routing based on amount, department, project, document type, transaction value, and other conditions.","Audit trail for approvals including approver, timestamp, and comments.","Role-based and project-based permission model for matrix organization.","Search should follow source permissions, especially for sensitive content.","Collaborative document version history, comments, mentions, and approval for documents such as proposal, scope of work, project plan, meeting minutes, and UAT document.","Configurable notifications including H-1 reminders, overdue alerts, and escalation after thresholds.","Dashboard updates should reflect updated project data without manual consolidation; some metrics can be daily while task and blocker visibility should be timely.","Mobile support for approvals, chat, project status checks, task updates, photo upload, and field evidence forms.","Field evidence may require photo, date, site name, notes, and optionally geotagging for selected projects."],"integration_requirements":["Email integration is potentially important.","Calendar integration is potentially important.","Internal CRM integration may be relevant in later phases.","ERP or project system integration may be relevant in later phases, especially for summary billing or project value visibility.","API and webhook capability should be assessed for Base, Approval, Messenger, Calendar, and Documents.","Open Platform, bot, webhook, and integration patterns should be covered in a technical workshop.","Integrations are not considered a blocker for the first pilot if scope remains focused."],"security_compliance_requirements":["SSO is important for the long term.","Audit log is important.","Data residency requirements are not yet defined and require IT or security input.","Retention requirements are not yet defined and require IT or security input.","DLP is of interest but no decision was made.","AI data processing location, storage by provider, and configuration options must be explained to IT.","Pilot should avoid highly sensitive customer meeting data before security review.","Customer guest collaboration is not included in the first pilot due to access control concerns.","External collaboration, if later considered, must support restricting access per folder or document and easy revocation after contract end.","Sensitive workspace data includes pricing, margin, contracts, certain customer data, and technical credentials.","Credentials should not be stored in collaboration documents and should remain in a secret manager."],"adoption_and_change_management":["Pilot must be simple from day one and avoid overwhelming users with too many modules.","Training should be role-based: project managers need deeper training; sales need handover training; approvers need notification and approval training; general users need chat, document, task, and calendar basics.","Indonesian user guides are preferred.","Short videos are preferred over a single long document.","At least two or three internal admins should be trained to manage workflows and reduce vendor dependency.","Support expectation includes a support channel, SLA for critical issues, and help with minor workflow changes after go-live.","Two onboarding waves may be used because not all 40 to 60 users will be active from day one."],"business_justification":["The strongest justification is time efficiency and governance.","License cost savings are interesting but not sufficient by themselves.","The customer does not want the proposal framed only as application consolidation.","The proposal should show end-to-end process improvement, auditability, dashboards, and operational impact.","Business case must compare Lark against continuing current tools or buying separate point solutions."],"timeline_notes":["Assessment and pilot design are targeted for completion next month if internally approved.","Pilot could start afterward, with a rough target in one to two months, but this is not a committed date.","Kodrat targets sending sanitized templates within three working days.","Kodrat targets business workshop participant list by end of next week.","Virtuenet targets a prototype draft within five working days after receiving the customer templates.","Preferred workshop timing is Tuesday or Thursday morning, with two or three schedule options requested."],"qualification_gaps":["Budget not approved.","Decision makers not yet engaged directly.","IT and security requirements not yet validated.","Resource manager has not validated resource request approval scope.","No final procurement criteria or commercial threshold shared.","No formal baseline or target improvement percentage confirmed yet."]},"bantc":{"budget":"No approved budget yet. Customer is still in exploration stage and needs a business justification before procurement and management approval. Budget decision sits with management and procurement.","authority":"Kodrat Santoso is the evaluator, champion, and likely project owner for the use case side. Final approval likely involves the related director and Head of IT. Finance and procurement will enter during commercial evaluation.","needs":"Strong needs around connected project workflows, auditable sales-to-project handover, project tracking, approval governance, knowledge management, reporting visibility, mobile approvals\\/task updates, and reducing manual administrative work.","timeline":"Rough target is assessment and pilot design next month, with pilot potentially starting afterward in one to two months if internally approved. Pilot duration under consideration is six to eight weeks. Dates are not committed.","competitor":"Microsoft 365 is a reference because some users are familiar with it. Several project management tools have been tried previously. No formal tender is running yet."},"score_updates":{"lead_score":78,"eligibility_status":"potential","confidence":86},"presales_recommendation":"Proceed to a structured business workshop and technical validation. Build a lightweight prototype focused on end-to-end sales-to-project handover, project tracking dashboard, candidate resource request approval, AI meeting summary with human review, and mobile approval\\/task update. Keep the pilot outcome-driven and avoid over-positioning chat or broad app replacement. Prepare a fit-gap document that explicitly marks native fit, configuration, custom integration, workaround, and unsupported or unvalidated items, especially around offline capability, AI data handling, SSO, audit logs, DLP, data residency, and API coverage. Do not include email migration, full resource capacity planning, core finance, payroll, secret management, or historical document migration in the pilot proposal.","metadata":{"generated_at":"2026-08-04T13:23:41+00:00","prompt_template_key":"meeting_summary_discovery_prompt","prompt_version":"1","ai_provider":"gpt-5.5","ai_model":"gpt-5.5"}}	draft	gpt-5.5	gpt-5.5	1	\N	\N	\N	2026-08-04 13:23:41	\N	2026-08-04 13:23:41	2026-08-04 13:23:41
3	App\\Models\\LeadTranscript	7	meeting_summary_generation	{"meeting_type":"Discovery","summary_type":"Discovery","general_sections":{"executive_summary":"Discovery meeting antara PT Prasetia Dwidharma dan Virtuenet membahas evaluasi Lark Suite sebagai platform kolaborasi dan work management untuk memperbaiki keterhubungan proses lintas sales, presales, project management, implementation, finance, procurement, dan support. Tantangan utama saat ini adalah penggunaan banyak channel dan tools yang tidak seragam seperti WhatsApp, email, Google Drive, OneDrive, spreadsheet, aplikasi task management, dan form manual, sehingga handover sales-to-project, project tracking, approval, knowledge management, dan reporting menjadi tidak konsisten, sulit diaudit, dan banyak bergantung pada individu. PT Prasetia Dwidharma tertarik pada pendekatan pilot terbatas, bukan penggantian seluruh tools sekaligus, dengan fokus awal pada structured handover, project tracking, dan kandidat resource request approval, sementara AI meeting summary diposisikan sebagai fitur pendukung dengan review manusia. Belum ada budget disetujui dan keputusan akhir melibatkan director, Head of IT, finance, dan procurement, tetapi terdapat minat kuat untuk melanjutkan ke workshop use case, prototype, fit-gap, dan technical validation.","overall_sentiment":{"positive":68,"neutral":25,"negative":7},"key_pain_points":["Informasi proses bisnis tersebar di WhatsApp, email, Drive, OneDrive, spreadsheet, aplikasi task management, dan form manual sehingga tidak ada single source of truth.","Sales-to-project handover sering tidak lengkap, versi dokumen tidak konsisten, dan keputusan penting hanya tersimpan di percakapan chat.","Project reporting dan dashboard manajemen masih dikonsolidasi manual dari beberapa file dengan format yang tidak seragam.","Approval internal seperti resource request, procurement, business trip, reimbursement, dan dokumen komersial mudah tercecer serta sulit diaudit.","Knowledge project lama, lesson learned, template, proposal, dan keputusan teknis sulit ditemukan karena naming convention dan klasifikasi tidak konsisten."],"customer_needs":["Pilot terbatas yang berorientasi outcome untuk structured handover, project tracking, approval, auditability, dan efisiensi waktu.","Template project otomatis berdasarkan kategori project seperti implementation, managed service, integration, dan proof of concept.","Dashboard project health dan manajemen yang menampilkan status, progress, overdue task, blocker, milestone, resource load, project berisiko, dan isu customer.","Approval workflow dengan conditional routing, audit trail, notifikasi, escalation, dan dukungan mobile.","Security, permission, SSO, audit log, API, webhook, external collaboration control, dan AI data handling yang perlu divalidasi bersama tim IT."],"key_discussions":["Current state kolaborasi dan operasional masih fragmented, dengan workflow berpindah antar aplikasi dan channel.","Prioritas 3-6 bulan adalah project tracking dan handover, approval internal, knowledge management, dan AI meeting summary sebagai kebutuhan lanjutan.","Pilot disarankan internal-only dengan sekitar 40-60 user, 20-30 core user, dan onboarding dalam dua gelombang.","Success metrics mencakup pengurangan waktu weekly report, meeting minutes, approval turnaround time, kelengkapan handover, overdue visibility, action item ownership, dan adoption.","Scope, out-of-scope, stakeholder, technical validation, prototype, dan workshop lanjutan dibahas untuk menghindari pilot yang terlalu luas."],"decisions_agreements":["PT Prasetia Dwidharma akan mengevaluasi Lark Suite melalui pilot terbatas, bukan mengganti seluruh aplikasi sekaligus.","Proposed pilot scope mencakup sales-to-project handover, project tracking, dan resource request approval yang masih subject to validation dengan resource manager.","AI meeting summary menjadi supporting feature dengan mekanisme human review sebelum membuat task atau memperbarui record.","Pilot awal dilakukan internal tanpa melibatkan customer sebagai guest atau external collaborator.","Security, API, SSO, integration, AI data handling, dan data residency\\/retention akan dibahas pada sesi teknis terpisah bersama Head of IT dan infrastructure."]},"meeting_type_sections":{"discovery_objectives":["Memahami cara kerja lintas tim PT Prasetia Dwidharma dan tantangan operasional utama.","Mengidentifikasi use case Lark Suite yang paling relevan dan layak dijadikan pilot.","Menyepakati batasan awal pilot, success metrics, stakeholder yang perlu dilibatkan, dan next step workshop\\/prototype."],"current_state":{"collaboration_tools":["WhatsApp untuk komunikasi cepat","Email untuk komunikasi formal","Google Drive dan OneDrive untuk dokumen tergantung divisi","Spreadsheet dan aplikasi task management yang tidak seragam untuk tracking pekerjaan","Email, chat, dan form manual untuk approval"],"process_maturity":"Tahapan project secara konsep sudah ada seperti initiation, planning, execution, monitoring, UAT, handover, dan closing, tetapi implementasi belum seragam antar project manager dan antar project.","operational_context":"Sebagian tim bekerja dari kantor, sebagian mobile, dan sebagian berada di lokasi pelanggan; proses melibatkan sales, presales, implementation, finance, procurement, customer support, dan project management."},"discovered_challenges":["Tidak ada single source of truth untuk dokumen, keputusan, status, dan konteks project.","Handover dari sales ke project manager membutuhkan pengumpulan ulang informasi dari chat, proposal, dokumen teknis, dan folder berbeda.","Version control bermasalah pada proposal, scope of work, project plan, meeting minutes, dan UAT document.","Approval tidak konsisten dan sulit diaudit karena request bisa masuk melalui form, email, atau chat.","Reporting manajemen membutuhkan konsolidasi manual mingguan dari berbagai file dan format."],"priority_use_cases":[{"use_case":"Sales-to-Project Handover","priority":"High","notes":"Sales submit data terstruktur, presales confirm technical scope, project manager accept atau return handover, dan setelah accepted sistem membuat project workspace\\/record berdasarkan template."},{"use_case":"Project Tracking","priority":"High","notes":"Project memiliki milestone, task, owner, due date, status, risk, issue, weekly update, dan dashboard project health berbasis rule serta data aktual."},{"use_case":"Resource Request Approval","priority":"Medium-High","notes":"Kandidat kuat tetapi perlu validasi dengan resource manager; availability pada pilot diverifikasi manual, bukan full capacity planning."},{"use_case":"AI Meeting Summary","priority":"Medium","notes":"Diposisikan sebagai accelerator untuk summary, decision, action item, PIC, due date, dan recommendation dengan review manusia sebelum update task\\/record."}],"pilot_scope":["Structured sales-to-project handover sampai project execution.","Project workspace\\/record dan project tracking dengan template, milestone, task, risk, issue, blocker, dan dashboard.","Selected internal approval, terutama resource request approval jika tervalidasi.","AI meeting summary sebagai fitur pendukung.","Mobile experience minimal untuk approval dan task update."],"out_of_scope":["Payroll","Core finance replacement","Customer credential management atau secret management","Full historical document migration","Full resource capacity planning","Email migration","Customer external access pada pilot pertama","Full offline capability sebelum technical validation"],"success_metrics":["Pengurangan waktu pembuatan weekly project report.","Pengurangan waktu administrasi meeting minutes.","Peningkatan kelengkapan handover.","Waktu dari closed-won ke project accepted.","Jumlah clarification setelah kickoff.","Visibility terhadap overdue action dan blocker.","Approval turnaround time.","User adoption dan persentase proses yang benar-benar berjalan di platform."],"stakeholders_identified":{"champion_evaluator":"Kodrat Santoso, Project Manager, PT Prasetia Dwidharma","decision_makers":"Director terkait dan Head of IT","commercial_stakeholders":"Finance dan procurement pada tahap komersial","technical_stakeholders":"Head of IT dan satu orang dari infrastructure, nama belum dikonfirmasi","business_workshop_participants":"Perwakilan sales, presales, project management, resource manager, dan finance approver"},"technical_and_security_requirements":["SSO penting untuk jangka panjang.","Audit log penting untuk review dan audit keputusan.","Data residency, retention, dan DLP perlu dibahas bersama IT\\/security.","API untuk Base, Approval, Messenger, Calendar, dan Documents perlu dievaluasi.","Open Platform, bot, webhook, dan integration pattern perlu dibahas di sesi teknis.","Permission harus mendukung department dan matrix project access.","Search harus mengikuti permission sumber, terutama untuk dokumen dan percakapan sensitif.","AI data processing, storage, dan control perlu dijelaskan sebelum menggunakan data customer sensitif."],"missing_information":["Budget range belum tersedia atau disetujui.","Nama final Head of IT\\/infrastructure PIC belum dikonfirmasi.","Target implementasi belum committed, hanya estimasi 1-2 bulan jika disetujui internal.","Data residency, retention, DLP, dan detail identity provider belum divalidasi.","Final resource request approval scope belum dikonfirmasi oleh resource manager.","Contoh template handover dan weekly project report belum diterima.","Capability offline Lark belum divalidasi secara teknis."]},"detailed_insights":{"topics_discussed":[{"topik":"Fragmentasi tools dan single source of truth","ringkasan":"Customer menggunakan WhatsApp, email, Google Drive, OneDrive, spreadsheet, task management tools, dan form manual secara tidak seragam. Akibatnya informasi proses tidak tersambung dari awal sampai akhir.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"Sales-to-project handover","ringkasan":"Handover sering tertunda karena proposal, technical notes, keputusan WhatsApp, dan scope tidak terkumpul atau versinya berbeda. Customer membutuhkan handover terstruktur dengan field wajib, status Needs Completion, review presales, acceptance PM, dan conditional finance step.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"Project tracking dan dashboard","ringkasan":"Customer mengelola rata-rata 20-30 project aktif, bisa lebih jika termasuk project kecil, POC, dan support khusus. Dibutuhkan milestone, task, owner, due date, risk, issue, blocker, project health, upcoming milestone, resource load, dan dashboard manajemen.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"Internal approval dan auditability","ringkasan":"Approval resource request, pengadaan, business trip, reimbursement, dan dokumen komersial saat ini tersebar di email\\/chat\\/form. Customer membutuhkan conditional routing, audit trail, komentar, timestamp, reminder, escalation, dan mobile approval.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"AI meeting summary","ringkasan":"Customer tertarik menggunakan AI untuk summary, decisions, action items, PIC, due date, dan follow-up, namun AI harus direview user sebelum membuat task atau update record. Ada kekhawatiran terhadap pemrosesan data meeting dan data customer sensitif.","relevansi":"Medium"},{"topik":"Knowledge management dan search","ringkasan":"Dokumen project lama, lesson learned, proposal, template, dan keputusan teknis sulit ditemukan. Customer membutuhkan template, metadata, struktur pencarian, dan permission-aware search.","relevansi":"Medium"},{"topik":"Security, permission, dan external collaboration","ringkasan":"Customer mempertimbangkan guest\\/external collaboration di masa depan, tetapi khawatir customer melihat dokumen internal, pricing, diskusi belum final, dan akses yang tidak dicabut setelah kontrak selesai. Pilot pertama disepakati internal-only.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"Pilot design dan adoption","ringkasan":"Pilot direncanakan 40-60 user dengan 20-30 core user, dua gelombang onboarding, durasi 6-8 minggu, training per role, user guide bahasa Indonesia, video pendek, dan admin internal 2-3 orang.","relevansi":"High"}],"buying_signals_radar":{"kebutuhan":5,"urgensi":4,"budget_kesiapan":2,"decision_support":3,"solusi_fit":4,"niat_implementasi":4},"action_items":[{"item":"Mengirim meeting summary kepada PT Prasetia Dwidharma untuk direview, terutama bagian scope dan asumsi.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Mengirim daftar data minimum untuk prototype paling lambat besok sore setelah meeting.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Mengirim contoh template handover dan weekly project report yang sudah disanitasi, target tiga hari kerja setelah meeting.","pic":"Kodrat Santoso","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Mengusulkan peserta workshop bisnis dari sales, presales, project management, resource manager, dan finance approver, target maksimal akhir minggu depan.","pic":"Kodrat Santoso","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Mengonfirmasi PIC dari tim IT untuk sesi teknis security, API, SSO, dan integration.","pic":"Kodrat Santoso","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Menyiapkan draft use case dan fit-gap berdasarkan hasil discovery.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Membuat prototype sederhana untuk handover, project tracking, approval, dan AI meeting summary; draft awal ditargetkan lima hari kerja setelah menerima template dari customer.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Mengusulkan agenda workshop bisnis dan sesi teknis terpisah, termasuk dua atau tiga opsi jadwal pada Selasa atau Kamis pagi.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"}]},"conclusion_section":{"conclusion":"PT Prasetia Dwidharma memiliki kebutuhan nyata untuk memperbaiki proses kolaborasi lintas tim, terutama pada handover sales-to-project, project tracking, approval, auditability, dan reporting. Lark Suite dinilai berpotensi relevan jika diposisikan sebagai platform work management yang menghubungkan proses end-to-end, bukan sekadar chat atau konsolidasi aplikasi. Peluang cukup kuat untuk maju ke tahap workshop dan prototype, tetapi scope pilot harus dijaga, business justification harus berbasis efisiensi waktu dan governance, serta aspek security, API, SSO, AI data handling, dan integrasi harus divalidasi bersama tim IT.","next_step":"Virtuenet mengirim meeting summary dan daftar data minimum, PT Prasetia Dwidharma mengirim template yang sudah disanitasi serta mengusulkan peserta workshop dan PIC IT, lalu Virtuenet menyiapkan draft use case, fit-gap, prototype sederhana, dan agenda workshop bisnis serta sesi teknis.","expected_outcome":"Workshop lanjutan menghasilkan validasi final use case pilot, fit-gap, prototype yang merepresentasikan proses PT Prasetia Dwidharma, success metrics, scope yang disepakati, dan dasar business justification untuk manajemen\\/procurement.","target_implementation":"Assessment dan desain pilot ditargetkan selesai bulan depan jika disetujui internal; pilot diperkirakan dapat dimulai dalam 1-2 bulan, belum committed, dengan durasi pilot yang dipertimbangkan 6-8 minggu."},"bantc":{"budget":"Belum ada budget range atau budget yang disetujui. Customer masih tahap eksplorasi dan membutuhkan business justification sebelum vendor registration dan evaluasi komersial.","authority":"Kodrat Santoso berperan sebagai champion, evaluator, dan project owner dari sisi use case. Final approval kemungkinan berada pada director terkait dan Head of IT; finance dan procurement akan terlibat pada tahap komersial.","needs":"Kebutuhan utama adalah proses yang lebih terhubung, dapat diaudit, efisien, dan mudah diadopsi untuk sales-to-project handover, project tracking, selected approval, dashboard, knowledge management, dan AI meeting summary yang terkontrol.","timeline":"Target kasar assessment dan desain pilot selesai bulan depan, pilot dapat dimulai setelah itu dalam 1-2 bulan jika mendapat persetujuan internal. Durasi pilot yang dipertimbangkan 6-8 minggu.","competitor":"Belum ada tender formal. Microsoft 365 menjadi referensi karena sebagian user sudah familiar, dan beberapa project management tools pernah dicoba. Evaluasi sebelumnya tidak berlanjut karena adoption tidak konsisten, konfigurasi terlalu banyak, integrasi sulit, atau tidak mencakup approval dan knowledge."},"score_updates":{"lead_score":78,"eligibility_status":"potential","confidence":86},"presales_recommendation":"Lanjutkan ke tahap workshop dan prototype dengan pendekatan outcome-based. Fokuskan demo pada alur end-to-end: opportunity siap handover, structured handover, conditional review, project workspace\\/template creation, project tracking, resource request approval, AI meeting summary dengan human review, mobile approval\\/task update, dan dashboard manajemen. Hindari positioning sebagai chat tool atau pengganti seluruh sistem; tekankan governance, auditability, visibility, pengurangan pekerjaan manual, dan adoption. Siapkan fit-gap transparan untuk API, SSO, audit log, permission, AI data handling, offline limitation, dan integration scope. Batasi pilot agar tidak melebar ke core finance, email migration, historical migration, external customer collaboration, full resource planning, atau secret management.","metadata":{"generated_at":"2026-08-04T15:37:05+00:00","prompt_template_key":"meeting_summary_discovery_prompt","prompt_version":"1","ai_provider":"gpt-5.5","ai_model":"gpt-5.5"}}	\N	{"meeting_type":"Discovery","summary_type":"Discovery","general_sections":{"executive_summary":"Discovery meeting antara PT Prasetia Dwidharma dan Virtuenet membahas evaluasi Lark Suite sebagai platform kolaborasi dan work management untuk memperbaiki keterhubungan proses lintas sales, presales, project management, implementation, finance, procurement, dan support. Tantangan utama saat ini adalah penggunaan banyak channel dan tools yang tidak seragam seperti WhatsApp, email, Google Drive, OneDrive, spreadsheet, aplikasi task management, dan form manual, sehingga handover sales-to-project, project tracking, approval, knowledge management, dan reporting menjadi tidak konsisten, sulit diaudit, dan banyak bergantung pada individu. PT Prasetia Dwidharma tertarik pada pendekatan pilot terbatas, bukan penggantian seluruh tools sekaligus, dengan fokus awal pada structured handover, project tracking, dan kandidat resource request approval, sementara AI meeting summary diposisikan sebagai fitur pendukung dengan review manusia. Belum ada budget disetujui dan keputusan akhir melibatkan director, Head of IT, finance, dan procurement, tetapi terdapat minat kuat untuk melanjutkan ke workshop use case, prototype, fit-gap, dan technical validation.","overall_sentiment":{"positive":68,"neutral":25,"negative":7},"key_pain_points":["Informasi proses bisnis tersebar di WhatsApp, email, Drive, OneDrive, spreadsheet, aplikasi task management, dan form manual sehingga tidak ada single source of truth.","Sales-to-project handover sering tidak lengkap, versi dokumen tidak konsisten, dan keputusan penting hanya tersimpan di percakapan chat.","Project reporting dan dashboard manajemen masih dikonsolidasi manual dari beberapa file dengan format yang tidak seragam.","Approval internal seperti resource request, procurement, business trip, reimbursement, dan dokumen komersial mudah tercecer serta sulit diaudit.","Knowledge project lama, lesson learned, template, proposal, dan keputusan teknis sulit ditemukan karena naming convention dan klasifikasi tidak konsisten."],"customer_needs":["Pilot terbatas yang berorientasi outcome untuk structured handover, project tracking, approval, auditability, dan efisiensi waktu.","Template project otomatis berdasarkan kategori project seperti implementation, managed service, integration, dan proof of concept.","Dashboard project health dan manajemen yang menampilkan status, progress, overdue task, blocker, milestone, resource load, project berisiko, dan isu customer.","Approval workflow dengan conditional routing, audit trail, notifikasi, escalation, dan dukungan mobile.","Security, permission, SSO, audit log, API, webhook, external collaboration control, dan AI data handling yang perlu divalidasi bersama tim IT."],"key_discussions":["Current state kolaborasi dan operasional masih fragmented, dengan workflow berpindah antar aplikasi dan channel.","Prioritas 3-6 bulan adalah project tracking dan handover, approval internal, knowledge management, dan AI meeting summary sebagai kebutuhan lanjutan.","Pilot disarankan internal-only dengan sekitar 40-60 user, 20-30 core user, dan onboarding dalam dua gelombang.","Success metrics mencakup pengurangan waktu weekly report, meeting minutes, approval turnaround time, kelengkapan handover, overdue visibility, action item ownership, dan adoption.","Scope, out-of-scope, stakeholder, technical validation, prototype, dan workshop lanjutan dibahas untuk menghindari pilot yang terlalu luas."],"decisions_agreements":["PT Prasetia Dwidharma akan mengevaluasi Lark Suite melalui pilot terbatas, bukan mengganti seluruh aplikasi sekaligus.","Proposed pilot scope mencakup sales-to-project handover, project tracking, dan resource request approval yang masih subject to validation dengan resource manager.","AI meeting summary menjadi supporting feature dengan mekanisme human review sebelum membuat task atau memperbarui record.","Pilot awal dilakukan internal tanpa melibatkan customer sebagai guest atau external collaborator.","Security, API, SSO, integration, AI data handling, dan data residency\\/retention akan dibahas pada sesi teknis terpisah bersama Head of IT dan infrastructure."]},"meeting_type_sections":{"discovery_objectives":["Memahami cara kerja lintas tim PT Prasetia Dwidharma dan tantangan operasional utama.","Mengidentifikasi use case Lark Suite yang paling relevan dan layak dijadikan pilot.","Menyepakati batasan awal pilot, success metrics, stakeholder yang perlu dilibatkan, dan next step workshop\\/prototype."],"current_state":{"collaboration_tools":["WhatsApp untuk komunikasi cepat","Email untuk komunikasi formal","Google Drive dan OneDrive untuk dokumen tergantung divisi","Spreadsheet dan aplikasi task management yang tidak seragam untuk tracking pekerjaan","Email, chat, dan form manual untuk approval"],"process_maturity":"Tahapan project secara konsep sudah ada seperti initiation, planning, execution, monitoring, UAT, handover, dan closing, tetapi implementasi belum seragam antar project manager dan antar project.","operational_context":"Sebagian tim bekerja dari kantor, sebagian mobile, dan sebagian berada di lokasi pelanggan; proses melibatkan sales, presales, implementation, finance, procurement, customer support, dan project management."},"discovered_challenges":["Tidak ada single source of truth untuk dokumen, keputusan, status, dan konteks project.","Handover dari sales ke project manager membutuhkan pengumpulan ulang informasi dari chat, proposal, dokumen teknis, dan folder berbeda.","Version control bermasalah pada proposal, scope of work, project plan, meeting minutes, dan UAT document.","Approval tidak konsisten dan sulit diaudit karena request bisa masuk melalui form, email, atau chat.","Reporting manajemen membutuhkan konsolidasi manual mingguan dari berbagai file dan format."],"priority_use_cases":[{"use_case":"Sales-to-Project Handover","priority":"High","notes":"Sales submit data terstruktur, presales confirm technical scope, project manager accept atau return handover, dan setelah accepted sistem membuat project workspace\\/record berdasarkan template."},{"use_case":"Project Tracking","priority":"High","notes":"Project memiliki milestone, task, owner, due date, status, risk, issue, weekly update, dan dashboard project health berbasis rule serta data aktual."},{"use_case":"Resource Request Approval","priority":"Medium-High","notes":"Kandidat kuat tetapi perlu validasi dengan resource manager; availability pada pilot diverifikasi manual, bukan full capacity planning."},{"use_case":"AI Meeting Summary","priority":"Medium","notes":"Diposisikan sebagai accelerator untuk summary, decision, action item, PIC, due date, dan recommendation dengan review manusia sebelum update task\\/record."}],"pilot_scope":["Structured sales-to-project handover sampai project execution.","Project workspace\\/record dan project tracking dengan template, milestone, task, risk, issue, blocker, dan dashboard.","Selected internal approval, terutama resource request approval jika tervalidasi.","AI meeting summary sebagai fitur pendukung.","Mobile experience minimal untuk approval dan task update."],"out_of_scope":["Payroll","Core finance replacement","Customer credential management atau secret management","Full historical document migration","Full resource capacity planning","Email migration","Customer external access pada pilot pertama","Full offline capability sebelum technical validation"],"success_metrics":["Pengurangan waktu pembuatan weekly project report.","Pengurangan waktu administrasi meeting minutes.","Peningkatan kelengkapan handover.","Waktu dari closed-won ke project accepted.","Jumlah clarification setelah kickoff.","Visibility terhadap overdue action dan blocker.","Approval turnaround time.","User adoption dan persentase proses yang benar-benar berjalan di platform."],"stakeholders_identified":{"champion_evaluator":"Kodrat Santoso, Project Manager, PT Prasetia Dwidharma","decision_makers":"Director terkait dan Head of IT","commercial_stakeholders":"Finance dan procurement pada tahap komersial","technical_stakeholders":"Head of IT dan satu orang dari infrastructure, nama belum dikonfirmasi","business_workshop_participants":"Perwakilan sales, presales, project management, resource manager, dan finance approver"},"technical_and_security_requirements":["SSO penting untuk jangka panjang.","Audit log penting untuk review dan audit keputusan.","Data residency, retention, dan DLP perlu dibahas bersama IT\\/security.","API untuk Base, Approval, Messenger, Calendar, dan Documents perlu dievaluasi.","Open Platform, bot, webhook, dan integration pattern perlu dibahas di sesi teknis.","Permission harus mendukung department dan matrix project access.","Search harus mengikuti permission sumber, terutama untuk dokumen dan percakapan sensitif.","AI data processing, storage, dan control perlu dijelaskan sebelum menggunakan data customer sensitif."],"missing_information":["Budget range belum tersedia atau disetujui.","Nama final Head of IT\\/infrastructure PIC belum dikonfirmasi.","Target implementasi belum committed, hanya estimasi 1-2 bulan jika disetujui internal.","Data residency, retention, DLP, dan detail identity provider belum divalidasi.","Final resource request approval scope belum dikonfirmasi oleh resource manager.","Contoh template handover dan weekly project report belum diterima.","Capability offline Lark belum divalidasi secara teknis."]},"detailed_insights":{"topics_discussed":[{"topik":"Fragmentasi tools dan single source of truth","ringkasan":"Customer menggunakan WhatsApp, email, Google Drive, OneDrive, spreadsheet, task management tools, dan form manual secara tidak seragam. Akibatnya informasi proses tidak tersambung dari awal sampai akhir.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"Sales-to-project handover","ringkasan":"Handover sering tertunda karena proposal, technical notes, keputusan WhatsApp, dan scope tidak terkumpul atau versinya berbeda. Customer membutuhkan handover terstruktur dengan field wajib, status Needs Completion, review presales, acceptance PM, dan conditional finance step.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"Project tracking dan dashboard","ringkasan":"Customer mengelola rata-rata 20-30 project aktif, bisa lebih jika termasuk project kecil, POC, dan support khusus. Dibutuhkan milestone, task, owner, due date, risk, issue, blocker, project health, upcoming milestone, resource load, dan dashboard manajemen.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"Internal approval dan audita