25	App\\Models\\LeadTranscript	13	meeting_summary_generation	{"meeting_type":"Demo","summary_type":"Demo","general_sections":{"executive_summary":"Virtuenet conducted a 60-minute end-to-end Lark Suite demo for PT Prasetia Dwidharma focused on project delivery management using Lark Base, Messenger, Calendar, Automation, Task, Dashboard, and handover approval concepts. The customer responded positively, especially to Base as a project data hub, Automation for task creation\\/reminders\\/escalation, and Dashboard for operational and management visibility. Interest is high and the team agreed to proceed toward a tailored prototype, but pilot approval is not final and remains dependent on technical\\/security validation, permission design, task source-of-truth decisions, and governance clarity.","overall_sentiment":{"positive":75,"neutral":20,"negative":5},"key_pain_points":["Project handovers are often incomplete, requiring PMs to manually check documents and scope details.","Project managers want to avoid duplicate data entry across task, calendar, and dashboard tools.","Current task delays may only become visible during weekly meetings.","Important decisions and issue context are often lost in separate chat channels such as WhatsApp.","Governance risks exist if Base, permissions, automation, and admin rights are not controlled."],"customer_needs":["Centralized project tracking for handover, project master data, tasks, risks, weekly updates, and dashboards.","Clear source-of-truth design for project tasks, milestones, calendar data, and reporting.","Role-based permissions, auditability, admin governance, and security validation before trial or pilot.","Action-oriented dashboards with drill-down into overdue tasks, risks, blockers, and milestones.","Tailored prototype and limited hands-on trial for selected project managers before final recommendation."],"key_discussions":["Demo followed an end-to-end project workflow from request intake, handover review, project creation, task template generation, reminders, escalation, dashboard monitoring, and approval.","Base relationships, formulas, views, permissions, dashboards, and linked project records were discussed as the foundation for project management.","Automation use cases included record notifications, task template creation, overdue reminders, escalation, weekly update reminders, and conditional approval routing.","ICT concerns centered on tenant security, encryption, audit logs, data retention, external sharing, permission model, user lifecycle, API authentication, AI data processing, backup, and recovery.","Pilot boundaries were discussed, including excluding full historical migration, ERP integration, company-wide rollout, and full SSO implementation during the initial pilot."],"decisions_agreements":["Customer agreed there is high interest in continuing to a tailored prototype, subject to technical and security validation.","Proposed pilot scope includes project handover, project provisioning, task template generation, weekly update, dashboards, project handover approval, mobile task\\/approval views, and role-based demonstration.","Project handover approval was selected as the proposed initial approval use case for pilot, while resource request approval may be a later phase.","Task source of truth between Lark Task native and project tasks in Base must be decided in a design workshop.","Business Design Workshop will be planned for 90 minutes and Technical\\/Security Workshop for 60 minutes, with two schedule options requested."]},"meeting_type_sections":{"features_demonstrated":["Lark Base for Project Delivery Management tables, linked records, formulas, views, permissions, and dashboards.","Automation for project request notifications, task template generation, reminders, escalation, weekly updates, and status updates.","Dashboard for project health KPIs, PM operational view, management view, drill-down, and data freshness considerations.","Messenger and Calendar integration for contextual notifications, message cards, kickoff scheduling, availability checks, reminders, and project communication.","Task and approval scenarios covering project task tracking, task dependencies, mobile updates, formal handover approval, and conditional routing."],"customer_reactions":["Base received the strongest positive response as a central project data and tracking layer.","Automation was rated highly because it can reduce manual work through task templates, reminders, escalation, and status orchestration.","Dashboard was strongly valued, especially drill-down from charts into actionable task, risk, and milestone records.","Messenger and Calendar were seen as useful supporting layers but require notification governance and clear source-of-truth decisions.","ICT viewed the platform as relevant but emphasized that security, permission design, auditability, and admin governance must be validated before pilot approval."],"questions_objections":["Whether Base views are security controls; clarified that filters are only display controls and permissions must be used for security.","Whether automation has logs, error handling, and secure credential management for integrations; custom integration should use middleware and secret management.","Whether task management should use native Lark Task or Base; customer objected to having two competing task systems.","Whether Calendar and Base should synchronize two-way; customer preferred a clear source-of-truth approach to avoid conflicts.","Whether dashboard data can include ERP revenue\\/billing and remain fresh; ERP integration was deferred and data freshness indicators were requested."],"key_takeaways":["Meeting outcome was positive and productive, with high interest but no final pilot approval yet.","Highest-interest areas are Lark Base, Automation, and Dashboard.","Primary blockers are technical validation, security validation, source-of-truth design, and governance model definition.","Pilot should remain focused and exclude ERP integration, full historical migration, company-wide rollout, and full SSO implementation during the initial phase.","Customer expects a tailored prototype, limited hands-on trial, and separated proposal for license, implementation, optional integration, and support."]},"detailed_insights":{"demo_highlights":[{"feature":"Lark Base","summary":"Presented as the central Project Delivery Management hub with Project Request, Project Master, Project Task, Risk and Issue, Resource Request, and Weekly Update tables using relationships, formulas, and multiple views.","interest_level":5},{"feature":"Automation","summary":"Demonstrated notifications, scheduled reminders, task template generation, weekly update reminders, escalation rules, and conditional routing connected to project workflow events.","interest_level":5},{"feature":"Dashboard","summary":"Showed KPIs, project health, overdue task drill-down, PM operational dashboard concept, management dashboard concept, and need for data freshness indicators.","interest_level":5},{"feature":"Messenger integration","summary":"Used for message cards, contextual notifications, risk alerts, mentions, and links back to records; customer valued it but requested notification governance.","interest_level":4},{"feature":"Calendar","summary":"Covered kickoff scheduling, participant availability, recurring meetings, and source-of-truth decisions between Calendar and Base milestone data.","interest_level":4},{"feature":"Task management","summary":"Compared native Lark Task and Base task tracking; customer requires one clear source of truth and validation of predecessor\\/blocker needs.","interest_level":4},{"feature":"Workflow approval","summary":"Formal approval was discussed using Lark Approval linked back to Base, with project handover approval selected as proposed pilot use case.","interest_level":4},{"feature":"Security and access governance","summary":"ICT requested validation of permissions, audit logs, data retention, external sharing, user lifecycle, API authentication, AI data processing, backup, and recovery.","interest_level":4}],"feature_interest_radar":{"workflow_approval":4,"dokumen_kolaboratif":1,"lark_base":5,"messenger_integrasi":4,"dashboard_laporan":5,"keamanan_akses":4},"action_items":[{"item":"Send sanitized handover template and weekly report.","pic":"Kodrat Santoso","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send sample project plan, milestones, and task structure.","pic":"Andri Afriansyah","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send initial role and permission expectations as an initial draft.","pic":"Arifia Mulia","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send meeting summary and demo materials.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send minimum data request checklist.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send two workshop schedule options for Thursday morning and Friday morning.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Prepare tailored prototype within five to seven working days after receiving minimum data.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Prepare security checklist and architecture topics before the technical workshop.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send security materials at least two days before the technical workshop.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"}]},"conclusion_section":{"conclusion":"Lark Suite is considered relevant for PT Prasetia Dwidharma\\u2019s project collaboration and project governance needs, with strongest interest in Base, Automation, and Dashboard. The customer is willing to continue to a tailored prototype and limited hands-on trial, but pilot approval remains conditional on security validation, permission design, governance model, technical capability checks, and source-of-truth decisions.","next_step":"Schedule a 90-minute Business Design Workshop and a 60-minute Technical\\/Security Workshop, collect minimum customer data, then prepare a tailored prototype for review before limited hands-on trial.","trial_poc_potensial":"Potential pilot: 5-8 active projects, 25-30 core users, and approximately 40-50 total stakeholders including approvers and related users; scope includes handover, provisioning, task templates, weekly updates, dashboards, handover approval, mobile task\\/approval views, and role-based access demonstration.","decision_timeline":"Indicative internal recommendation in 3-4 weeks after workshop and prototype, not a final commitment; rough pilot start target is next month pending approval and readiness."},"bantc":{"budget":"No budget amount disclosed. Customer requested pilot cost and license options to be explained separately from implementation, optional integration, and support.","authority":"Kodrat Santoso and Andri Afriansyah are project management stakeholders; Arifia Mulia as Head of ICT is a key technical\\/security authority. Additional internal stakeholders must be involved before pilot decision.","needs":"Centralized project delivery management, handover governance, automated task templates\\/reminders\\/escalation, operational and management dashboards, formal handover approval, mobile access, permission governance, auditability, and security validation.","timeline":"Prototype can be drafted 5-7 working days after minimum data is received. Indicative internal recommendation target is 3-4 weeks after workshops\\/prototype; potential pilot start next month pending approval and readiness.","competitor":"Not available"},"score_updates":{"lead_score":82,"eligibility_status":"potential","confidence":88},"presales_recommendation":"Proceed with a tightly scoped prototype focused on Base, Automation, Dashboard, handover approval, mobile task\\/approval, and role-based permissions. Prioritize design decisions on task source of truth, pe