,"interest_level":4},{"feature":"Workflow approval","summary":"Formal approval was discussed using Lark Approval linked back to Base, with project handover approval selected as proposed pilot use case.","interest_level":4},{"feature":"Security and access governance","summary":"ICT requested validation of permissions, audit logs, data retention, external sharing, user lifecycle, API authentication, AI data processing, backup, and recovery.","interest_level":4}],"feature_interest_radar":{"workflow_approval":4,"dokumen_kolaboratif":1,"lark_base":5,"messenger_integrasi":4,"dashboard_laporan":5,"keamanan_akses":4},"action_items":[{"item":"Send sanitized handover template and weekly report.","pic":"Kodrat Santoso","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send sample project plan, milestones, and task structure.","pic":"Andri Afriansyah","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send initial role and permission expectations as an initial draft.","pic":"Arifia Mulia","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send meeting summary and demo materials.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send minimum data request checklist.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send two workshop schedule options for Thursday morning and Friday morning.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Prepare tailored prototype within five to seven working days after receiving minimum data.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Prepare security checklist and architecture topics before the technical workshop.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send security materials at least two days before the technical workshop.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"}]},"conclusion_section":{"conclusion":"Lark Suite is considered relevant for PT Prasetia Dwidharma\\u2019s project collaboration and project governance needs, with strongest interest in Base, Automation, and Dashboard. The customer is willing to continue to a tailored prototype and limited hands-on trial, but pilot approval remains conditional on security validation, permission design, governance model, technical capability checks, and source-of-truth decisions.","next_step":"Schedule a 90-minute Business Design Workshop and a 60-minute Technical\\/Security Workshop, collect minimum customer data, then prepare a tailored prototype for review before limited hands-on trial.","trial_poc_potensial":"Potential pilot: 5-8 active projects, 25-30 core users, and approximately 40-50 total stakeholders including approvers and related users; scope includes handover, provisioning, task templates, weekly updates, dashboards, handover approval, mobile task\\/approval views, and role-based access demonstration.","decision_timeline":"Indicative internal recommendation in 3-4 weeks after workshop and prototype, not a final commitment; rough pilot start target is next month pending approval and readiness."},"bantc":{"budget":"No budget amount disclosed. Customer requested pilot cost and license options to be explained separately from implementation, optional integration, and support.","authority":"Kodrat Santoso and Andri Afriansyah are project management stakeholders; Arifia Mulia as Head of ICT is a key technical\\/security authority. Additional internal stakeholders must be involved before pilot decision.","needs":"Centralized project delivery management, handover governance, automated task templates\\/reminders\\/escalation, operational and management dashboards, formal handover approval, mobile access, permission governance, auditability, and security validation.","timeline":"Prototype can be drafted 5-7 working days after minimum data is received. Indicative internal recommendation target is 3-4 weeks after workshops\\/prototype; potential pilot start next month pending approval and readiness.","competitor":"Not available"},"score_updates":{"lead_score":82,"eligibility_status":"potential","confidence":88},"presales_recommendation":"Proceed with a tightly scoped prototype focused on Base, Automation, Dashboard, handover approval, mobile task\\/approval, and role-based permissions. Prioritize design decisions on task source of truth, permission matrix, admin governance, notification rules, audit\\/data retention, and data freshness. Do not include ERP integration, full historical migration, full SSO, or company-wide rollout in the initial pilot scope.","metadata":{"generated_at":"2026-08-08T03:13:18+00:00","prompt_template_key":"meeting_summary_demo_prompt","prompt_version":"1","ai_provider":"gpt-5.5","ai_model":"gpt-5.5"}}	draft	gpt-5.5	gpt-5.5	1	\N	\N	\N	2026-08-08 03:13:18	\N	2026-08-08 03:12:06	2026-08-08 03:13:18
26	App\\Models\\LeadTranscript	14	meeting_summary_generation	{"meeting_type":"Discovery","summary_type":"Discovery","general_sections":{"executive_summary":"PT Prasetia Dwidharma sedang mengevaluasi Lark Suite untuk memperbaiki proses kolaborasi dan work management secara bertahap, bukan mengganti seluruh aplikasi sekaligus. Tantangan utama yang teridentifikasi adalah informasi proyek tersebar di WhatsApp, email, Google Drive\\/OneDrive, spreadsheet, dan tool task management yang tidak seragam, sehingga handover sales-to-project, project tracking, approval internal, reporting, knowledge management, dan audit trail menjadi lambat dan sulit dikontrol. Prioritas pilot yang disepakati sementara adalah sales-to-project handover, project tracking, dan resource request approval sebagai kandidat kuat yang masih perlu divalidasi dengan resource manager, dengan AI meeting summary sebagai fitur pendukung. Pelanggan menunjukkan minat kuat terhadap prototype end-to-end, dashboard, mobile approval\\/task update, governance, security, API\\/SSO\\/integration validation, serta pendekatan fit-gap yang realistis.","overall_sentiment":{"positive":72,"neutral":23,"negative":5},"key_pain_points":["Informasi proyek tersebar di banyak channel dan aplikasi sehingga tidak ada single source of truth.","Sales-to-project handover sering tidak lengkap, menyebabkan kickoff tertunda, scope berbeda, dan klarifikasi berulang.","Project reporting dan dashboard masih dikonsolidasikan manual dari berbagai file dengan format yang tidak seragam.","Approval internal tersebar di email, chat, form manual, dan sulit diaudit atau dilacak turnaround time-nya.","Adoption tool sebelumnya tidak konsisten karena terlalu kompleks, banyak konfigurasi, atau tidak menyelesaikan proses end-to-end."],"customer_needs":["Platform terstruktur untuk handover, project workspace, project tracking, dashboard, task, milestone, risk, issue, dan update mingguan.","Approval workflow dengan conditional routing, audit trail, mobile approval, notifikasi, dan escalation configurable.","Template proyek berdasarkan jenis project seperti implementation, managed service, integration, dan proof of concept.","Knowledge management dengan dokumen, metadata, permission-aware search, version history, dan kontrol akses.","Validasi security, SSO, audit log, API\\/webhook, integrasi, AI data handling, dan batasan offline sebelum komitmen lebih jauh."],"key_discussions":["Current state collaboration menggunakan WhatsApp, email, Google Drive, OneDrive, spreadsheet, task management app, dan form manual yang belum seragam.","Prioritas 3-6 bulan adalah project tracking dan handover, approval internal, serta knowledge management; AI meeting summary diposisikan sebagai prioritas lanjutan\\/supporting feature.","Pilot direncanakan internal terlebih dahulu dengan sekitar 40-60 user, 20-30 core user, dua gelombang onboarding, dan durasi 6-8 minggu.","Decision process melibatkan Kodrat sebagai evaluator\\/champion, final approval oleh director terkait dan Head of IT, serta finance\\/procurement pada tahap komersial.","Demo berikutnya diharapkan berupa prototype sederhana yang menunjukkan alur end-to-end, bukan demo fitur umum atau fokus pada chat."],"decisions_agreements":["PT Prasetia Dwidharma akan mengevaluasi Lark Suite melalui pilot terbatas, bukan penggantian total seluruh tool di awal.","Core pilot sementara mencakup sales-to-project handover dan project tracking; resource request approval adalah kandidat kuat namun masih subject to validation dengan resource manager.","AI meeting summary akan diposisikan sebagai accelerator\\/supporting feature dengan user review sebelum membuat task atau memperbarui record.","Pilot awal bersifat internal tanpa melibatkan customer sebagai guest.","Sesi lanjutan akan dipisah menjadi workshop bisnis\\/use case\\/prototype dan sesi teknis untuk security, API, SSO, dan integration bersama tim IT."]},"meeting_type_sections":{"discovery_objectives":["Memahami cara kerja lintas tim PT Prasetia Dwidharma dan tantangan operasional kolaborasi.","Mengidentifikasi use case prioritas yang relevan untuk Lark Suite.","Menentukan arah pilot terbatas dan success metrics awal.","Memetakan kebutuhan teknis, security, integration, adoption, dan batasan scope."],"current_state":{"communication_tools":"WhatsApp untuk komunikasi cepat, email untuk komunikasi formal.","document_storage":"Google Drive dan OneDrive digunakan tergantung divisi.","task_tracking":"Spreadsheet dan aplikasi task management digunakan, tetapi tidak seragam.","approval_process":"Approval dilakukan melalui email, chat, form manual, dan beberapa form yang berbeda.","reporting":"Weekly reporting dan dashboard dikonsolidasikan manual dari beberapa file dengan format berbeda."},"business_challenges":["Tidak ada single source of truth untuk informasi dari sales, presales, project, finance, procurement, dan support.","Version control dokumen bermasalah, terutama proposal, SOW, project plan, meeting minutes, dan UAT document.","Dependensi pada individu tinggi; jika pemilik informasi cuti, tim lain sulit menemukan konteks.","Visibility management terhadap project health, pipeline, issue, dan potensi delay membutuhkan effort manual.","Resource availability belum tercatat real-time dan masih menggunakan spreadsheet resource planning yang tidak selalu updated."],"priority_use_cases":[{"use_case":"Sales-to-Project Handover","priority":"High","description":"Sales submit data terstruktur, presales confirm scope teknis, project manager accept atau return handover, lalu sistem membuat project workspace\\/record berdasarkan template."},{"use_case":"Project Tracking","priority":"High","description":"Project memiliki milestone, task, owner, due date, status, risk, issue, weekly update, blocker, overdue task, upcoming milestone, dan project health dashboard."},{"use_case":"Resource Request Approval","priority":"Medium-High","description":"Project manager mengajukan resource berdasarkan project, role, skill, jumlah, periode, lokasi, allocation, dan urgency; availability diverifikasi manual pada tahap pilot."},{"use_case":"AI Meeting Summary","priority":"Medium","description":"AI membantu summary, decision, pain point, action item, PIC, due date, dan recommendation dengan mekanisme review sebelum task\\/record dibuat."}],"pilot_scope":{"proposed_in_scope":["Structured sales-to-project handover.","Project workspace atau project record creation berdasarkan template.","Project tracking dashboard.","Resource request approval sebagai kandidat kuat, masih perlu validasi resource manager.","AI meeting summary sebagai supporting feature.","Mobile approval dan mobile task update.","Role-based onboarding dan admin enablement."],"out_of_scope":["Payroll.","Core finance atau penggantian ERP.","Customer credential management atau secret management.","Full historical document migration.","Full resource capacity planning.","Email migration.","External customer guest access pada pilot pertama.","Full offline capability sebelum technical validation."],"pilot_size":"Sekitar 40-60 user, dengan 20-30 core user dan sisanya approver\\/stakeholder.","pilot_duration":"6-8 minggu dipertimbangkan; 6 minggu minimum dan 8 minggu dinilai ideal jika effort dan biaya memungkinkan."},"success_metrics":["Pengurangan waktu pembuatan weekly project report.","Pengurangan waktu administrasi meeting minutes.","Peningkatan kelengkapan handover.","Visibility terhadap overdue action dan blocker.","User adoption, termasuk active users dan apakah proses benar-benar berjalan di platform.","Approval turnaround time.","Persentase field wajib handover yang lengkap.","Jumlah handover yang dikembalikan.","Waktu dari closed-won ke project accepted.","Jumlah clarification setelah kickoff."],"stakeholders":{"champion_evaluator":"Kodrat Santoso, Project Manager, PT Prasetia Dwidharma.","decision_makers":"Director terkait dan Head of IT, berdasarkan pernyataan pelanggan.","commercial_stakeholders":"Finance dan procurement akan masuk pada tahap komersial.","technical_stakeholders":"Head of IT dan satu orang dari infrastructure akan dikoordinasikan oleh Kodrat; nama belum tersedia.","business_workshop_participants":"Perwakilan sales, presales, project management, resource manager, dan finance approver; sekitar 6-8 orang."},"risks_constraints":["Budget belum disetujui.","Decision makers utama belum hadir di meeting ini.","Resource request approval belum final sebelum validasi resource manager.","Adoption risk dari user yang merasa chat saja sudah cukup.","Availability user untuk workshop dapat terbatas karena project besar yang sedang berjalan.","Data awal belum rapi dan tidak boleh membuat pilot terlalu administratif.","Security, data residency, retention, DLP, AI data handling, SSO, API, dan offline capability masih perlu technical validation."],"missing_information":["Exact budget range dan budget approval status.","Nama final decision maker dan PIC IT\\/infrastructure.","Detail requirement data residency, retention, DLP, AI data processing, dan audit log.","Detail identity provider\\/directory internal.","Baseline kuantitatif final untuk target efisiensi.","Template handover dan weekly project report yang sudah disanitasi.","Final pilot scope setelah workshop bisnis dan validasi resource manager.","Tanggal kalender pasti untuk workshop, demo prototype, dan pilot start."]},"detailed_insights":{"topics_discussed":[{"topik":"Fragmentasi tools dan informasi","ringkasan":"Komunikasi, dokumen, task tracking, dan approval berjalan di WhatsApp, email, Google Drive, OneDrive, spreadsheet, aplikasi task management, dan form manual yang tidak seragam.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"Sales-to-project handover","ringkasan":"Handover sering tidak lengkap karena kebutuhan customer, proposal, catatan teknis, keputusan penting, dan dokumen komersial tersebar di berbagai tempat. Dibutuhkan alur submit-confirm-accept dengan opsi Needs Completion.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"Project tracking dan dashboard","ringkasan":"Pelanggan membutuhkan project health, status, progress, overdue task, blocker, milestone, resource load, jumlah project aktif, nilai project, project berisiko, utilisasi resource, dan customer issue.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"Approval workflow","ringkasan":"Approval untuk resource request, procurement, business trip, reimbursement, dan dokumen komersial membutuhkan conditional routing, audit trail, mobile access, notifikasi, dan escalation.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"AI meeting summary","ringkasan":"AI diminati untuk summary, decisions, pain points, action items, PIC, due date, dan recommendation, namun harus direview user sebelum menjadi task atau update record.","relevansi":"Medium"},{"topik":"Security, integration, dan compliance","ringkasan":"SSO dan audit log penting; data residency, retention, DLP, AI data handling, API, webhook, bot, integration pattern, dan offline capability perlu divalidasi bersama IT.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"Adoption dan change management","ringkasan":"Keberhasilan pilot bergantung pada simplicity, role-based training, user guide Bahasa Indonesia, video pendek, support channel, SLA issue kritis, dan pelatihan 2-3 admin internal.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"Procurement dan business justification","ringkasan":"Vendor registration dan evaluasi komersial akan diperlukan, tetapi sebelum itu pelanggan membutuhkan business justification berbasis efisiensi waktu dan governance, bukan sekadar penghematan license.","relevansi":"High"}],"buying_signals_radar":{"kebutuhan":5,"urgensi":4,"budget_kesiapan":2,"decision_support":3,"solusi_fit":4,"niat_implementasi":4},"action_items":[{"item":"Mengirim contoh template handover dan weekly project report yang sudah disanitasi.","pic":"Kodrat Santoso","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Mengusulkan peserta workshop bisnis.","pic":"Kodrat Santoso","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Mengkoordinasikan PIC dari tim IT untuk sesi teknis.","pic":"Kodrat Santoso","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Mengirim daftar data minimum untuk prototype.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Menyiapkan draft use case dan fit-gap.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Membuat prototype sederhana untuk handover, project tracking, approval, dan AI meeting summary.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Mengusulkan agenda workshop bisnis dan sesi teknis terpisah, termasuk dua atau tiga opsi jadwal.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Mengirim meeting summary untuk direview pelanggan.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"}]},"conclusion_section":{"conclusion":"Discovery menunjukkan peluang yang kuat untuk Lark Suite di PT Prasetia Dwidharma, terutama jika diposisikan sebagai platform untuk proses end-to-end yang terhubung, governance, auditability, dan efisiensi operasional, bukan sekadar chat atau konsolidasi aplikasi. Pelanggan memiliki pain point nyata, champion yang jelas, timeline kasar, dan arah pilot yang cukup konkret, namun keputusan akhir masih bergantung pada validasi stakeholder bisnis, tim IT, business justification, budget, dan procurement.","next_step":"Virtuenet mengirim meeting summary dan daftar data minimum, Kodrat mengirim template yang sudah disanitasi serta mengusulkan peserta workshop\\/PIC IT, lalu Virtuenet menyiapkan prototype dan menjalankan workshop bisnis serta sesi teknis terpisah.","expected_outcome":"Prototype end-to-end yang memvalidasi handover, project tracking, approval, AI meeting summary, dashboard, mobile experience, security assumptions, dan fit-gap sebagai dasar proposal pilot.","target_implementation":"Target kasar assessment dan desain pilot selesai bulan depan, dengan pilot dapat dimulai setelah itu dalam rentang sekitar 1-2 bulan jika disetujui secara internal; durasi pilot yang dipertimbangkan adalah 6-8 minggu."},"bantc":{"budget":"Belum ada budget yang disetujui. Pelanggan masih tahap eksplorasi dan membutuhkan business justification sebelum vendor registration serta evaluasi komersial.","authority":"Kodrat Santoso berperan sebagai evaluator, champion, dan project owner dari sisi use case. Final approval kemungkinan berada pada director terkait dan Head of IT; finance dan procurement masuk pada tahap komersial.","needs":"Kebutuhan utama adalah proses kerja yang lebih terhubung dan dapat diaudit, terutama sales-to-project handover, project tracking, dashboard, approval internal, knowledge management, mobile approval\\/task update, dan AI meeting summary dengan review.","timeline":"Assessment dan desain pilot ditargetkan secara kasar selesai bulan depan, pilot mungkin mulai setelah itu dalam 1-2 bulan jika disetujui. Durasi pilot yang dipertimbangkan 6-8 minggu.","competitor":"Microsoft 365 menjadi referensi karena sebagian user sudah familiar. Beberapa tool project management juga pernah dicoba, tetapi evaluasi sebelumnya terkendala adoption tidak konsisten, konfigurasi berlebih, integrasi sulit, atau tidak mencakup approval dan knowledge management."},"score_updates":{"lead_score":78,"eligibility_status":"potential","confidence":90},"presales_recommendation":"Lanjutkan dengan pendekatan prototype-led discovery: bangun demo end-to-end yang dimulai dari opportunity siap handover, approval\\/validasi, pembuatan project, tracking, meeting summary, dashboard, serta mobile approval\\/task update. Hindari positioning sebagai chat tool atau replacement total aplikasi. Sertakan fit-gap transparan, asumsi scope, out-of-scope, success metrics pilot, effort pelanggan, opsi durasi 6 dan 8 minggu, serta business justification berbasis efisiensi waktu dan governance. Siapkan sesi teknis terpisah untuk security, audit log, SSO, API\\/webhook, integration pattern, AI data handling, permission model, external collaboration, dan batasan offline.","metadata":{"generated_at":"202