d approvals directly in chat.","interest_level":3}],"feature_interest_radar":{"workflow_approval":4,"dokumen_kolaboratif":3,"lark_base":5,"messenger_integrasi":3,"dashboard_laporan":2,"keamanan_akses":3},"action_items":[{"item":"Send quotation for 80 Lark Pro users to customer","pic":"Hanif (Prasetya)","due_date":"2026-08-17","status":"Open"},{"item":"Provide step-by-step implementation timeline and training plan","pic":"Hanif \\/ Mas Qodar (Prasetya)","due_date":"2026-08-17","status":"Open"},{"item":"Customer to confirm contact person and decision-maker for quotation","pic":"Ibu (PT TPLink Indonesia)","due_date":"2026-08-18","status":"Open"},{"item":"Schedule follow-up meeting to address technical questions (e.g., integration, security)","pic":"Prasetya team \\/ Ibu","due_date":"2026-08-21","status":"Open"}]},"conclusion_section":{"conclusion":"The demo successfully showcased Lark's capabilities, with the customer showing strong interest in Lark Base and Approval features. The customer is motivated to replace their current fragmented tools with a unified platform. They have a clear need for 80 users and are open to proceeding with a pilot. The next steps involve sending a quotation and implementation timeline. The decision is expected within a week after internal director approval.","next_step":"Send quotation and implementation timeline to customer, then schedule a follow-up meeting to finalize details.","trial_poc_potensial":"Customer is likely to proceed with a paid pilot after quotation approval; no free trial mentioned.","decision_timeline":"Within 1-2 weeks after receiving quotation, subject to director approval."},"bantc":{"budget":"Not explicitly stated, but customer asked for pricing and is evaluating 80 users; likely within enterprise SaaS budget range.","authority":"Decision-maker is a director (likely procurement or operations director); the customer (Ibu) is the evaluator and will recommend to director.","needs":"Integrated collaboration, automated app