D and procurement team.","needs":"Need a unified collaboration platform to replace Microsoft Teams with better AI features, efficient storage, and customizable workflows (approvals, meeting room booking).","timeline":"Target start date: September 1, 2026. Procurement process expected to be completed by end of August.","competitor":"Microsoft Teams is the current incumbent. Customer also mentioned evaluating other partners (likely other Lark resellers or competing platforms)."},"score_updates":{"lead_score":75,"eligibility_status":"eligible","confidence":80},"presales_recommendation":"Proceed with sending the detailed proposal as discussed. Emphasize Lark's AI capabilities and integrated workflow features that differentiate from Microsoft Teams. Offer a pilot program for 5-10 users to demonstrate value. Provide clear ROI on storage savings and productivity gains. Address customer's concerns about data migration and user management by outlining a step-by-step migration plan with support from Prasetyo's CSM team.","metadata":{"generated_at":"2026-08-30T11:06:35+00:00","prompt_template_key":"meeting_summary_demo_prompt","prompt_version":"1","ai_provider":"ep-20260830094032-4smp5","ai_model":"ep-20260830094032-4smp5"}}	draft	ep-20260830094032-4smp5	ep-20260830094032-4smp5	1	\N	\N	\N	2026-08-30 11:06:35	\N	2026-08-30 11:06:11	2026-08-30 11:06:35
