es submission, Presales technical confirmation, Project Manager acceptance or revision request, and possible conditional finance review.","interest_level":4},{"feature":"Mobile Experience","summary":"Demonstrated or discussed mobile notifications, record access, task status updates, comments, attachments, Calendar access, and requested inclusion of mobile task update and approval in prototype.","interest_level":4}],"feature_interest_radar":{"workflow_approval":4,"dokumen_kolaboratif":1,"lark_base":5,"messenger_integrasi":4,"dashboard_laporan":5,"keamanan_akses":5},"action_items":[{"item":"Send sanitized handover template and weekly report.","pic":"Kodrat Santoso","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send sample project plan, milestones, and task structure.","pic":"Andri Afriansyah","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send initial role and permission expectations as an initial draft.","pic":"Arifia Mulia","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send meeting summary and demo materials.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send minimum data request checklist.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send two workshop schedule options for Thursday morning and Friday morning.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Prepare tailored prototype five to seven working days after receiving minimum data.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Prepare security checklist and architecture topics before the technical workshop.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send security materials at least two days before the technical workshop.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"}]},"conclusion_section":{"conclusion":"The demo successfully established Lark Suite as a relevant solution for PT Prasetia Dwidharma\\u2019s project collaboration and governance needs. The strongest fit is around Base, Automation, and Dashboard, with Messenger and Calendar as supporting workflow layers. The opportunity is promising, but the customer has not approved a pilot yet and requires validation of security, permissions, auditability, data handling, source-of-truth design, and administrative governance.","next_step":"Schedule a 90-minute Business Design Workshop and a 60-minute Technical and Security Workshop, then build and review a tailored prototype followed by a limited hands-on trial.","trial_poc_potensial":"Potential pilot includes 5-8 active projects, approximately 25-30 core users, and 40-50 total stakeholders including approvers and related users. Scope includes handover, project provisioning, task template generation, weekly updates, dashboards, handover approval, mobile task\\/approval view, and role-based access demonstration.","decision_timeline":"Indicative internal recommendation in three to four weeks after prototype and workshops; not a committed decision date."},"bantc":{"budget":"Not available. Customer requested pilot cost and license options to be explained separately from implementation, optional integration, and support.","authority":"Kodrat Santoso and Andri Afriansyah participated as Project Managers; Arifia Mulia participated as Head of ICT and is influential for security, governance, and technical approval. Final decision authority and procurement approver are not fully confirmed.","needs":"Centralized project tracking, standardized handover, task and weekly update automation, operational dashboards, contextual notifications, approval governance, mobile updates, and strong security\\/permission controls.","timeline":"Indicative internal recommendation in three to four weeks after prototype and workshops; possible pilot start next month pending approval, scope, governance, provisioning, and data readiness.","competitor":"Not available."},"score_updates":{"lead_score":82,"eligibility_status":"potential","confidence":90},"presales_recommendation":"Proceed with a tailored prototype and structured validation plan. Prioritize Base data model, task source-of-truth decision, handover approval, task template automation, weekly update workflow, PM and management dashboards, mobile update\\/approval views, and role-based permissions. Run the business design workshop before prototype finalization and a separate technical\\/security workshop covering tenant security, encryption, audit logs, retention, external sharing, API authentication, backup\\/recovery, AI data processing, and admin governance. Keep ERP integration, full historical migration, and company-wide rollout outside the initial pilot scope.","metadata":{"generated_at":"2026-08-08T03:12:06+00:00","prompt_template_key":"meeting_summary_demo_prompt","prompt_version":"1","ai_provider":"gpt-5.5","ai_model":"gpt-5.5"}}	AI Generated	\N	generated	2026-08-08 03:12:06	2026-08-08 03:12:06
