ication, AI data processing, backup, and recovery.","interest_level":4}],"feature_interest_radar":{"workflow_approval":4,"dokumen_kolaboratif":1,"lark_base":5,"messenger_integrasi":4,"dashboard_laporan":5,"keamanan_akses":4},"action_items":[{"item":"Send sanitized handover template and weekly report.","pic":"Kodrat Santoso","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send sample project plan, milestones, and task structure.","pic":"Andri Afriansyah","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send initial role and permission expectations as an initial draft.","pic":"Arifia Mulia","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send meeting summary and demo materials.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send minimum data request checklist.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send two workshop schedule options for Thursday morning and Friday morning.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Prepare tailored prototype within five to seven working days after receiving minimum data.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Prepare security checklist and architecture topics before the technical workshop.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send security materials at least two days before the technical workshop.","pic":"Virtuenet","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"}]},"conclusion_section":{"conclusion":"Lark Suite is considered relevant for PT Prasetia Dwidharma\\u2019s project collaboration and project governance needs, with strongest interest in Base, Automation, and Dashboard. The customer is willing to continue to a tailored prototype and limited hands-on trial, but pilot approval remains conditional on security validation, permission design, governance model, technical capability checks, and source-of-truth decisions.","next_step":"Schedule a 90-minute Business Design Wo