, owner, due date, risk, issue, weekly update, dashboard project health, overdue, blocker, dan resource load.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"Internal approval dan audit trail","ringkasan":"Approval untuk resource request, procurement, business trip, reimbursement, dan dokumen komersial saat ini tersebar. Dibutuhkan conditional routing, audit trail, mobile approval, reminder, dan escalation yang tidak berlebihan.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"Knowledge management dan document governance","ringkasan":"Dokumen project lama, lesson learned, contoh proposal, template, dan keputusan teknis sulit ditemukan karena struktur dan naming convention tidak konsisten. Search perlu mengikuti permission user.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"AI meeting summary","ringkasan":"AI diminati untuk summary, keputusan, action item, PIC, due date, dan follow-up, namun harus direview user sebelum membuat task atau mengubah record. Ada kekhawatiran terkait pemrosesan data meeting oleh model eksternal.","relevansi":"Medium"},{"topik":"Security, permission, dan external collaboration","ringkasan":"Ada kekhawatiran customer dapat melihat dokumen internal, pricing, atau diskusi belum final. Pilot awal disarankan internal. Security review perlu mencakup access control, SSO, audit log, DLP, data residency, retention, dan AI controls.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"Integration dan API","ringkasan":"Integrasi potensial mencakup email, calendar, CRM internal, ERP\\/project system, serta automation tools. Tahap pertama tidak perlu semua integrasi agar pilot tidak lambat, tetapi kemampuan API perlu dinilai.","relevansi":"Medium"},{"topik":"Adoption dan change management","ringkasan":"Customer menekankan bahwa sistem baru tidak boleh menambah pekerjaan atau membuat user kembali ke spreadsheet lama. Training perlu per role, user guide Bahasa Indonesia, video pendek, channel support, SLA issue kritis, dan 2\\u20133 admin internal dilatih.","relevansi":"High"}],"buying_signals_radar":{"kebutuhan":5,"urgensi":