s.","Resource request approval capturing project, role, skill, personnel count, start date, duration, location, allocation, urgency, approval route, and manual availability verification for pilot.","AI meeting summary for summary, decisions, pain points, action items, PIC, due dates, and recommendations, with mandatory human review before automation.","Mobile approval and task update experience for approvers and field users."],"pilot_scope":{"estimated_users":"Approximately 40-60 users, with 20-30 core users and the rest approvers or stakeholders.","pilot_duration":"6-8 weeks under consideration; 6 weeks minimum and 8 weeks ideal according to the customer.","pilot_waves":"Two onboarding waves are possible.","in_scope":["Sales-to-project handover","Project tracking and dashboard","Resource request approval as proposed scope subject to validation","AI meeting summary as supporting feature","Mobile approval and task update demo"],"out_of_scope":["Payroll","Core finance","Customer credential management or secret management","Full historical document migration","Full resource capacity planning","Email migration","Customer guest collaboration in first pilot"]},"success_metrics":["Reduction in time spent preparing weekly project reports.","Reduction in time spent preparing meeting minutes.","Improvement in handover completeness.","Visibility of overdue actions and blockers.","User adoption and percentage of processes actually running in the platform.","Approval turnaround time.","Percentage of mandatory handover fields completed.","Number of handovers returned for completion.","Time from closed-won to project accepted.","Number of clarifications after kickoff."],"stakeholders":{"champion_evaluator":"Kodrat Santoso, Project Manager, PT Prasetia Dwidharma.","decision_makers":"Related director and Head of IT are expected to be final decision makers.","commercial_stakeholders":"Finance and procurement will participate at commercial stage.","technical_stakeholders":"Head of IT 