,000,000 mentioned in discussion."],"decisions_agreements":["No final purchase or rollout decision was confirmed during the meeting.","Both sides aligned that Lark should not replace Odoo as ERP; Lark would be evaluated mainly for collaboration, communication, workflow capture, and possible integration\\/handoff use cases.","The team discussed starting with a small core group rather than all field users, because system implementation with many people cannot be validated effectively within a short trial.","Potential POC\\/use cases discussed include sales order capture before Odoo, HR\\/recruitment, procurement\\/vendor portal, and internal collaboration\\/approval workflows.","It was suggested that the customer first map priority use cases, users, and required dashboards\\/notifications before deciding wider rollout."]},"meeting_type_sections":{"features_demonstrated":["Lark Messenger with company directory, group chats, pinned chats, chat history, custom bots, notifications from other Lark modules, and global search across chat, docs, email, calendar, and tasks.","Lark Calendar and Meeting, including scheduling based on availability, group calls, external participants, browser join option, AI notes\\/minutes, meeting transcription, and subtitle translation.","Lark Approval for configurable approval forms, approval layers, attachments, bot notifications, approve\\/reject actions, and access control.","Lark Base as an advanced spreadsheet\\/database with generated forms, order-entry example, views by item\\/customer, grouping, dashboard charts, formula\\/process capabilities, and automation triggers.","AI and automation use cases including customer review summary\\/sentiment, recruitment CV parsing\\/matching, automated emails, smart ticketing concepts, and image analysis examples."],"customer_reactions":["The customer asked many detailed workflow questions, indicating strong engagement, especially around sales order intake, customer history, Odoo integration, and departmental use cases.","Finance\\/security stakeholders showed concern about whether finance approvals and confidential information could be restricted by access rights.","HR-related participants asked about attendance, leave, overtime, payroll, device requirements, and whether Lark could cover HRIS-like functions.","Procurement questioned whether Lark would duplicate Odoo processes and clarified supplier communication practices such as WeChat with China suppliers.","Warehouse\\/e-commerce\\/marketing participants explored stock opname, barcode\\/RFID ideas, content planning, TikTok\\/Instagram analytics, and dashboard\\/reporting possibilities."],"questions_objections":["Can Lark translate meetings with buyers\\/partners and across chat\\/docs\\/meetings, and what is the accuracy? The presenter stated translation is available across chat, docs, and meetings with around 97% accuracy for supported languages.","Can finance approvals be restricted so other departments cannot see confidential data? The presenter stated access can be configured by role\\/person.","Can customer order history be preserved for customers similar to WhatsApp chat history? The discussion noted options such as email confirmation, WhatsApp via third-party omnichannel integration, or requiring customers to use\\/access Lark, each with trade-offs.","How would Lark integrate or coexist with Odoo? The team clarified Lark can collect\\/collaborate before ERP entry and may integrate via API\\/open platform where feasible, but detailed integration design requires further mapping.","Is rollout required for all users or can it start with one team? The presenter said it can be phased and suggested starting with a core team\\/limited users before broader rollout."],"key_takeaways":["The highest-fit use case is not ERP replacement but improving company collaboration, communication governance, workflow evidence, and data capture before\\/around ERP processes.","Lark Base generated strong interest because it can turn WhatsApp\\/Excel-based requests into structured forms, databases, dashboards, and automation.","A successful POC should focus on a small number of concrete workflows rather than attempting company-wide deployment immediately.","Odoo implementation status is a key dependency; any Lark process must avoid duplicating ERP work and should be designed as a collaboration\\/intake\\/integration layer.","Commercial appetite exists, but budget, final authority, exact user count, and timeline remain unconfirmed."]},"detailed_insights":{"demo_highlights":[{"feature":"Lark Messenger and company directory","summary":"Demonstrated Lark as the central notification and communication hub where employees can find colleagues without saving phone numbers, create chats\\/groups, receive bot notifications, and preserve group history for new joiners while maintaining DM privacy.","interest_level":4},{"feature":"Lark Meeting, Calendar, and AI Notes","summary":"Showed scheduling based on participant availability, group calls, external meeting join options, AI meeting minutes, transcription, and multilingual subtitles\\/translation for cross-country communication.","interest_level":4},{"feature":"Lark Approval","summary":"Explained configurable no-code approval flows with form fields, layered approvers, attachments, notifications to approvers\\/submitters, and access controls for confidential workflows such as finance or HR.","interest_level":4},{"feature":"Lark Base for sales order capture","summary":"Built a simple sales order form\\/table live with customer name\\/phone, item, quantity, delivery date, and PIC; generated a form\\/QR, collected responses, then grouped and visualized the data by item\\/customer.","interest_level":5},{"feature":"Dashboards and reporting","summary":"Demonstrated how Lark Base data can be visualized in charts\\/dashboards and grouped views, with discussion around sales orders, recruitment funnels, marketing\\/content calendars, and e-commerce performance reporting.","interest_level":4},{"feature":"AI and automation","summary":"Covered AI-assisted customer review summaries\\/sentiment, recruitment CV parsing and matching, automated email\\/calendar actions, and potential ticket classification; customer explored practical fit and limitations.","interest_level":4},{"feature":"Security, access, and offboarding","summary":"Discussed access permissions, confidential approval visibility, AWS Singapore hosting for Indonesia region, certifications, company-owned accounts, suspension\\/offboarding, and resource transfer.","interest_level":4}],"feature_interest_radar":{"workflow_approval":4,"dokumen_kolaboratif":3,"lark_base":5,"messenger_integrasi":4,"dashboard_laporan":4,"keamanan_akses":4},"action_items":[{"item":"Customer to map priority use cases, target departments, required data fields, dashboards, notifications, and user groups for a trial\\/POC.","pic":"PT Maju Gemilang Persada internal team","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Leadsy\\/Lark team to prepare or follow up with commercial proposal\\/quotation options for Pro\\/frontline users and custom use-case development based on selected scope.","pic":"Leadsy\\/Lark team","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Leadsy\\/Lark team to advise recommended trial structure, including whether to use Starter\\/free users or paid Pro users for the initial core group.","pic":"Leadsy\\/Lark team","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Customer and Leadsy\\/Lark to clarify coexistence\\/integration points with Odoo, especially sales order intake, finance approval\\/status, procurement, and warehouse flows.","pic":"PT Maju Gemilang Persada and Leadsy\\/Lark team","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Customer to confirm decision makers, initial user count, and which departments will join the first phase or POC.","pic":"PT Maju Gemilang Persada management","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"}]},"conclusion_section":{"conclusion":"The demo was productive and consultative, with high engagement from multiple departments and strong interest in Lark Base, workflow approval, internal collaboration, and structured data capture. The customer appears to have real operational pain around WhatsApp\\/Excel-based coordination and manual processes, but the buying path is still exploratory because Odoo is being implemented and the team needs to define which Lark use cases provide incremental value without duplicating ERP work.","next_step":"Map 1-2 priority POC use cases, confirm core users and departments, then provide a scoped proposal covering license option, implementation\\/customization cost, and success criteria.","trial_poc_potensial":"High potential for a limited POC using a core group of around 10-20 users; candidate use cases include sales order intake before Odoo, approval workflow\\/content approval, HR\\/recruitment process, and vendor\\/procurement portal. Starter\\/free can be used for basic exploration, but Pro is recommended if automation, storage, and meeting limits need realistic testing.","decision_timeline":"Not available"},"bantc":{"budget":"Pricing was discussed but budget was not confirmed. Mentioned figures include Pro license around IDR 225,000 per user\\/month, frontline license around IDR 95,000 per user\\/month, Starter\\/free up to 20 users, and custom use-case development around IDR 8,000,000; implementation and annual contract terms were also discussed.","authority":"Final authority not fully confirmed. Pak Hendru\\/Andrew appears to be a key management stakeholder, with inputs from marketing, finance\\/accounting\\/tax, HRD, procurement, warehouse, e-commerce, and other departmental users.","needs":"Clear needs around internal collaboration, company-controlled communication history, multilingual communication, approvals, sales order capture, dashboards, HR\\/recruitment support, procurement\\/vendor processes, and possible Odoo integration\\/handoff.","timeline":"No firm decision timeline. Odoo implementation\\/training is ongoing, and Lark evaluation appears to be in discovery\\/POC planning stage.","competitor":"Current alternatives\\/processes include WhatsApp, WeChat, email\\/Gmail, Zoom, Google Sheets\\/Excel, Odoo ERP, marketplace\\/e-commerce systems, and possible omnichannel tools for WhatsApp integration. No direct Lark competitor evaluation was confirmed."},"score_updates":{"lead_score":78,"eligibility_status":"potential","confidence":77},"presales_recommendation":"Proceed with a tightly scoped POC proposal rather than a broad platform pitch. Recommend selecting 1 primary business workflow, ideally sales order intake before Odoo or approval\\/content workflow, plus 1 collaboration baseline for chat\\/calendar\\/meeting. Define success metrics such as reduced manual WhatsApp-to-Excel handling, faster approval turnaround, searchable history, dashboard visibility, and clean Odoo handoff. Clarify user count, license mix, Odoo integration requirements, data ownership\\/security expectations, and final decision authority before investing in deeper customization.","metadata":{"generated_at":"2026-08-28T16:15:57+00:00","prompt_template_key":"meeting_summary_demo_prompt","prompt_version":"1","ai_provider":"gpt-5.5","ai_model":"gpt-5.5"}}	AI Generated	\N	generated	2026-08-28 16:15:57	2026-08-28 16:15:57
13	61	2	{"meeting_type":"Demo","summary_type":"Demo","general_sections":{"executive_summary":"Demo memperkenalkan Lark sebagai all-in-one collaboration platform untuk PT Maju Gemilang Persada, mencakup messenger, meeting, calendar, docs, approval, attendance, Lark Base, dashboard, automation, AI, translation, security, dan user onboarding\\/offboarding. Diskusi sangat berfokus pada bagaimana Lark dapat melengkapi implementasi Odoo yang sedang berjalan, terutama untuk kolaborasi internal, pengumpulan sales order\\/customer order sebelum masuk ERP, approval lintas departemen, HR attendance\\/recruitment, procurement\\/vendor communication, serta monitoring warehouse dan e-commerce\\/content planning. Customer menunjukkan minat tinggi namun masih banyak mengevaluasi fit terhadap proses existing, integrasi Odoo\\/WhatsApp\\/omnichannel, adopsi customer, dan skema lisensi\\/POC.","overall_sentiment":{"positive":62,"neutral":32,"negative":6},"key_pain_points":["Komunikasi pekerjaan masih banyak tersebar di WhatsApp\\/WeChat sehingga histori, ownership data, dan kontrol saat karyawan resign menjadi masalah.","Order dari customer\\/distributor banyak berasal dari WhatsApp dan perlu ditangkap lebih rapi sebelum masuk ke sistem ERP\\/Odoo.","HR masih memiliki proses manual seperti attendance dari fingerprint\\/export, payroll manual, dan belum ada proses recruitment yang terstruktur.","Warehouse\\/stock opname masih manual dan memakan waktu lama; disebutkan proses bisa sampai berbulan-bulan per area\\/lantai.","Koordinasi dengan supplier luar negeri, terutama China, menghadapi kendala bahasa dan penggunaan platform berbeda seperti WeChat."],"customer_needs":["Platform kolaborasi internal yang terpusat untuk chat, meeting, calendar, task, file, email, dan pencarian global.","Form\\/order capture berbasis Lark Base untuk menampung order customer, mengelompokkan produk, quantity, customer, dan potensi integrasi ke Odoo.","Workflow approval digital dengan notifikasi, akses role-based, attachment, audit trail, dan proses yang dapat dikonfigurasi.","Dashboard dan reporting real-time untuk sales order, recruitment, project\\/progress tracking, marketing\\/content, dan operational monitoring.","Kemampuan translation, meeting transcript\\/notulen AI, dan akses multi-device untuk komunikasi lintas bahasa dan lintas tim."],"key_discussions":["Lark diposisikan sebagai communication and collaboration platform, bukan pengganti langsung Odoo ERP; Odoo tetap menjadi sistem utama untuk proses ERP.","Demo Lark Base dibuat dari awal untuk contoh sales order form, lalu data masuk otomatis ke table dan divisualisasikan menjadi dashboard serta view by item\\/customer.","Dibahas kemungkinan integrasi ke Odoo, email, WhatsApp melalui omnichannel tool, marketplace\\/e-commerce, dan batasan integrasi langsung untuk Instagram\\/TikTok analytics.","Customer menanyakan aspek security, akses data finance, private\\/direct message history, transfer aset digital saat offboarding, dan kontrol user.","Diskusi lisensi mencakup Starter gratis sampai 20 user dengan limitasi, Pro sekitar Rp225.000\\/user\\/bulan, Frontline sekitar Rp95.000\\/user\\/bulan, serta opsi mulai dari core team kecil."],"decisions_agreements":["Belum ada keputusan pembelian final dalam meeting ini.","Disepakati secara konsep bahwa implementasi sebaiknya dimulai dari core team terlebih dahulu, bukan langsung semua user lapangan.","Lark dapat digunakan berdampingan dengan Odoo; proses ERP yang sudah berjalan tidak perlu diduplikasi di Lark.","POC\\/trial potensial diarahkan pada 10-20 user internal untuk membuktikan workflow dan use case sebelum scale-up.","Scope use case POC masih perlu dipastikan; beberapa kandidat yang dibahas adalah sales order capture, HR\\/recruitment, procurement\\/vendor portal, dan approval."]},"meeting_type_sections":{"features_demonstrated":["Lark Messenger dengan chat internal, group chat, pin, global search, bot notification, sharing file\\/contact, task creation, dan group call.","Lark Meeting dan Calendar, termasuk schedule availability, meeting link, AI notulen\\/transcript, subtitle\\/translation, dan multi-device handoff.","Approval workflow dengan configurable form, attachment, layer approval, approver notification, approve\\/reject, dan access control.","Lark Base sebagai advanced spreadsheet\\/database untuk form input, grouping, view by customer\\/item, dashboard, workflow automation, dan AI summary\\/sentiment.","Admin console untuk onboarding\\/offboarding user, transfer digital assets, suspend account, dan pengelolaan akses company."],"customer_reactions":["Customer aktif bertanya dan mencoba memahami use case nyata per departemen seperti sales\\/marketing, HR, procurement, warehouse, finance, dan e-commerce.","Minat tinggi terlihat pada Lark Base untuk order capture, dashboard, dan potensi integrasi ke Odoo.","Customer tertarik pada translation untuk komunikasi dengan pihak luar atau supplier\\/buyer lintas bahasa.","Customer menyadari value governance dari memindahkan komunikasi pekerjaan dari WhatsApp ke platform company-owned.","Customer tetap berhati-hati terkait adopsi customer\\/distributor yang sudah terbiasa dengan WhatsApp dan terkait effort implementasi."],"questions_objections":["Apakah translation bisa digunakan di chat, docs, dan meeting, serta berapa akurasinya?","Apakah approval finance bisa dibatasi agar tidak dapat dilihat oleh user lain yang tidak berwenang?","Apakah Lark bisa diintegrasikan dengan Odoo, WhatsApp, omnichannel, marketplace, TikTok\\/Instagram analytics, dan email?","Bagaimana customer\\/distributor bisa melihat histori order jika order dilakukan melalui form, bukan WhatsApp?","Apakah implementasi harus untuk seluruh tim sekaligus atau bisa bertahap, dan bagaimana skema harga\\/trial\\/lisensinya?"],"key_takeaways":["Positioning yang paling diterima adalah Lark sebagai layer kolaborasi dan workflow di atas\\/di samping Odoo, bukan mengganti ERP.","Use case sales order capture sangat relevan, tetapi perlu desain yang mempertimbangkan SKU banyak, identitas customer, histori order, dan integrasi ERP.","WhatsApp tetap mudah untuk customer, namun kurang ideal untuk governance, security, continuity, dan company data ownership.","Mulai dari pilot kecil dengan core users lebih realistis dibanding roll-out langsung ke seluruh karyawan.","Keputusan selanjutnya bergantung pada pemetaan use case, jumlah user awal, biaya implementasi, dan proof of value."]},"detailed_insights":{"demo_highlights":[{"feature":"Lark Base sales order form","summary":"Presenter membuat contoh table\\/form sales order dari awal berisi nama customer, item barang, quantity, tanggal kirim, dan PIC, lalu data input masuk otomatis dan dibuatkan view serta dashboard.","interest_level":5},{"feature":"Messenger, bot notification, dan global search","summary":"Ditunjukkan bahwa seluruh notifikasi dari fitur Lark dapat masuk ke messenger, dengan search terpusat untuk chat, docs, email, calendar, dan task.","interest_level":5},{"feature":"Workflow approval","summary":"Approval dapat dikonfigurasi tanpa coding dengan layer approver, attachment, access control, dan notifikasi approve\\/reject melalui Lark.","interest_level":4},{"feature":"Meeting, calendar, AI notulen, dan translation","summary":"Demo menjelaskan scheduling availability, group call, meeting transcript\\/notulen AI, subtitle, dan translation lintas bahasa di chat\\/docs\\/meeting.","interest_level":4},{"feature":"HR recruitment automation using Lark Base and AI","summary":"Ditunjukkan contoh recruitment process dengan CV parsing, summary, matching score terhadap requirement, automated interview invite, feedback, dan recruitment dashboard.","interest_level":4}],"feature_interest_radar":{"workflow_approval":4,"dokumen_kolaboratif":3,"lark_base":5,"messenger_integrasi":5,"dashboard_laporan":4,"keamanan_akses":4},"action_items":[{"item":"Map dan finalisasi prioritas use case POC, termasuk apakah fokus awal pada sales order capture, HR\\/recruitment, procurement\\/vendor portal, approval, atau kombinasi lainnya.","pic":"PT Maju Gemilang Persada","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Tentukan core users awal untuk trial\\/POC, disarankan sekitar 10-20 user internal sebelum melibatkan tim lapangan secara luas.","pic":"PT Maju Gemilang Persada","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Siapkan proposal\\/quotation lisensi dan biaya implementasi use case berdasarkan skema Starter\\/Pro\\/Frontline yang paling sesuai.","pic":"Leadsy\\/Lark team","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Kaji pendekatan integrasi Lark Base dengan Odoo dan opsi notifikasi ke customer melalui email atau WhatsApp\\/omnichannel.","pic":"Leadsy\\/Lark team","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"},{"item":"Validasi keterbatasan integrasi e-commerce\\/social analytics, khususnya Instagram\\/TikTok analytics dan marketplace non-Tokopedia\\/TikTok\\/Shopee.","pic":"Leadsy\\/Lark team","due_date":"Not available","status":"Open"}]},"conclusion_section":{"conclusion":"Demo menghasilkan minat yang cukup kuat terhadap Lark, terutama sebagai platform kolaborasi internal dan workflow yang dapat melengkapi Odoo. Customer melihat relevansi pada order capture, approval, dashboard, HR, procurement, dan komunikasi lintas bahasa, namun masih perlu kejelasan scope POC, integrasi, user adoption, serta biaya sebelum bergerak ke keputusan komersial.","next_step":"Lakukan use case mapping dan susun proposal POC\\/lisensi untuk core team kecil, termasuk opsi integrasi Odoo dan mekanisme feedback order ke customer.","trial_poc_potensial":"Potensial. Disarankan mulai dengan 10-20 user internal menggunakan Pro atau Starter terbatas, dengan 1-2 use case prioritas seperti sales order capture dan approval\\/HR\\/procurement. Scope final belum tersedia.","decision_timeline":"Not available"},"bantc":{"budget":"Harga dibahas: Pro sekitar Rp225.000\\/user\\/bulan dengan kontrak tahunan, Frontline sekitar Rp95.000\\/user\\/bulan, Starter gratis sampai 20 user dengan limitasi, dan custom use case\\/POC disebut sekitar Rp8.000.000. Belum ada komitmen budget final.","authority":"Beberapa stakeholder lintas fungsi hadir, termasuk management\\/Pak Hendru atau Andrew, finance\\/accounting\\/tax, HRD, procurement, warehouse, marketing\\/e-commerce. Pengambil keputusan final tidak dinyatakan secara eksplisit.","needs":"Kebutuhan utama adalah kolaborasi company-owned, workflow approval, order capture sebelum ERP\\/Odoo, dashboard\\/reporting, HR attendance\\/recruitment support, procurement\\/vendor coordination, translation, dan kontrol akses\\/offboarding.","timeline":"Belum ada timeline keputusan. Opsi trial 2 minggu dan\\/atau mulai dengan core paid users dibahas, tetapi tanggal mulai belum diputuskan.","competitor":"Odoo sedang\\/akan digunakan sebagai ERP utama; WhatsApp, WeChat, Google Workspace\\/Sheets\\/Forms, Zoom, email, dan beberapa tools omnichannel\\/marketplace menjadi sistem\\/proses existing atau pembanding. Odoo lebih sebagai incumbent ERP daripada kompetitor langsung Lark."},"score_updates":{"lead_score":78,"eligibility_status":"potential","confidence":76},"presales_recommendation":"Prioritaskan pendekatan phased POC, bukan full roll-out. Jalankan workshop singkat untuk memetakan proses sales order dari WhatsApp\\/customer ke Lark Base lalu ke Odoo, termasuk desain SKU\\/customer identity dan notifikasi balik via email\\/WhatsApp omnichannel. Siapkan juga satu use case internal cepat seperti approval atau recruitment untuk menunjukkan value non-ERP. Tekankan governance, data ownership, offboarding, global search, dan translation sebagai diferensiasi dibanding WhatsApp\\/WeChat. Berikan proposal dengan opsi 10-20 Pro users, estimasi implementasi, success metrics, dan batasan integrasi yang jelas.","metadata":{"generated_at":"2026-08-28T16:16:55+00:00","prompt_template_key":"meeting_summary_demo_prompt","prompt_version":"1","ai_provider":"gpt-5.5","ai_model":"gpt-5.5"