nsidering replacing Microsoft Teams with Lark, driven by the need for integrated approvals and cost optimization. The initial order of 12 Enterprise licenses is likely, with potential to expand to 25 users. The sales partner, Prasetyo, must deliver a compelling proposal and timely support to secure the deal.","next_step":"Send detailed proposal including pricing, training schedule, and managed service options. Follow up with a meeting to discuss proposal and address any remaining questions.","trial_poc_potensial":"The customer has already tested Lark free version and is ready to move to paid licenses. No additional POC required, but a pilot with 5-10 users could be considered before full rollout.","decision_timeline":"Customer aims to start implementation by September 1, 2025, suggesting a decision within the next 2-3 weeks."},"bantc":{"budget":"Approved for initial 12 users at Rp 350,000\\/user\\/month; open to scaling up. Potential discount for 50+ users.","authority":"Key decision-makers: Pak Galih and Pak Adam (IT\\/Management). Final approval likely from higher management (possibly Pak Darmawan).","needs":"Replace Microsoft Teams with a platform that offers integrated workflow approvals, AI meeting summaries, and cost-effective licensing for different user tiers.","timeline":"Target go-live September 1, 2025. Quick decision expected.","competitor":"Microsoft Teams (currently in use). Lark is being evaluated as a more feature-rich and cost-effective alternative."},"score_updates":{"lead_score":85,"eligibility_status":"eligible","confidence":80},"presales_recommendation":"Prioritize sending a detailed proposal with clear value proposition on workflow automation and cost savings. Offer a free trial for a small group to accelerate adoption. Emphasize after-sales support and training to reduce switching friction. Prepare a competitor comparison to address any lingering doubts about Microsoft Teams.","metadata":{"generated_at":"2026-08-30T11:06:11+00:00","prompt_temp