3	322	App\\Models\\LeadTranscript	5	neutral	potential	medium	["No single source of truth for project information, documents, decisions, and handover context.","Version control issues in proposals, scope of work, project plans, meeting minutes, and UAT documents.","Manual weekly reporting takes approximately one to two hours per project manager depending on project volume.","Meeting minutes take approximately 30 minutes to one hour after each meeting, sometimes more.","Project handover can take several days when information is incomplete.","Approval requests can be delayed or lost because approvers miss messages or requests are spread across channels.","Project managers currently create folders, workspaces, task lists, and kickoff documents manually by copying from prior projects, creating risks around old documents and permissions.","Need flexible but governed project templates for implementation, managed service, integration, and proof of concept projects.","Need dashboards for project health, progress, overdue tasks, blockers, upcoming milestones, risks, resource load, active projects, project value, resource utilization, and customer issues.","Need auditability for approvals, including who approved, when, and comments.","Need role-based and project-based permissions because operations are matrix-based.","Need careful handling of sensitive data such as pricing, margin, contracts, customer data, and technical credentials.","Need adoption-friendly workflows because many users still feel chat is sufficient and will resist systems with too many steps."]	["Current collaboration is fragmented across WhatsApp, email, Google Drive, OneDrive, spreadsheets, task tools, and manual forms.","Sales-to-project handover is a major pain point due to scattered customer requirements, proposal versions, presales notes, and key decisions remaining in WhatsApp or separate files.","Project tracking is not standardized; some projects follow defined phases while others remain broadly marked as ongoing.","Management visibility into project status, pipeline, risks, delays, and resource load requires manual weekly consolidation.","Internal approvals are inconsistent across email, chat, manual forms, and spreadsheets, with a strong need for conditional routing and audit trail.","Knowledge management is weak because users struggle to find project documents, lessons learned, templates, examples, and technical decisions.","The customer wants a pilot-first approach rather than replacing all tools at once.","AI meeting summary is interesting for summaries, decisions, action items, PICs, due dates, and follow-up, but must be reviewed by users before updating records or creating tasks.","External collaboration is interesting but not part of the first pilot due to permission and security concerns.","Mobile experience is important for approvals, task updates, status checks, photo uploads, and field evidence submission.","Lark should be positioned as an outcome-driven work management and collaboration platform, not merely chat or application consolidation."]	Virtuenet to send meeting summary and minimum data request list.	\N	86	2026-08-04 13:23:41	2026-08-04 13:23:41	2026-08-04 13:23:41	PT Prasetia Dwidharma is evaluating Lark Suite through a limited pilot, not as an immediate replacement for all existing tools. The main business objective is to make project-related processes more connected, auditable, and efficient across sales, presales, project management, finance, procurement, and implementation teams. The strongest pain points are fragmented information across WhatsApp, email, Google Drive, OneDrive, spreadsheets, and inconsistent task tools; weak sales-to-project handover; manual project reporting; inconsistent approvals; and difficulty finding prior project knowledge. A proposed pilot will focus on sales-to-project handover, project tracking, and potentially resource request approval, with AI meeting summary as a supporting accelerator. Security, API, SSO, integrations, and AI data handling require a separate technical workshop with IT before broader commitment.	{"budget":"No approved budget yet. Customer is still in exploration stage and needs a business justification before procurement and management approval. Budget decision sits with management and procurement.","authority":"Kodrat Santoso is the evaluator, champion, and likely project owner for the use case side. Final approval likely involves the related director and Head of IT. Finance and procurement will enter during commercial evaluation.","needs":"Strong needs around connected project workflows, auditable sales-to-project handover, project tracking, approval governance, knowledge management, reporting visibility, mobile approvals\\/task updates, and reducing manual administrative work.","timeline":"Rough target is assessment and pilot design next month, with pilot potentially starting afterward in one to two months if internally approved. Pilot duration under consideration is six to eight weeks. Dates are not committed.","competitor":"Microsoft 365 is a reference because some users are familiar with it. Several project management tools have been tried previously. No formal tender is running yet."}	potential	Proceed to a structured business workshop and technical validation. Build a lightweight prototype focused on end-to-end sales-to-project handover, project tracking dashboard, candidate resource request approval, AI meeting summary with human review, and mobile approval/task update. Keep the pilot outcome-driven and avoid over-positioning chat or broad app replacement. Prepare a fit-gap document that explicitly marks native fit, configuration, custom integration, workaround, and unsupported or unvalidated items, especially around offline capability, AI data handling, SSO, audit logs, DLP, data residency, and API coverage. Do not include email migration, full resource capacity planning, core finance, payroll, secret management, or historical document migration in the pilot proposal.	Proceed to a structured business workshop and technical validation. Build a lightweight prototype focused on end-to-end sales-to-project handover, project tracking dashboard, candidate resource request approval, AI meeting summary with human review, and mobile approval/task update. Keep the pilot outcome-driven and avoid over-positioning chat or broad app replacement. Prepare a fit-gap document that explicitly marks native fit, configuration, custom integration, workaround, and unsupported or unvalidated items, especially around offline capability, AI data handling, SSO, audit logs, DLP, data residency, and API coverage. Do not include email migration, full resource capacity planning, core finance, payroll, secret management, or historical document migration in the pilot proposal.	\N	No single source of truth for project information, documents, decisions, and handover context.	\N	["No approved budget yet; business case must justify value before procurement and management approval.","Final decision makers were not present in the meeting.","IT and security stakeholders were not present, so requirements for data residency, retention, DLP, SSO, audit log, AI data processing, and integration remain incomplete.","Potential user resistance because some users believe chat and spreadsheets are sufficient.","Pilot may be constrained by user availability due to ongoing large projects.","Data quality and lack of clean initial data may slow the pilot.","Overly broad scope could reduce pilot speed and adoption.","Excessive notifications may cause users to ignore alerts.","External collaboration carries permission risks around internal documents, pricing, and unfinished discussions.","Offline capability for field usage is uncertain and must be technically validated.","Competitors or alternatives include Microsoft 365 and prior project management tools, so Lark must show integrated process value beyond chat and documents."]	["PT Prasetia Dwidharma: Kodrat Santoso to send sanitized examples of current handover templates and weekly project reports within three working days.","PT Prasetia Dwidharma: Kodrat Santoso to propose business workshop participants, targeted by the end of next week.","PT Prasetia Dwidharma: Kodrat Santoso to identify PICs from IT, including Head of IT and infrastructure representative, for the technical session; exact names not yet available.","Virtuenet: Send a minimum data request list for prototype preparation by tomorrow afternoon.","Virtuenet: Prepare draft use cases and fit-gap analysis.","Virtuenet: Build a simple prototype covering handover, project tracking, approval, and AI meeting summary.","Virtuenet: Propose separate agendas for business workshop and technical workshop.","Virtuenet: Prepare a demo storyline showing end-to-end process from opportunity handover through approval, project creation, tracking, meeting summary, dashboard, and mobile approval\\/task update.","Virtuenet: Send meeting summary on the same day for Kodrat's review, especially scope and assumptions."]	["Approved budget or budget range is not available.","Final names of decision makers are not available; only roles were discussed.","Final IT PIC names are not available.","Final pilot scope is not confirmed, especially resource request approval.","Detailed procurement process, commercial evaluation criteria, and vendor registration requirements are not fully available.","Data residency, retention, DLP, and detailed security requirements are not available.","Identity provider and internal directory details are not available.","API, webhook, and integration technical requirements are not fully defined.","Offline capability requirements and Lark technical fit are not validated.","Baseline metrics are not finalized; customer prefers measuring baseline during the first two weeks of pilot.","Actual current templates and sanitized sample data are pending.","Final participant list for business workshop is not available.","CRM, ERP, project system, and automation tool details are not available.","Formal company KPI tied to this initiative is not available."]
4	322	App\\Models\\LeadTranscript	7	neutral	potential	medium	[]	[]	Follow-up	\N	86	2026-08-04 15:37:05	2026-08-04 15:36:00	2026-08-04 15:37:05	Discovery meeting antara PT Prasetia Dwidharma dan Virtuenet membahas evaluasi Lark Suite sebagai platform kolaborasi dan work management untuk memperbaiki keterhubungan proses lintas sales, presales, project management, implementation, finance, procurement, dan support. Tantangan utama saat ini adalah penggunaan banyak channel dan tools yang tidak seragam seperti WhatsApp, email, Google Drive, OneDrive, spreadsheet, aplikasi task management, dan form manual, sehingga handover sales-to-project, project tracking, approval, knowledge management, dan reporting menjadi tidak konsisten, sulit diaudit, dan banyak bergantung pada individu. PT Prasetia Dwidharma tertarik pada pendekatan pilot terbatas, bukan penggantian seluruh tools sekaligus, dengan fokus awal pada structured handover, project tracking, dan kandidat resource request approval, sementara AI meeting summary diposisikan sebagai fitur pendukung dengan review manusia. Belum ada budget disetujui dan keputusan akhir melibatkan director, Head of IT, finance, dan procurement, tetapi terdapat minat kuat untuk melanjutkan ke workshop use case, prototype, fit-gap, dan technical validation.	{"budget":"Belum ada budget range atau budget yang disetujui. Customer masih tahap eksplorasi dan membutuhkan business justification sebelum vendor registration dan evaluasi komersial.","authority":"Kodrat Santoso berperan sebagai champion, evaluator, dan project owner dari sisi use case. Final approval kemungkinan berada pada director terkait dan Head of IT; finance dan procurement akan terlibat pada tahap komersial.","needs":"Kebutuhan utama adalah proses yang lebih terhubung, dapat diaudit, efisien, dan mudah diadopsi untuk sales-to-project handover, project tracking, selected approval, dashboard, knowledge management, dan AI meeting summary yang terkontrol.","timeline":"Target kasar assessment dan desain pilot selesai bulan depan, pilot dapat dimulai setelah itu dalam 1-2 bulan jika mendapat persetujuan internal. Durasi pilot yang dipertimbangkan 6-8 minggu.","competitor":"Belum ada tender formal. Microsoft 365 menjadi referensi karena sebagian user sudah familiar, dan beberapa project management tools pernah dicoba. Evaluasi sebelumnya tidak berlanjut karena adoption tidak konsisten, konfigurasi terlalu banyak, integrasi sulit, atau tidak mencakup approval dan knowledge."}	potential	Lanjutkan ke tahap workshop dan prototype dengan pendekatan outcome-based. Fokuskan demo pada alur end-to-end: opportunity siap handover, structured handover, conditional review, project workspace/template creation, project tracking, resource request approval, AI meeting summary dengan human review, mobile approval/task update, dan dashboard manajemen. Hindari positioning sebagai chat tool atau pengganti seluruh sistem; tekankan governance, auditability, visibility, pengurangan pekerjaan manual, dan adoption. Siapkan fit-gap transparan untuk API, SSO, audit log, permission, AI data handling, offline limitation, dan integration scope. Batasi pilot agar tidak melebar ke core finance, email migration, historical migration, external customer collaboration, full resource planning, atau secret management.	Lanjutkan ke tahap workshop dan prototype dengan pendekatan outcome-based. Fokuskan demo pada alur end-to-end: opportunity siap handover, structured handover, conditional review, project workspace/template creation, project tracking, resource request approval, AI meeting summary dengan human review, mobile approval/task update, dan dashboard manajemen. Hindari positioning sebagai chat tool atau pengganti seluruh sistem; tekankan governance, auditability, visibility, pengurangan pekerjaan manual, dan adoption. Siapkan fit-gap transparan untuk API, SSO, audit log, permission, AI data handling, offline limitation, dan integration scope. Batasi pilot agar tidak melebar ke core f