4	1	322	transcript_evaluation_raw	{"transcript_id":7,"raw_content":"{\\"general_sections_json\\":{\\"executive_summary\\":\\"PT Prasetia Dwidharma, represented by Kodrat Santoso as Project Manager, is evaluating Lark Suite through a limited pilot rather than a full replacement of existing tools. The main operational issues are fragmented communication and documents across WhatsApp, email, Google Drive, OneDrive, spreadsheets, and inconsistent task tools, causing weak handover from sales to project delivery, poor version control, manual reporting, unclear approvals, and limited management visibility. The strongest near-term pilot candidates are sales-to-project handover, project tracking, and resource request approval, with AI meeting summary as a supporting accelerator subject to review and security validation. The customer showed strong interest in an outcome-based prototype and emphasized governance, auditability, ease of adoption, mobile usability, realistic offline limitations, and technical validation with IT before any broader rollout.\\",\\"overall_sentiment\\":{\\"positive\\":70,\\"neutral\\":25,\\"negative\\":5},\\"key_pain_points\\":[\\"Sales-to-project handover is fragmented across chat, email, folders, and documents, causing incomplete context and delayed kickoff.\\",\\"Project tracking and weekly reporting are inconsistent and manual, requiring consolidation from multiple files and formats.\\",\\"Approval processes are scattered across email, chat, forms, and manual workflows, making audit trails and turnaround time difficult to manage.\\",\\"Document versioning issues occur frequently for proposals, SOWs, project plans, meeting minutes, and UAT documents.\\",\\"Knowledge and historical project information are difficult to find, creating dependency on individuals and repeated clarification.\\"],\\"customer_needs\\":[\\"Structured project tracking and handover with templates, required fields, status control, and automated project workspace creation.\\",\\"Internal approval workflow with conditional routing, audit trail, mobile approval, configurable escalation, and clear decision history.\\",\\"Governed knowledge management with metadata, searchable documents, permission-aware search, and consistent templates.\\",\\"Dashboards for project health, overdue tasks, blockers, milestones, resource load, project risk, and management visibility.\\",\\"Pilot approach that is simple for users, measurable, internally scoped, and focused on business outcomes rather than feature breadth.\\"],\\"key_discussions\\":[\\"Current collaboration landscape includes WhatsApp, email, Google Drive, OneDrive, spreadsheets, non-uniform task tools, and manual forms.\\",\\"Priority use cases were narrowed to structured handover through project execution, selected approval workflows, and AI meeting summary as a supporting feature.\\",\\"Security, permission design, guest access, data classification, audit logs, SSO, AI data handling, and integration capabilities require separate technical validation with IT.\\",\\"Pilot scope should avoid overreach, including no payroll, core finance, secret management, full historical document migration, email migration, or full resource capacity planning.\\",\\"Success metrics discussed include reduced weekly reporting time, reduced meeting minutes administration, improved handover completeness, overdue action visibility, user adoption, approval turnaround time, and reduced post-kickoff clarification.\\"],\\"decisions_agreements\\":[\\"PT Prasetia Dwidharma will evaluate Lark Suite through a limited pilot, not as an immediate replacement of all existing tools.\\",\\"Proposed pilot scope includes sales-to-project handover, project tracking, and resource request approval, with resource request still subject to validation with the resource manager.\\",\\"AI meeting summary will be positioned as a supporting feature with human review before creating tasks or updating records.\\",\\"Initial pilot will be internal only, without customer guest access in the first phase.\\",\\"Business workshop and technical workshop will be separated; business stakeholders will review use cases\\\\\\/prototype, while IT will validate security, API, SSO, and integration topics.\\"]},\\"meeting_type_sections_json\\":{\\"discovery_objectives\\":\\"Understand PT Prasetia Dwidharma's current collaboration and project delivery processes, identify high-value use cases for Lark Suite, define a realistic pilot scope, and gather requirements for a prototype and follow-up workshops.\\",\\"current_state\\":[\\"Communication relies heavily on WhatsApp for quick coordination and email for formal communication.\\",\\"Documents are spread across Google Drive and OneDrive depending on division.\\",\\"Work tracking uses spreadsheets and some task management tools, but practices are not standardized.\\",\\"Approvals happen through email, chat, forms, and manual processes.\\",\\"Project reporting is manually consolidated weekly across multiple files and inconsistent formats.\\"],\\"business_challenges\\":[\\"Information continuity breaks between sales, presales, implementation, finance, procurement, and support teams.\\",\\"Project kickoff can be delayed due to incomplete handover documents and unclear scope alignment.\\",\\"Management lacks easy, consistent visibility into project health, risks, blockers, pipeline, and potential delays.\\",\\"Approval evidence is difficult to retrieve for audits or monthly review.\\",\\"Adoption risk is high if the new system creates extra steps or duplicates spreadsheet work.\\"],\\"priority_use_cases\\":[\\"Sales-to-project handover with required information, technical scope confirmation, PM acceptance or return for completion, and conditional finance involvement.\\",\\"Project tracking with milestones, tasks, owner, due date, status, risks, issues, weekly updates, dashboards, and rule-based project health.\\",\\"Resource request approval with project, role, skill, personnel count, start date, estimated duration, location, allocation type, urgency, routing, and manual availability verification for pilot.\\",\\"AI meeting summary for summaries, decisions, pain points, action items, PIC, due dates, and recommendations with user review before automation.\\",\\"Mobile approval and task update for field and mobile users.\\"],\\"desired_outcomes\\":[\\"More connected and auditable end-to-end project processes.\\",\\"Reduced manual consolidation for reporting and meeting minutes.\\",\\"Improved handover completeness before project execution begins.\\",\\"Clearer approval ownership, status, routing, turnaround time, and evidence trail.\\",\\"Improved user adoption through role-based onboarding and simple workflows.\\"],\\"pilot_scope\\":{\\"estimated_users\\":\\"Approximately 40-60 users in total, with 20-30 core users and the remainder as approvers or stakeholders.\\",\\"pilot_duration\\":\\"6-8 weeks under consideration; 6 weeks minimum and 8 weeks considered ideal depending on effort and cost.\\",\\"pilot_users\\":[\\"Project management team\\",\\"Presales representatives\\",\\"Selected sales users\\",\\"Finance approvers\\",\\"Resource manager or related stakeholder, subject to validation\\"],\\"initial_scope\\":[\\"Sales-to-project handover\\",\\"Project tracking\\",\\"Resource request approval, subject to validation\\",\\"AI meeting summary as supporting accelerator\\",\\"Mobile approval and task update\\"],\\"out_of_scope\\":[\\"Payroll\\",\\"Core finance replacement\\",\\"Customer credential management or secret management\\",\\"Full historical document migration\\",\\"Full resource capacity planning\\",\\"Email migration\\",\\"Direct customer guest collaboration in first pilot\\"]},\\"success_metrics\\":[\\"Reduction in time to prepare weekly project reports.\\",\\"Reduction in time to prepare and administer meeting minutes.\\",\\"Handover completeness percentage based on required fields and documents.\\",\\"Time from closed-won or handover initiation to project accepted.\\",\\"Number of handovers returned for completion and number of clarifications after kickoff.\\",\\"Visibility of overdue actions, blockers, and approval delays.\\",\\"Approval turnaround time.\\",\\"User adoption, active users, and whether users revert to old tools.\\"],\\"stakeholders\\":{\\"champion_or_evaluator\\":\\"Kodrat Santoso, Project Manager, PT Prasetia Dwidharma.\\",\\"decision_makers\\":\\"Likely related director and Head of IT; final decision not made in this meeting.\\",\\"commercial_stakeholders\\":\\"Finance and procurement will participate in commercial stage.\\",\\"technical_stakeholders\\":\\"Head of IT and one infrastructure representative to be confirmed.\\",\\"business_workshop_participants\\":\\"Sales, presales, project management, resource manager, and finance approver; approximately 6-8 people.\\"},\\"technical_requirements\\":[\\"APIs for Base, Approval, Messenger, Calendar, and Documents need to be assessed.\\",\\"Open Platform, bot, webhook, and integration patterns should be covered in technical session.\\",\\"Potential integrations include email, calendar, internal CRM, project system, and ERP, but not all are required for phase one.\\",\\"SSO is important for long-term use; pilot may use manual provisioning if user count remains manageable.\\",\\"Offline capabilities must be validated and should not be assumed as fully available.\\"],\\"security_and_compliance_requirements\\":[\\"Audit logs are important.\\",\\"Data residency, retention, and DLP require IT\\\\\\/security involvement before decisions can be made.\\",\\"Permission-aware search is required, especially for sensitive chat or document content.\\",\\"External collaboration requires strict access controls by folder or document and easy access revocation after contract completion.\\",\\"Sensitive data includes pricing, margin, contracts, certain customer data, and technical credentials; credentials should remain in a secret manager.\\",\\"AI data handling must be explained, including processing location, provider storage, and available controls.\\"],\\"adoption_and_enablement_requirements\\":[\\"Pilot must be simple from day one and avoid overwhelming users with too many modules.\\",\\"Training should be role-based for project managers, sales, approvers, and general users.\\",\\"Indonesian user guides and short videos are preferred over a single long document.\\",\\"At least 2-3 internal admins should be trained to manage workflows and reduce vendor dependency.\\",\\"Support expectations include a support channel, SLA for critical issues, and help with minor workflow changes.\\"],\\"missing_information\\":[\\"Approved budget range is not available.\\",\\"Final decision makers' participation and approval process details are not fully confirmed.\\",\\"Specific Head of IT and infrastructure PIC names are not yet available.\\",\\"Exact data residency, retention, DLP, and AI governance requirements are not available pending IT\\\\\\/security review.\\",\\"Exact pilot start date is not committed.\\",\\"Final resource request pilot scope requires validation with the resource manager.\\",\\"Actual template samples are pending and will be sanitized before sharing.\\"]},\\"bantc_json\\":{\\"budget\\":\\"No approved budget yet. Customer is still in exploration stage and needs a business justification focused on time efficiency, governance, and operational improvement before procurement and commercial evaluation.\\",\\"authority\\":\\"Kodrat Santoso is the champion\\\\\\/evaluator and likely project owner for the use case. Final approval is expected from the related director and Head of IT, with finance and procurement involved during the commercial stage.\\",\\"needs\\":\\"Strong need for connected project workflows, sales-to-project handover, project tracking, approval auditability, knowledge management, management dashboards, mobile usability, role-based adoption, and controlled automation with AI review.\\",\\"timeline\\":\\"Customer hopes assessment and pilot design can finish next month if approved, with pilot potentially starting afterward. Rough target is 1-2 months, but not a committed date. Pilot duration under consideration is 6-8 weeks.\\",\\"competitor\\":\\"Microsoft 365 is a natural reference because some users are familiar with it. Several project management tools have also been tried previously, but adoption, configuration complexity, integration difficulty, or limited coverage of approval and knowledge management prevented broader continuation.\\"},\\"score_updates_json\\":{\\"lead_score\\":78,\\"eligibility_status\\":\\"potential\\",\\"confidence\\":88}}"}	2026-08-04 15:36:00
5	1	322	transcript_evaluation_raw	{"transcript_id":7,"raw_content":"{\\"general_sections_json\\":{\\"executive_summary\\":\\"Discovery meeting antara PT Prasetia Dwidharma dan Virtuenet membahas evaluasi Lark Suite sebagai platform kolaborasi dan work management untuk memperbaiki keterhubungan proses lintas sales, presales, project management, implementation, finance, procurement, dan support. Tantangan utama saat ini adalah penggunaan banyak channel dan tools yang tidak seragam seperti WhatsApp, email, Google Drive, OneDrive, spreadsheet, aplikasi task management, dan form manual, sehingga handover sales-to-project, project tracking, approval, knowledge management, dan reporting menjadi tidak konsisten, sulit diaudit, dan banyak bergantung pada individu. PT Prasetia Dwidharma tertarik pada pendekatan pilot terbatas, bukan penggantian seluruh tools sekaligus, dengan fokus awal pada structured handover, project tracking, dan kandidat resource request approval, sementara AI meeting summary diposisikan sebagai fitur pendukung dengan review manusia. Belum ada budget disetujui dan keputusan akhir melibatkan director, Head of IT, finance, dan procurement, tetapi terdapat minat kuat untuk melanjutkan ke workshop use case, prototype, fit-gap, dan technical validation.\\",\\"overall_sentiment\\":{\\"positive\\":68,\\"neutral\\":25,\\"negative\\":7},\\"key_pain_points\\":[\\"Informasi proses bisnis tersebar di WhatsApp, email, Drive, OneDrive, spreadsheet, aplikasi task management, dan form manual sehingga tidak ada single source of truth.\\",\\"Sales-to-project handover sering tidak lengkap, versi dokumen tidak konsisten, dan keputusan penting hanya tersimpan di percakapan chat.\\",\\"Project reporting dan dashboard manajemen masih dikonsolidasi manual dari beberapa file dengan format yang tidak seragam.\\",\\"Approval internal seperti resource request, procurement, business trip, reimbursement, dan dokumen komersial mudah tercecer serta sulit diaudit.\\",\\"Knowledge project lama, lesson learned, template, proposal, dan keputusan teknis sulit ditemukan karena naming convention dan klasifikasi tidak konsisten.\\"],\\"customer_needs\\":[\\"Pilot terbatas yang berorientasi outcome untuk structured handover, project tracking, approval, auditability, dan efisiensi waktu.\\",\\"Template project otomatis berdasarkan kategori project seperti implementation, managed service, integration, dan proof of concept.\\",\\"Dashboard project health dan manajemen yang menampilkan status, progress, overdue task, blocker, milestone, resource load, project berisiko, dan isu customer.\\",\\"Approval workflow dengan conditional routing, audit trail, notifikasi, escalation, dan dukungan mobile.\\",\\"Security, permission, SSO, audit log, API, webhook, external collaboration control, dan AI data handling yang perlu divalidasi bersama tim IT.\\"],\\"key_discussions\\":[\\"Current state kolaborasi dan operasional masih fragmented, dengan workflow berpindah antar aplikasi dan channel.\\",\\"Prioritas 3-6 bulan adalah project tracking dan handover, approval internal, knowledge management, dan AI meeting summary sebagai kebutuhan lanjutan.\\",\\"Pilot disarankan internal-only dengan sekitar 40-60 user, 20-30 core user, dan onboarding dalam dua gelombang.\\",\\"Success metrics mencakup pengurangan waktu weekly report, meeting minutes, approval turnaround time, kelengkapan handover, overdue visibility, action item ownership, dan adoption.\\",\\"Scope, out-of-scope, stakeholder, technical validation, prototype, dan workshop lanjutan dibahas untuk menghindari pilot yang terlalu luas.\\"],\\"decisions_agreements\\":[\\"PT Prasetia Dwidharma akan mengevaluasi Lark Suite melalui pilot terbatas, bukan mengganti seluruh aplikasi sekaligus.\\",\\"Proposed pilot scope mencakup sales-to-project handover, project tracking, dan resource request approval yang masih subject to validation dengan resource manager.\\",\\"AI meeting summary menjadi supporting feature dengan mekanisme human review sebelum membuat task atau memperbarui record.\\",\\"Pilot awal dilakukan internal tanpa melibatkan customer sebagai guest atau external collaborator.\\",\\"Security, API, SSO, integration, AI data handling, dan data residency\\\\\\/retention akan dibahas pada sesi teknis terpisah bersama Head of IT dan infrastructure.\\"]},\\"meeting_type_sections_json\\":{\\"discovery_objectives\\":[\\"Memahami cara kerja lintas tim PT Prasetia Dwidharma dan tantangan operasional utama.\\",\\"Mengidentifikasi use case Lark Suite yang paling relevan dan layak dijadikan pilot.\\",\\"Menyepakati batasan awal pilot, success metrics, stakeholder yang perlu dilibatkan, dan next step workshop\\\\\\/prototype.\\"],\\"current_state\\":{\\"collaboration_tools\\":[\\"WhatsApp untuk komunikasi cepat\\",\\"Email untuk komunikasi formal\\",\\"Google Drive dan OneDrive untuk dokumen tergantung divisi\\",\\"Spreadsheet dan aplikasi task management yang tidak seragam untuk tracking pekerjaan\\",\\"Email, chat, dan form manual untuk approval\\"],\\"process_maturity\\":\\"Tahapan project secara konsep sudah ada seperti initiation, planning, execution, monitoring, UAT, handover, dan closing, tetapi implementasi belum seragam antar project manager dan antar project.\\",\\"operational_context\\":\\"Sebagian tim bekerja dari kantor, sebagian mobile, dan sebagian berada di lokasi pelanggan; proses melibatkan sales, presales, implementation, finance, procurement, customer support, dan project management.\\"},\\"discovered_challenges\\":[\\"Tidak ada single source of truth untuk dokumen, keputusan, status, dan konteks project.\\",\\"Handover dari sales ke project manager membutuhkan pengumpulan ulang informasi dari chat, proposal, dokumen teknis, dan folder berbeda.\\",\\"Version control bermasalah pada proposal, scope of work, project plan, meeting minutes, dan UAT document.\\",\\"Approval tidak konsisten dan sulit diaudit karena request bisa masuk melalui form, email, atau chat.\\",\\"Reporting manajemen membutuhkan konsolidasi manual mingguan dari berbagai file dan format.\\"],\\"priority_use_cases\\":[{\\"use_case\\":\\"Sales-to-Project Handover\\",\\"priority\\":\\"High\\",\\"notes\\":\\"Sales submit data terstruktur, presales confirm technical scope, project manager accept atau return handover, dan setelah accepted sistem membuat project workspace\\\\\\/record berdasarkan template.\\"},{\\"use_case\\":\\"Project Tracking\\",\\"priority\\":\\"High\\",\\"notes\\":\\"Project memiliki milestone, task, owner, due date, status, risk, issue, weekly update, dan dashboard project health berbasis rule serta data aktual.\\"},{\\"use_case\\":\\"Resource Request Approval\\",\\"priority\\":\\"Medium-High\\",\\"notes\\":\\"Kandidat kuat tetapi perlu validasi dengan resource manager; availability pada pilot diverifikasi manual, bukan full capacity planning.\\"},{\\"use_case\\":\\"AI Meeting Summary\\",\\"priority\\":\\"Medium\\",\\"notes\\":\\"Diposisikan sebagai accelerator untuk summary, decision, action item, PIC, due date, dan recommendation dengan review manusia sebelum update task\\\\\\/record.\\"}],\\"pilot_scope\\":[\\"Structured sales-to-project handover sampai project execution.\\",\\"Project workspace\\\\\\/record dan project tracking dengan template, milestone, task, risk, issue, blocker, dan dashboard.\\",\\"Selected internal approval, terutama resource request approval jika tervalidasi.\\",\\"AI meeting summary sebagai fitur pendukung.\\",\\"Mobile experience minimal untuk approval dan task update.\\"],\\"out_of_scope\\":[\\"Payroll\\",\\"Core finance replacement\\",\\"Customer credential management atau secret management\\",\\"Full historical document migration\\",\\"Full resource capacity planning\\",\\"Email migration\\",\\"Customer external access pada pilot pertama\\",\\"Full offline capability sebelum technical validation\\"],\\"success_metrics\\":[\\"Pengurangan waktu pembuatan weekly project report.\\",\\"Pengurangan waktu administrasi meeting minutes.\\",\\"Peningkatan kelengkapan handover.\\",\\"Waktu dari closed-won ke project accepted.\\",\\"Jumlah clarification setelah kickoff.\\",\\"Visibility terhadap overdue action dan blocker.\\",\\"Approval turnaround time.\\",\\"User adoption dan persentase proses yang benar-benar berjalan di platform.\\"],\\"stakeholders_identified\\":{\\"champion_evaluator\\":\\"Kodrat Santoso, Project Manager, PT Prasetia Dwidharma\\",\\"decision_makers\\":\\"Director terkait dan Head of IT\\",\\"commercial_stakeholders\\":\\"Finance dan procurement pada tahap komersial\\",\\"technical_stakeholders\\":\\"Head of IT dan satu orang dari infrastructure, nama belum dikonfirmasi\\",\\"business_workshop_participants\\":\\"Perwakilan sales, presales, project management, resource manager, dan finance approver\\"},\\"technical_and_security_requirements\\":[\\"SSO penting untuk jangka panjang.\\",\\"Audit log penting untuk review dan audit keputusan.\\",\\"Data residency, retention, dan DLP perlu dibahas bersama IT\\\\\\/security.\\",\\"API untuk Base, Approval, Messenger, Calendar, dan Documents perlu dievaluasi.\\",\\"Open Platform, bot, webhook, dan integration pattern perlu dibahas di sesi teknis.\\",\\"Permission harus mendukung department dan matrix project access.\\",\\"Search harus mengikuti permission sumber, terutama untuk dokumen dan percakapan sensitif.\\",\\"AI data processing, storage, dan control perlu dijelaskan sebelum menggunakan data customer sensitif.\\"],\\"missing_information\\":[\\"Budget range belum tersedia atau disetujui.\\",\\"Nama final Head of IT\\\\\\/infrastructure PIC belum dikonfirmasi.\\",\\"Target implementasi belum committed, hanya estimasi 1-2 bulan jika disetujui internal.\\",\\"Data residency, retention, DLP, dan detail identity provider belum divalidasi.\\",\\"Final resource request approval scope belum dikonfirmasi oleh resource manager.\\",\\"Contoh template handover dan weekly project report belum diterima.\\",\\"Capability offline Lark belum divalidasi secara teknis.\\"]},\\"bantc_json\\":{\\"budget\\":\\"Belum ada budget range atau budget yang disetujui. Customer masih tahap eksplorasi dan membutuhkan business justification sebelum vendor registration dan evaluasi komersial.\\",\\"authority\\":\\"Kodrat Santoso berperan sebagai champion, evaluator, dan project owner dari sisi use case. Final approval kemungkinan berada pada director terkait dan Head of IT; finance dan procurement akan terlibat pada tahap komersial.\\",\\"needs\\":\\"Kebutuhan utama adalah proses yang lebih terhubung, dapat diaudit, efisien, dan mudah diadopsi untuk sales-to-project handover, project tracking, selected approval, dashboard, knowledge management, dan AI meeting summary yang terkontrol.\\",\\"timeline\\":\\"Target kasar assessment dan desain pilot selesai bulan depan, pilot dapat dimulai setelah itu dalam 1-2 bulan jika mendapat persetujuan internal. Durasi pilot yang dipertimbangkan 6-8 minggu.\\",\\"competitor\\":\\"Belum ada tender formal. Microsoft 365 menjadi referensi karena sebagian user sudah familiar, dan beberapa project management tools pernah dicoba. Evaluasi sebelumnya tidak berlanjut karena adoption tidak konsisten, konfigurasi terlalu banyak, integrasi sulit, atau tidak mencakup approval dan knowledge.\\"},\\"score_updates_json\\":{\\"lead_score\\":78,\\"eligibility_status\\":\\"potential\\",\\"confidence\\":86}}"}	2026-08-04 15:37:05
