9	1	322	transcript_evaluation_raw	{"transcript_id":13,"raw_content":"{\\"general_sections_json\\":{\\"executive_summary\\":\\"Virtuenet conducted a 60-minute Lark Suite demo for PT Prasetia Dwidharma focused on an end-to-end project delivery workflow using Lark Base, Messenger, Calendar, Automation, Task, Dashboard, and related approval concepts. The customer responded positively, especially to Lark Base as a centralized project data hub, Automation for task templates\\\\\\/reminders\\\\\\/escalations, and Dashboard for operational and management visibility with drill-down. The opportunity shows high interest, but the customer emphasized that any pilot decision remains subject to technical validation, security review, permission\\\\\\/governance design, and a clear source-of-truth decision for project tasks.\\",\\"overall_sentiment\\":{\\"positive\\":75,\\"neutral\\":20,\\"negative\\":5},\\"key_pain_points\\":[\\"Project handover is often incomplete, requiring project managers to manually check documents and scope details.\\",\\"Project managers want to avoid repeated data entry across task, calendar, and dashboard tools.\\",\\"Current visibility into overdue tasks and risks is delayed, often only appearing during weekly meetings.\\",\\"Decisions and issue discussions can be scattered in chat channels and not connected to project records.\\",\\"The customer is concerned that flexible tools may become difficult to govern without admin controls, permissions, and change management.\\"],\\"customer_needs\\":[\\"A centralized project management data model covering handover, project master, tasks, risks\\\\\\/issues, resources, and weekly updates.\\",\\"Automation for handover review, task template generation, reminders, escalation, and weekly update follow-up.\\",\\"Operational and management dashboards with drill-down, transparent project health rules, data freshness indicators, and permission controls.\\",\\"Clear security, permission, audit log, user lifecycle, external sharing, retention, backup, recovery, and AI data processing validation.\\",\\"A limited tailored prototype and hands-on trial before any final pilot recommendation.\\"],\\"key_discussions\\":[\\"Demo scenario covered request intake, handover, project provisioning, team coordination, scheduling, approval, task management, escalation, and dashboard monitoring.\\",\\"Lark Base was positioned as the primary project data hub, with relationships across Project Request, Project Master, Project Task, Risk and Issue, Resource Request, and Weekly Update tables.\\",\\"The team discussed whether project tasks should live in Lark Task native or Lark Base, agreeing that source of truth must be decided before the pilot.\\",\\"Formal approvals should use Lark Approval where auditability and approver chains are required, while Base can remain the tracking and orchestration layer.\\",\\"Security, permission, notification governance, integration design, admin governance, and data freshness were repeatedly raised as prerequisites for scale-up.\\"],\\"decisions_agreements\\":[\\"Customer agreed to proceed toward a tailored prototype, subject to security and technical validation.\\",\\"Proposed pilot scope includes project handover, project provisioning, task template generation, weekly updates, dashboards, and project handover approval.\\",\\"Full historical migration, ERP integration, company-wide rollout, and full SSO implementation are out of scope for the initial pilot.\\",\\"Business Design Workshop and Technical\\\\\\/Security Workshop will be scheduled as separate sessions.\\",\\"Pilot decision is not final; opportunity status is high interest with technical validation required and pilot scope under discussion.\\"]},\\"meeting_type_sections_json\\":{\\"features_demonstrated\\":[\\"Lark Base for project delivery management data structure, linked records, formulas, views, permissions, and dashboards.\\",\\"Automation for notifications, task template creation, reminders, escalation, weekly update follow-up, and status updates.\\",\\"Dashboard for project health, active projects, overdue tasks, risks, completion, filters, and drill-down to actionable records.\\",\\"Messenger and Calendar for contextual notifications, message cards, project communication, kickoff scheduling, availability, and reminders.\\",\\"Task management options using Lark Task native versus task tracking in Base, including owners, due dates, status, blockers, and dependencies.\\"],\\"customer_reactions\\":[\\"Base received the strongest positive response as a central hub for project data and tracking.\\",\\"Automation was rated highly for reducing manual work through task templates, reminders, and escalation.\\",\\"Dashboard was strongly valued, especially for operational drill-down and project health visibility.\\",\\"Messenger and Calendar were seen as important supporting layers, but with governance concerns around notification overload and source-of-truth design.\\",\\"ICT considered the platform relevant but required security validation, permission design, auditability, and admin governance before pilot approval.\\"],\\"questions_objections\\":[\\"Whether view filters are security controls; clarified that permissions must be configured separately from views.\\",\\"Whether automation has logs and how failures, external API credentials, and middleware logging should be handled.\\",\\"Whether Calendar and Base can synchronize two-way; customer preferred a clear source-of-truth approach to avoid conflicts.\\",\\"Whether Lark Task native and Base task tracking can coexist; customer raised concern about dual task systems confusing users.\\",\\"Whether business-day SLA calculation, GPS capture, dashboard export, audit log export, backup\\\\\\/recovery, and external sharing controls are supported; these remain validation items.\\"],\\"key_takeaways\\":[\\"The customer has high interest in Lark Suite for project collaboration and project governance, especially Base, Automation, and Dashboard.\\",\\"Technical and security validation are mandatory before trial and pilot decision.\\",\\"Task source of truth is a critical design decision for the pilot.\\",\\"The customer wants a tailored prototype with real-like process templates rather than a generic demo environment.\\",\\"Indicative internal recommendation timeline is three to four weeks after prototype and workshops, but not a formal commitment.\\"]},\\"bantc_json\\":{\\"budget\\":\\"Not available. Customer requested pilot cost and license options to be explained separately from implementation, optional integration, and support.\\",\\"authority\\":\\"Kodrat Santoso and Andri Afriansyah participated as Project Managers; Arifia Mulia participated as Head of ICT and is influential for security, governance, and technical approval. Final decision authority and procurement approver are not fully confirmed.\\",\\"needs\\":\\"Centralized project tracking, standardized handover, task and weekly update automation, operational dashboards, contextual notifications, approval governance, mobile updates, and strong security\\\\\\/permission controls.\\",\\"timeline\\":\\"Indicative internal recommendation in three to four weeks after prototype and workshops; possible pilot start next month pending approval, scope, governance, provisioning, and data readiness.\\",\\"competitor\\":\\"Not available.\\"},\\"score_updates_json\\":{\\"lead_score\\":82,\\"eligibility_status\\":\\"potential\\",\\"confidence\\":90}}"}	2026-08-08 03:12:06
10	1	322	transcript_evaluation_raw	{"transcript_id":13,"raw_content":"{\\"general_sections_json\\":{\\"executive_summary\\":\\"Virtuenet conducted a 60-minute end-to-end Lark Suite demo for PT Prasetia Dwidharma focused on project delivery management using Lark Base, Messenger, Calendar, Automation, Task, Dashboard, and handover approval concepts. The customer responded positively, especially to Base as a project data hub, Automation for task creation\\\\\\/reminders\\\\\\/escalation, and Dashboard for operational and management visibility. Interest is high and the team agreed to proceed toward a tailored prototype, but pilot approval is not final and remains dependent on technical\\\\\\/security validation, permission design, task source-of-truth decisions, and governance clarity.\\",\\"overall_sentiment\\":{\\"positive\\":75,\\"neutral\\":20,\\"negative\\":5},\\"key_pain_points\\":[\\"Project handovers are often incomplete, requiring PMs to manually check documents and scope details.\\",\\"Project managers want to avoid duplicate data entry across task, calendar, and dashboard tools.\\",\\"Current task delays may only become visible during weekly meetings.\\",\\"Important decisions and issue context are often lost in separate chat channels such as WhatsApp.\\",\\"Governance risks exist if Base, permissions, automation, and admin rights are not controlled.\\"],\\"customer_needs\\":[\\"Centralized project tracking for handover, project master data, tasks, risks, weekly updates, and dashboards.\\",\\"Clear source-of-truth design for project tasks, milestones, calendar data, and reporting.\\",\\"Role-based permissions, auditability, admin governance, and security validation before trial or pilot.\\",\\"Action-oriented dashboards with drill-down into overdue tasks, risks, blockers, and milestones.\\",\\"Tailored prototype and limited hands-on trial for selected project managers before final recommendation.\\"],\\"key_discussions\\":[\\"Demo followed an end-to-end project workflow from request intake, handover review, project creation, task template generation, reminders, escalation, dashboard monitoring, and approval.\\",\\"Base relationships, formulas, views, permissions, dashboards, and linked project records were discussed as the foundation for project management.\\",\\"Automation use cases included record notifications, task template creation, overdue reminders, escalation, weekly update reminders, and conditional approval routing.\\",\\"ICT concerns centered on tenant security, encryption, audit logs, data retention, external sharing, permission model, user lifecycle, API authentication, AI data processing, backup, and recovery.\\",\\"Pilot boundaries were discussed, including excluding full historical migration, ERP integration, company-wide rollout, and full SSO implementation during the initial pilot.\\"],\\"decisions_agreements\\":[\\"Customer agreed there is high interest in continuing to a tailored prototype, subject to technical and security validation.\\",\\"Proposed pilot scope includes project handover, project provisioning, task template generation, weekly update, dashboards, project handover approval, mobile task\\\\\\/approval views, and role-based demonstration.\\",\\"Project handover approval was selected as the proposed initial approval use case for pilot, while resource request approval may be a later phase.\\",\\"Task source of truth between Lark Task native and project tasks in Base must be decided in a design workshop.\\",\\"Business Design Workshop will be planned for 90 minutes and Technical\\\\\\/Security Workshop for 60 minutes, with two schedule options requested.\\"]},\\"meeting_type_sections_json\\":{\\"features_demonstrated\\":[\\"Lark Base for Project Delivery Management tables, linked records, formulas, views, permissions, and dashboards.\\",\\"Automation for project request notifications, task template generation, reminders, escalation, weekly updates, and status updates.\\",\\"Dashboard for project health KPIs, PM operational view, management view, drill-down, and data freshness considerations.\\",\\"Messenger and Calendar integration for contextual notifications, message cards, kickoff scheduling, availability checks, reminders, and project communication.\\",\\"Task and approval scenarios covering project task tracking, task dependencies, mobile updates, formal handover approval, and conditional routing.\\"],\\"customer_reactions\\":[\\"Base received the strongest positive response as a central project data and tracking layer.\\",\\"Automation was rated highly because it can reduce manual work through task templates, reminders, escalation, and status orchestration.\\",\\"Dashboard was strongly valued, especially drill-down from charts into actionable task, risk, and milestone records.\\",\\"Messenger and Calendar were seen as useful supporting layers but require notification governance and clear source-of-truth decisions.\\",\\"ICT viewed the platform as relevant but emphasized that security, permission design, auditability, and admin governance must be validated before pilot approval.\\"],\\"questions_objections\\":[\\"Whether Base views are security controls; clarified that filters are only display controls and permissions must be used for security.\\",\\"Whether automation has logs, error handling, and secure credential management for integrations; custom integration should use middleware and secret management.\\",\\"Whether task management should use native Lark Task or Base; customer objected to having two competing task systems.\\",\\"Whether Calendar and Base should synchronize two-way; customer preferred a clear source-of-truth approach to avoid conflicts.\\",\\"Whether dashboard data can include ERP revenue\\\\\\/billing and remain fresh; ERP integration was deferred and data freshness indicators were requested.\\"],\\"key_takeaways\\":[\\"Meeting outcome was positive and productive, with high interest but no final pilot approval yet.\\",\\"Highest-interest areas are Lark Base, Automation, and Dashboard.\\",\\"Primary blockers are technical validation, security validation, source-of-truth design, and governance model definition.\\",\\"Pilot should remain focused and exclude ERP integration, full historical migration, company-wide rollout, and full SSO implementation during the initial phase.\\",\\"Customer expects a tailored prototype, limited hands-on trial, and separated proposal for license, implementation, optional integration, and support.\\"]},\\"bantc_json\\":{\\"budget\\":\\"No budget amount disclosed. Customer requested pilot cost and license options to be explained separately from implementation, optional integration, and support.\\",\\"authority\\":\\"Kodrat Santoso and Andri Afriansyah are project management stakeholders; Arifia Mulia as Head of ICT is a key technical\\\\\\/security authority. Additional internal stakeholders must be involved before pilot decision.\\",\\"needs\\":\\"Centralized project delivery management, handover governance, automated task templates\\\\\\/reminders\\\\\\/escalation, operational and management dashboards, formal handover approval, mobile access, permission governance, auditability, and security validation.\\",\\"timeline\\":\\"Prototype can be drafted 5-7 working days after minimum data is received. Indicative internal recommendation target is 3-4 weeks after workshops\\\\\\/prototype; potential pilot start next month pending approval and readiness.\\",\\"competitor\\":\\"Not available\\"},\\"score_updates_json\\":{\\"lead_score\\":82,\\"eligibility_status\\":\\"potential\\",\\"confidence\\":88}}"}	2026-08-08 03:13:18
11	1	322	transcript_evaluation_raw	{"transcript_id":14,"raw_content":"{\\"general_sections_json\\":{\\"executive_summary\\":\\"PT Prasetia Dwidharma sedang mengevaluasi Lark Suite sebagai platform kolaborasi dan work management melalui pendekatan pilot terbatas, bukan penggantian seluruh aplikasi sekaligus. Tantangan utama yang diungkapkan adalah informasi kerja yang tersebar di WhatsApp, email, Google Drive\\\\\\/OneDrive, spreadsheet, task tools, dan form manual sehingga proses sales-to-project handover, project tracking, approval, reporting, dan knowledge management menjadi tidak konsisten, sulit diaudit, dan bergantung pada individu. Prioritas 3\\\\u20136 bulan adalah project tracking dan handover, approval internal, serta knowledge management; AI meeting summary dianggap menarik sebagai fitur pendukung setelah data dasar lebih rapi. Kesepakatan awal mengarah pada pilot internal 6\\\\u20138 minggu untuk handover terstruktur, project tracking, dan kandidat resource request approval, dengan prototype sederhana, workshop bisnis, serta sesi teknis terpisah untuk security, API, SSO, integration, AI data controls, dan batasan offline.\\",\\"overall_sentiment\\":{\\"positive\\":65,\\"neutral\\":30,\\"negative\\":5},\\"key_pain_points\\":[\\"Informasi project tersebar di banyak channel dan tools sehingga tidak ada single source of truth.\\",\\"Sales-to-project handover sering tidak lengkap, berbeda versi dokumen, dan keputusan penting tertinggal di percakapan WhatsApp.\\",\\"Project reporting dan dashboard masih disusun manual dari beberapa file dengan format yang tidak seragam.\\",\\"Approval internal tersebar melalui email, chat, form manual, dan membutuhkan audit trail yang lebih jelas.\\",\\"Adoption tools sebelumnya tidak konsisten karena terlalu kompleks, terlalu banyak konfigurasi, atau tidak menyelesaikan proses end-to-end.\\"],\\"customer_needs\\":[\\"Platform yang menyatukan proses handover, project execution, approval, dokumen, task, komunikasi, dan dashboard secara end-to-end.\\",\\"Template project yang fleksibel untuk implementation, managed service, integration, dan proof of concept, termasuk task, milestone, folder, dokumen, dan PIC awal.\\",\\"Approval workflow dengan conditional routing, audit trail, notifikasi, escalation, dan mobile experience.\\",\\"Dashboard project health, overdue task, blocker, upcoming milestone, resource load, active projects, risk, dan customer issue.\\",\\"Governance, permission control, security review, SSO, audit log, API\\\\\\/webhook, serta data classification untuk dokumen sensitif.\\"],\\"key_discussions\\":[\\"Current state menggunakan WhatsApp, email, Google Drive\\\\\\/OneDrive, spreadsheet, task management berbeda-beda, dan form manual.\\",\\"Prioritas use case pilot mencakup sales-to-project handover, project tracking, dan resource request approval; AI meeting summary sebagai accelerator\\\\\\/supporting feature.\\",\\"Scope pilot awal sebaiknya internal tanpa customer guest, dengan 40\\\\u201360 user total dan 20\\\\u201330 core user dalam dua gelombang onboarding.\\",\\"Success metrics meliputi waktu weekly report, waktu meeting minutes, kelengkapan handover, overdue action visibility, adoption, approval turnaround time, dan kualitas handover.\\",\\"Risiko dan batasan mencakup budget belum disetujui, perlu validasi dengan IT\\\\\\/security, kemampuan offline belum diasumsikan, dan resource request perlu validasi resource manager.\\"],\\"decisions_agreements\\":[\\"Lark akan dievaluasi melalui pilot terbatas, bukan penggantian semua tools secara langsung.\\",\\"Pilot core yang diusulkan adalah structured handover sampai project execution dan selected internal approval; resource request approval masih subject to validation.\\",\\"AI meeting summary hanya menjadi fitur pendukung dengan review user sebelum task dibuat atau record diperbarui.\\",\\"Pilot awal bersifat internal tanpa melibatkan customer sebagai guest.\\",\\"Akan dilakukan workshop bisnis terpisah dari sesi teknis untuk security, API, SSO, dan integration.\\"]},\\"meeting_type_sections_json\\":{\\"discovery_objectives\\":\\"Memahami cara kerja lintas tim PT Prasetia Dwidharma, mengidentifikasi pain point operasional, menentukan use case prioritas, dan menyusun rekomendasi pilot Lark Suite yang relevan.\\",\\"business_context\\":\\"Kodrat Santoso sebagai Project Manager bekerja lintas sales, presales, implementation, finance, procurement, dan customer support. Tim bekerja hybrid\\\\\\/mobile dan sebagian berada di lokasi pelanggan. Terdapat rata-rata 20\\\\u201330 project aktif, belum termasuk project kecil, proof of concept, dan support khusus; PIC utama sekitar 8\\\\u201312 orang dengan stakeholder lebih banyak.\\",\\"current_state\\":\\"Komunikasi cepat mayoritas melalui WhatsApp, komunikasi formal lewat email, dokumen tersimpan di Google Drive dan OneDrive tergantung divisi, tracking pekerjaan memakai spreadsheet dan beberapa task management tools yang tidak seragam, serta approval dilakukan melalui email, chat, form, atau manual.\\",\\"priority_use_cases\\":[\\"Sales-to-project handover terstruktur dengan sales submit, presales confirm scope teknis, project manager accept\\\\\\/return, dan conditional finance validation untuk project tertentu.\\",\\"Project tracking dengan milestone, task, owner, due date, status, risk, issue, weekly update, blocker, overdue, upcoming milestone, dan project health.\\",\\"Resource request approval untuk kebutuhan role, skill, jumlah personel, periode, lokasi, allocation, urgency, dan approval trail; availability diverifikasi manual pada pilot.\\",\\"AI meeting summary untuk menghasilkan summary, decision, pain point, action item, PIC, due date, dan recommendation, tetapi harus direview user sebelum menjadi task atau update record.\\"],\\"business_requirements\\":[\\"Single source of truth untuk dokumen proposal, scope of work, project plan, meeting minutes, UAT document, dan referensi project.\\",\\"Template project otomatis namun fleksibel berdasarkan jenis project.\\",\\"Conditional approval routing berdasarkan nominal, department, project, tipe dokumen, atau kondisi lainnya.\\",\\"Audit trail untuk approval, dokumen, dan keputusan.\\",\\"Dashboard operasional dan manajemen yang terhubung langsung dengan data project tanpa konsolidasi manual.\\"],\\"technical_requirements\\":[\\"API untuk Base, Approval, Messenger, Calendar, dan Documents perlu dinilai.\\",\\"Open Platform, bot, webhook, dan integration pattern perlu dibahas pada sesi teknis.\\",\\"SSO dan audit log penting untuk jangka panjang.\\",\\"Data residency, retention, DLP, dan AI data processing perlu dikaji bersama tim IT\\\\\\/security.\\",\\"Search harus mengikuti permission sumber, terutama untuk dokumen dan percakapan sensitif.\\"],\\"pilot_scope_proposed\\":{\\"included\\":[\\"Sales-to-project handover\\",\\"Project tracking\\",\\"Resource request approval subject to validation\\",\\"AI meeting summary as supporting feature\\",\\"Mobile approval and task update\\",\\"Prototype handover, dashboard, approval, and meeting summary flow\\"],\\"excluded\\":[\\"Payroll\\",\\"Core finance\\",\\"Customer credential management\\\\\\/secret management\\",\\"Full historical document migration\\",\\"Full resource capacity planning\\",\\"Email migration\\",\\"Customer external guest access in first pilot\\"]},\\"success_metrics\\":[\\"Pengurangan waktu pembuatan weekly project report.\\",\\"Pengurangan waktu administrasi meeting minutes.\\",\\"Peningkatan kelengkapan data handover.\\",\\"Visibility terhadap overdue action dan blocker.\\",\\"User adoption dan berkurangnya kembali ke tools lama.\\",\\"Approval turnaround time.\\",\\"Persentase field wajib handover lengkap, jumlah handover yang dikembalikan, waktu closed-won ke project accepted, dan jumlah clarification setelah kickoff.\\"],\\"stakeholders\\":{\\"champion_evaluator\\":\\"Kodrat Santoso \\\\u2014 Project Manager, PT Prasetia Dwidharma\\",\\"decision_makers\\":\\"Director terkait dan Head of IT; nama spesifik tidak tersedia.\\",\\"commercial_stakeholders\\":\\"Finance dan procurement akan terlibat pada tahap komersial.\\",\\"technical_stakeholders\\":\\"Head of IT dan satu orang dari infrastructure akan dilibatkan; nama belum tersedia.\\",\\"business_workshop_participants\\":\\"Perwakilan sales, presales, project management, resource manager, dan finance approver, sekitar 6\\\\u20138 orang.\\"},\\"decision_process\\":\\"Belum ada tender formal. PT Prasetia Dwidharma membutuhkan business justification sebelum vendor registration dan evaluasi komersial. Kodrat akan mengevaluasi dan memberi rekomendasi bila pilot berhasil, sedangkan final approval berada pada director terkait dan Head of IT.\\",\\"timeline\\":\\"Assessment dan desain pilot diharapkan selesai bulan depan jika disetujui internal. Pilot ditargetkan kasar dalam 1\\\\u20132 bulan, dengan durasi pilot yang dipertimbangkan 6\\\\u20138 minggu. Tanggal pasti belum committed.\\",\\"risks_constraints\\":[\\"Budget belum disetujui dan masih tahap eksplorasi.\\",\\"User availability untuk workshop dan resistensi perubahan dapat menghambat pilot.\\",\\"Data awal belum rapi dan pilot tidak boleh membebani tim dengan administrasi berlebih.\\",\\"Security, data residency, retention, DLP, AI data handling, dan SSO belum divalidasi bersama IT\\\\\\/security.\\",\\"Kemampuan offline Lark belum diketahui dan tidak boleh diasumsikan full offline sebelum technical validation.\\"],\\"missing_information\\":[\\"Budget range dan approval budget belum tersedia.\\",\\"Nama Head of IT, PIC infrastructure, director decision maker, dan peserta workshop belum tersedia.\\",\\"Requirement rinci data residency, retention, DLP, dan security belum tersedia.\\",\\"Detail identity provider\\\\\\/directory internal belum tersedia.\\",\\"Tanggal meeting aktual dan tanggal jatuh tempo absolut action item tidak tersedia karena transcript bersifat simulated.\\"]},\\"bantc_json\\":{\\"budget\\":\\"Belum ada budget yang disetujui. Customer masih tahap eksplorasi dan membutuhkan business justification sebelum vendor registration serta evaluasi komersial.\\",\\"authority\\":\\"Kodrat Santoso adalah champion\\\\\\/evaluator dan project owner dari sisi use case. Final approval kemungkinan oleh director terkait dan Head of IT; finance dan procurement masuk pada tahap komersial.\\",\\"needs\\":\\"Meningkatkan keterhubungan proses dan auditability untuk sales-to-project handover, project tracking, approval internal, knowledge management, reporting, governance, dan efisiensi waktu.\\",\\"timeline\\":\\"Assessment dan desain pilot diharapkan selesai bulan depan jika disetujui internal; pilot mungkin dimulai setelah itu dalam kisaran 1\\\\u20132 bulan. Tanggal belum committed.\\",\\"competitor\\":\\"Microsoft 365 menjadi referensi karena sebagian user familiar. Beberapa project management tools juga pernah dicoba, tetapi adoption tidak konsisten atau tidak menyelesaikan approval dan knowledge secara end-to-end.\\"},\\"score_updates_json\\":{\\"lead_score\\":78,\\"eligibility_status\\":\\"potential\\",\\"confidence\\":90}}"}	2026-08-08 07:06:41
