13	1	322	transcript_evaluation_raw	{"transcript_id":15,"raw_content":"{\\"general_sections_json\\":{\\"executive_summary\\":\\"PT Prasetia Dwidharma is evaluating Lark Suite through a limited, outcome-focused pilot rather than a full replacement of existing tools. The discovery identified fragmented collaboration across WhatsApp, email, Google Drive, OneDrive, spreadsheets, and task tools, causing weak handover quality, inconsistent project tracking, version-control issues, manual reporting, and limited auditability. The strongest candidate use cases are sales-to-project handover, project tracking, and potentially resource request approval, with AI meeting summary as a supporting capability subject to review controls and security validation. The customer showed clear interest in a prototype-led workshop and wants the solution positioned around connected processes, governance, audit trails, reduced manual work, dashboard visibility, and adoption simplicity rather than chat or feature breadth.\\",\\"overall_sentiment\\":{\\"positive\\":70,\\"neutral\\":25,\\"negative\\":5},\\"key_pain_points\\":[\\"Project information is fragmented across WhatsApp, email, cloud drives, spreadsheets, and non-standard task tools, making context difficult to trace.\\",\\"Sales-to-project handover is inconsistent, causing delayed kickoffs, incomplete documents, unclear scope, and repeated clarification after kickoff.\\",\\"Weekly project reporting and management dashboards require manual consolidation from multiple files and inconsistent PM formats.\\",\\"Internal approvals such as resource requests, procurement, trips, reimbursements, and commercial document approvals are scattered and lack consistent audit trails.\\",\\"Version control, permission management, knowledge retrieval, and dependency on individual knowledge create operational risk.\\"],\\"customer_needs\\":[\\"Structured sales-to-project handover with mandatory fields, conditional validation, document references, and PM acceptance or return workflow.\\",\\"Project workspace and tracking templates with milestones, tasks, owners, due dates, status, risks, issues, weekly updates, dashboards, and controlled notifications.\\",\\"Internal approval workflows with conditional routing, audit trail, mobile usability, and configurable escalation.\\",\\"Knowledge management and searchable documents with metadata, templates, permission-aware search, and consistent naming or structure.\\",\\"Technical validation for security, SSO, audit logs, API\\\\\\/webhook integration, external collaboration controls, AI data handling, and offline limitations.\\"],\\"key_discussions\\":[\\"Current operations rely on WhatsApp for quick communication, email for formal communication, mixed cloud drives for documents, spreadsheets and task tools for tracking, and mixed manual\\\\\\/email\\\\\\/chat methods for approvals.\\",\\"Pilot should focus on a connected end-to-end process: handover, project creation, project tracking, resource request approval candidate, AI-generated meeting summary, and dashboard visibility.\\",\\"The customer emphasized adoption simplicity, role-based training, Indonesian user guides, short videos, mobile approval\\\\\\/task updates, and avoiding excessive modules or notifications.\\",\\"Security and integration topics require a separate technical session with Head of IT and infrastructure, covering SSO, audit logs, APIs, webhooks, data residency, retention, DLP, AI processing, and integration patterns.\\",\\"The customer does not want Lark positioned as ERP replacement, payroll system, core finance system, email migration platform, full historical document migration, or secret manager.\\"],\\"decisions_agreements\\":[\\"PT Prasetia Dwidharma will evaluate Lark through a limited pilot approach, not a full replacement of all existing tools at once.\\",\\"Proposed pilot scope includes sales-to-project handover and project tracking, with resource request approval as a strong candidate subject to validation with the resource manager.\\",\\"AI meeting summary will be considered as a supporting accelerator with human review before creating tasks or updating records.\\",\\"Initial pilot should be internal only, with no customer guest access in the first phase.\\",\\"Business workshop and technical session should be separated; Virtuenet will prepare a prototype-oriented demo and minimum data request.\\"]},\\"meeting_type_sections_json\\":{\\"discovery_objectives\\":\\"Understand PT Prasetia Dwidharma's collaboration, project management, handover, approval, reporting, knowledge, security, and integration challenges to define relevant Lark Suite pilot use cases.\\",\\"current_state\\":{\\"communication_tools\\":\\"WhatsApp for quick communication, email for formal communication.\\",\\"document_management\\":\\"Google Drive and OneDrive depending on division; inconsistent file naming and versioning.\\",\\"work_tracking\\":\\"Spreadsheets and some task management applications, but not standardized.\\",\\"approvals\\":\\"Mixed across email, chat, forms, and some manual processes.\\",\\"reporting\\":\\"Weekly project status and management dashboards are manually consolidated from several files with inconsistent formats.\\"},\\"business_challenges\\":[\\"No reliable single source of truth across the project lifecycle.\\",\\"Sales-to-project handover requires re-collecting scattered documents, chat decisions, proposal versions, and technical notes.\\",\\"Management visibility into project status, pipeline, risks, delays, and customer issues is manual and delayed.\\",\\"Approval routing depends on nominal value, department, project, and document type but currently lacks consistent workflow and audit trail.\\",\\"Knowledge from past projects, lesson learned, proposal examples, templates, and technical decisions is difficult to find.\\"],\\"priority_use_cases\\":[\\"Structured sales-to-project handover through form or record, presales technical confirmation, PM completeness review, accept or return status, and document reference control.\\",\\"Project tracking with template-based workspace creation, milestones, tasks, owners, due dates, dependencies, risks, issues, weekly updates, blocker visibility, and dashboards.\\",\\"Resource request approval capturing project, role, skill, personnel count, start date, duration, location, allocation, urgency, approval route, and manual availability verification for pilot.\\",\\"AI meeting summary for summary, decisions, pain points, action items, PIC, due dates, and recommendations, with mandatory human review before automation.\\",\\"Mobile approval and task update experience for approvers and field users.\\"],\\"pilot_scope\\":{\\"estimated_users\\":\\"Approximately 40-60 users, with 20-30 core users and the rest approvers or stakeholders.\\",\\"pilot_duration\\":\\"6-8 weeks under consideration; 6 weeks minimum and 8 weeks ideal according to the customer.\\",\\"pilot_waves\\":\\"Two onboarding waves are possible.\\",\\"in_scope\\":[\\"Sales-to-project handover\\",\\"Project tracking and dashboard\\",\\"Resource request approval as proposed scope subject to validation\\",\\"AI meeting summary as supporting feature\\",\\"Mobile approval and task update demo\\"],\\"out_of_scope\\":[\\"Payroll\\",\\"Core finance\\",\\"Customer credential management or secret management\\",\\"Full historical document migration\\",\\"Full resource capacity planning\\",\\"Email migration\\",\\"Customer guest collaboration in first pilot\\"]},\\"success_metrics\\":[\\"Reduction in time spent preparing weekly project reports.\\",\\"Reduction in time spent preparing meeting minutes.\\",\\"Improvement in handover completeness.\\",\\"Visibility of overdue actions and blockers.\\",\\"User adoption and percentage of processes actually running in the platform.\\",\\"Approval turnaround time.\\",\\"Percentage of mandatory handover fields completed.\\",\\"Number of handovers returned for completion.\\",\\"Time from closed-won to project accepted.\\",\\"Number of clarifications after kickoff.\\"],\\"stakeholders\\":{\\"champion_evaluator\\":\\"Kodrat Santoso, Project Manager, PT Prasetia Dwidharma.\\",\\"decision_makers\\":\\"Related director and Head of IT are expected to be final decision makers.\\",\\"commercial_stakeholders\\":\\"Finance and procurement will participate at commercial stage.\\",\\"technical_stakeholders\\":\\"Head of IT and one infrastructure representative to be confirmed.\\",\\"business_workshop_participants\\":\\"Representatives from sales, presales, project management, resource manager, and finance approver; target 6-8 people.\\"},\\"technical_requirements_and_validation\\":[\\"API availability for Base, Approval, Messenger, Calendar, and Documents.\\",\\"Open Platform, bot, webhook, and integration pattern review.\\",\\"SSO important for long term; user provisioning can be manual for pilot if user count remains manageable.\\",\\"Audit logs are important; data residency, retention, and DLP require IT\\\\\\/security input.\\",\\"AI data handling must clarify where data is processed, whether provider stores data, and available controls.\\",\\"Search should follow source permissions, especially for conversations and sensitive documents.\\",\\"Offline capability must be technically validated; full offline should not be assumed or promised.\\",\\"External collaboration and guest access are interesting but require permission and revocation controls; not part of first pilot.\\"],\\"risks_and_constraints\\":[\\"No approved budget yet; business case required before procurement and commercial evaluation.\\",\\"Resource request approval is not final scope until validated with resource manager.\\",\\"User availability for workshops may be limited due to ongoing large projects.\\",\\"Resistance to change and users reverting to WhatsApp and spreadsheets are adoption risks.\\",\\"Initial data is not fully clean or standardized.\\",\\"Too much configuration, too many modules, excessive notifications, or complex user journeys could reduce adoption.\\",\\"Security and AI data concerns may block use of sensitive customer data before review.\\"],\\"missing_information\\":[\\"Approved budget range is not available.\\",\\"Exact decision maker names are not available.\\",\\"Head of IT and infrastructure PIC names are not available.\\",\\"Final pilot scope is not fully confirmed, especially resource request approval.\\",\\"Actual technical identity provider details are not available.\\",\\"Data residency, retention, DLP, and AI governance requirements are not yet confirmed.\\",\\"Exact pilot start date is not committed.\\",\\"Formal KPI or target percentage improvement is not available.\\"]},\\"bantc_json\\":{\\"budget\\":\\"No approved budget yet. Customer is still in exploration stage and needs business justification before procurement and commercial evaluation. License savings are interesting but not the primary justification.\\",\\"authority\\":\\"Kodrat Santoso is the evaluator, champion, and use-case project owner. Final approval is expected from the related director and Head of IT, with finance and procurement involved at commercial stage.\\",\\"needs\\":\\"Improve connected end-to-end processes, governance, auditability, project tracking, sales-to-project handover, internal approvals, management visibility, knowledge retrieval, mobile usability, and reduction of manual reporting and meeting administration.\\",\\"timeline\\":\\"Target assessment and pilot design next month if approved; potential pilot start in 1-2 months. Pilot duration under consideration is 6-8 weeks. Exact dates are not committed.\\",\\"competitor\\":\\"Microsoft 365 is a natural reference because some users are familiar with it. Several project management tools have been tried previously. No formal tender is running yet.\\"},\\"score_updates_json\\":{\\"lead_score\\":78,\\"eligibility_status\\":\\"potential\\",\\"confidence\\":86}}"}	2026-08-09 04:36:28
