30	1	344	transcript_evaluation_raw	{"transcript_id":21,"raw_content":"{\\"general_sections_json\\":{\\"executive_summary\\":\\"Leadsy\\\\\\/Lark conducted a broad demo for PT Maju Gemilang Persada covering Lark as an all-in-one collaboration platform for internal communication, meetings, approvals, workflows, Lark Base, dashboards, automation, HR use cases, and potential operational use cases for sales orders, procurement\\\\\\/vendor portal, e-commerce reporting, warehouse coordination, and recruitment. The customer showed active interest, especially around replacing fragmented WhatsApp\\\\\\/Excel-based processes, maintaining communication history, enabling approvals with audit trails, capturing customer orders through forms before entering Odoo, and using dashboards\\\\\\/automation. The discussion also clarified that Odoo remains the ERP\\\\\\/process system, while Lark would mainly support collaboration, communication, forms, workflow capture, and potentially integration. Pricing, starter\\\\\\/free trial limitations, Pro licensing, frontline licensing, and paid custom use-case development were discussed, but no final purchase decision or confirmed rollout timeline was made.\\",\\"overall_sentiment\\":{\\"positive\\":70,\\"neutral\\":25,\\"negative\\":5},\\"key_pain_points\\":[\\"Internal communication and work discussions are fragmented across WhatsApp, WeChat, email, Zoom, Excel, and other tools, making history, search, and control difficult.\\",\\"Customer order intake currently relies heavily on WhatsApp\\\\\\/manual handling, creating risk of missing details, duplicate work, and limited structured reporting before data enters Odoo.\\",\\"Approval processes exist in some systems but several departmental workflows are still conventional\\\\\\/verbal\\\\\\/WhatsApp-based and need better evidence, notification, and audit trail.\\",\\"HR processes such as attendance, payroll inputs, leave, overtime, and recruitment are still partly manual or not covered by a complete HRIS.\\",\\"Warehouse stock opname and item tracking are manual\\\\\\/time-consuming; the team mentioned barcode\\\\\\/Excel workarounds and stock count taking months.\\"],\\"customer_needs\\":[\\"A company-controlled collaboration platform with chat, search, meeting, document sharing, task, calendar, and access\\\\\\/offboarding control.\\",\\"Structured forms and Lark Base workflows to capture sales orders, vendor submissions, customer feedback, recruitment data, and department requests.\\",\\"Approval workflows with configurable layers, notifications, access control, attachments, and clear evidence for finance, e-commerce content approval, HR, and other departments.\\",\\"Dashboards and reports for order summaries, recruitment funnel\\\\\\/status, marketing\\\\\\/content planning, customer reviews, and operational tracking.\\",\\"Integration or handoff with Odoo\\\\\\/ERP where appropriate, while avoiding duplicate work and clarifying which processes should remain in Odoo versus Lark.\\"],\\"key_discussions\\":[\\"Lark was positioned as a ByteDance product and a super app replacing multiple siloed tools such as WhatsApp, Gmail, Zoom, Drive, Slack\\\\\\/Teams-like chat, calendar, docs, meetings, approval, Base, and automation.\\",\\"The demo covered internal messenger, company directory, onboarding\\\\\\/offboarding, privacy boundaries for direct messages, group chat history visibility, meeting\\\\\\/calendar scheduling, AI meeting notes, and translation across chat\\\\\\/docs\\\\\\/meetings.\\",\\"Lark Base was discussed extensively as an advanced Excel\\\\\\/database with forms, views, grouping, dashboards, formulas, automation, and potential use cases for sales order intake, vendor portal, customer review, recruitment, and dashboards.\\",\\"The customer discussed current Odoo implementation and asked how Lark would coexist with Odoo, especially for sales order flow, procurement, warehouse, and finance processes.\\",\\"Commercial discussion included Starter\\\\\\/free option for up to 20 users, Pro licensing around IDR 225,000 per user\\\\\\/month, frontline license around IDR 95,000 per user\\\\\\/month, trial limitations, and custom use-case development around IDR 8,000,000 mentioned in discussion.\\"],\\"decisions_agreements\\":[\\"No final purchase or rollout decision was confirmed during the meeting.\\",\\"Both sides aligned that Lark should not replace Odoo as ERP; Lark would be evaluated mainly for collaboration, communication, workflow capture, and possible integration\\\\\\/handoff use cases.\\",\\"The team discussed starting with a small core group rather than all field users, because system implementation with many people cannot be validated effectively within a short trial.\\",\\"Potential POC\\\\\\/use cases discussed include sales order capture before Odoo, HR\\\\\\/recruitment, procurement\\\\\\/vendor portal, and internal collaboration\\\\\\/approval workflows.\\",\\"It was suggested that the customer first map priority use cases, users, and required dashboards\\\\\\/notifications before deciding wider rollout.\\"]},\\"meeting_type_sections_json\\":{\\"features_demonstrated\\":[\\"Lark Messenger with company directory, group chats, pinned chats, chat history, custom bots, notifications from other Lark modules, and global search across chat, docs, email, calendar, and tasks.\\",\\"Lark Calendar and Meeting, including scheduling based on availability, group calls, external participants, browser join option, AI notes\\\\\\/minutes, meeting transcription, and subtitle translation.\\",\\"Lark Approval for configurable approval forms, approval layers, attachments, bot notifications, approve\\\\\\/reject actions, and access control.\\",\\"Lark Base as an advanced spreadsheet\\\\\\/database with generated forms, order-entry example, views by item\\\\\\/customer, grouping, dashboard charts, formula\\\\\\/process capabilities, and automation triggers.\\",\\"AI and automation use cases including customer review summary\\\\\\/sentiment, recruitment CV parsing\\\\\\/matching, automated emails, smart ticketing concepts, and image analysis examples.\\"],\\"customer_reactions\\":[\\"The customer asked many detailed workflow questions, indicating strong engagement, especially around sales order intake, customer history, Odoo integration, and departmental use cases.\\",\\"Finance\\\\\\/security stakeholders showed concern about whether finance approvals and confidential information could be restricted by access rights.\\",\\"HR-related participants asked about attendance, leave, overtime, payroll, device requirements, and whether Lark could cover HRIS-like functions.\\",\\"Procurement questioned whether Lark would duplicate Odoo processes and clarified supplier communication practices such as WeChat with China suppliers.\\",\\"Warehouse\\\\\\/e-commerce\\\\\\/marketing participants explored stock opname, barcode\\\\\\/RFID ideas, content planning, TikTok\\\\\\/Instagram analytics, and dashboard\\\\\\/reporting possibilities.\\"],\\"questions_objections\\":[\\"Can Lark translate meetings with buyers\\\\\\/partners and across chat\\\\\\/docs\\\\\\/meetings, and what is the accuracy? The presenter stated translation is available across chat, docs, and meetings with around 97% accuracy for supported languages.\\",\\"Can finance approvals be restricted so other departments cannot see confidential data? The presenter stated access can be configured by role\\\\\\/person.\\",\\"Can customer order history be preserved for customers similar to WhatsApp chat history? The discussion noted options such as email confirmation, WhatsApp via third-party omnichannel integration, or requiring customers to use\\\\\\/access Lark, each with trade-offs.\\",\\"How would Lark integrate or coexist with Odoo? The team clarified Lark can collect\\\\\\/collaborate before ERP entry and may integrate via API\\\\\\/open platform where feasible, but detailed integration design requires further mapping.\\",\\"Is rollout required for all users or can it start with one team? The presenter said it can be phased and suggested starting with a core team\\\\\\/limited users before broader rollout.\\"],\\"key_takeaways\\":[\\"The highest-fit use case is not ERP replacement but improving company collaboration, communication governance, workflow evidence, and data capture before\\\\\\/around ERP processes.\\",\\"Lark Base generated strong interest because it can turn WhatsApp\\\\\\/Excel-based requests into structured forms, databases, dashboards, and automation.\\",\\"A successful POC should focus on a small number of concrete workflows rather than attempting company-wide deployment immediately.\\",\\"Odoo implementation status is a key dependency; any Lark process must avoid duplicating ERP work and should be designed as a collaboration\\\\\\/intake\\\\\\/integration layer.\\",\\"Commercial appetite exists, but budget, final authority, exact user count, and timeline remain unconfirmed.\\"]},\\"bantc_json\\":{\\"budget\\":\\"Pricing was discussed but budget was not confirmed. Mentioned figures include Pro license around IDR 225,000 per user\\\\\\/month, frontline license around IDR 95,000 per user\\\\\\/month, Starter\\\\\\/free up to 20 users, and custom use-case development around IDR 8,000,000; implementation and annual contract terms were also discussed.\\",\\"authority\\":\\"Final authority not fully confirmed. Pak Hendru\\\\\\/Andrew appears to be a key management stakeholder, with inputs from marketing, finance\\\\\\/accounting\\\\\\/tax, HRD, procurement, warehouse, e-commerce, and other departmental users.\\",\\"needs\\":\\"Clear needs around internal collaboration, company-controlled communication history, multilingual communication, approvals, sales order capture, dashboards, HR\\\\\\/recruitment support, procurement\\\\\\/vendor processes, and possible Odoo integration\\\\\\/handoff.\\",\\"timeline\\":\\"No firm decision timeline. Odoo implementation\\\\\\/training is ongoing, and Lark evaluation appears to be in discovery\\\\\\/POC planning stage.\\",\\"competitor\\":\\"Current alternatives\\\\\\/processes include WhatsApp, WeChat, email\\\\\\/Gmail, Zoom, Google Sheets\\\\\\/Excel, Odoo ERP, marketplace\\\\\\/e-commerce systems, and possible omnichannel tools for WhatsApp integration. No direct Lark competitor evaluation was confirmed.\\"},\\"score_updates_json\\":{\\"lead_score\\":78,\\"eligibility_status\\":\\"potential\\",\\"confidence\\":77}}"}	2026-08-28 16:15:57
31	1	344	transcript_evaluation_raw	{"transcript_id":21,"raw_content":"{\\"general_sections_json\\":{\\"executive_summary\\":\\"Demo memperkenalkan Lark sebagai all-in-one collaboration platform untuk PT Maju Gemilang Persada, mencakup messenger, meeting, calendar, docs, approval, attendance, Lark Base, dashboard, automation, AI, translation, security, dan user onboarding\\\\\\/offboarding. Diskusi sangat berfokus pada bagaimana Lark dapat melengkapi implementasi Odoo yang sedang berjalan, terutama untuk kolaborasi internal, pengumpulan sales order\\\\\\/customer order sebelum masuk ERP, approval lintas departemen, HR attendance\\\\\\/recruitment, procurement\\\\\\/vendor communication, serta monitoring warehouse dan e-commerce\\\\\\/content planning. Customer menunjukkan minat tinggi namun masih banyak mengevaluasi fit terhadap proses existing, integrasi Odoo\\\\\\/WhatsApp\\\\\\/omnichannel, adopsi customer, dan skema lisensi\\\\\\/POC.\\",\\"overall_sentiment\\":{\\"positive\\":62,\\"neutral\\":32,\\"negative\\":6},\\"key_pain_points\\":[\\"Komunikasi pekerjaan masih banyak tersebar di WhatsApp\\\\\\/WeChat sehingga histori, ownership data, dan kontrol saat karyawan resign menjadi masalah.\\",\\"Order dari customer\\\\\\/distributor banyak berasal dari WhatsApp dan perlu ditangkap lebih rapi sebelum masuk ke sistem ERP\\\\\\/Odoo.\\",\\"HR masih memiliki proses manual seperti attendance dari fingerprint\\\\\\/export, payroll manual, dan belum ada proses recruitment yang terstruktur.\\",\\"Warehouse\\\\\\/stock opname masih manual dan memakan waktu lama; disebutkan proses bisa sampai berbulan-bulan per area\\\\\\/lantai.\\",\\"Koordinasi dengan supplier luar negeri, terutama China, menghadapi kendala bahasa dan penggunaan platform berbeda seperti WeChat.\\"],\\"customer_needs\\":[\\"Platform kolaborasi internal yang terpusat untuk chat, meeting, calendar, task, file, email, dan pencarian global.\\",\\"Form\\\\\\/order capture berbasis Lark Base untuk menampung order customer, mengelompokkan produk, quantity, customer, dan potensi integrasi ke Odoo.\\",\\"Workflow approval digital dengan notifikasi, akses role-based, attachment, audit trail, dan proses yang dapat dikonfigurasi.\\",\\"Dashboard dan reporting real-time untuk sales order, recruitment, project\\\\\\/progress tracking, marketing\\\\\\/content, dan operational monitoring.\\",\\"Kemampuan translation, meeting transcript\\\\\\/notulen AI, dan akses multi-device untuk komunikasi lintas bahasa dan lintas tim.\\"],\\"key_discussions\\":[\\"Lark diposisikan sebagai communication and collaboration platform, bukan pengganti langsung Odoo ERP; Odoo tetap menjadi sistem utama untuk proses ERP.\\",\\"Demo Lark Base dibuat dari awal untuk contoh sales order form, lalu data masuk otomatis ke table dan divisualisasikan menjadi dashboard serta view by item\\\\\\/customer.\\",\\"Dibahas kemungkinan integrasi ke Odoo, email, WhatsApp melalui omnichannel tool, marketplace\\\\\\/e-commerce, dan batasan integrasi langsung untuk Instagram\\\\\\/TikTok analytics.\\",\\"Customer menanyakan aspek security, akses data finance, private\\\\\\/direct message history, transfer aset digital saat offboarding, dan kontrol user.\\",\\"Diskusi lisensi mencakup Starter gratis sampai 20 user dengan limitasi, Pro sekitar Rp225.000\\\\\\/user\\\\\\/bulan, Frontline sekitar Rp95.000\\\\\\/user\\\\\\/bulan, serta opsi mulai dari core team kecil.\\"],\\"decisions_agreements\\":[\\"Belum ada keputusan pembelian final dalam meeting ini.\\",\\"Disepakati secara konsep bahwa implementasi sebaiknya dimulai dari core team terlebih dahulu, bukan langsung semua user lapangan.\\",\\"Lark dapat digunakan berdampingan dengan Odoo; proses ERP yang sudah berjalan tidak perlu diduplikasi di Lark.\\",\\"POC\\\\\\/trial potensial diarahkan pada 10-20 user internal untuk membuktikan workflow dan use case sebelum scale-up.\\",\\"Scope use case POC masih perlu dipastikan; beberapa kandidat yang dibahas adalah sales order capture, HR\\\\\\/recruitment, procurement\\\\\\/vendor portal, dan approval.\\"]},\\"meeting_type_sections_json\\":{\\"features_demonstrated\\":[\\"Lark Messenger dengan chat internal, group chat, pin, global search, bot notification, sharing file\\\\\\/contact, task creation, dan group call.\\",\\"Lark Meeting dan Calendar, termasuk schedule availability, meeting link, AI notulen\\\\\\/transcript, subtitle\\\\\\/translation, dan multi-device handoff.\\",\\"Approval workflow dengan configurable form, attachment, layer approval, approver notification, approve\\\\\\/reject, dan access control.\\",\\"Lark Base sebagai advanced spreadsheet\\\\\\/database untuk form input, grouping, view by customer\\\\\\/item, dashboard, workflow automation, dan AI summary\\\\\\/sentiment.\\",\\"Admin console untuk onboarding\\\\\\/offboarding user, transfer digital assets, suspend account, dan pengelolaan akses company.\\"],\\"customer_reactions\\":[\\"Customer aktif bertanya dan mencoba memahami use case nyata per departemen seperti sales\\\\\\/marketing, HR, procurement, warehouse, finance, dan e-commerce.\\",\\"Minat tinggi terlihat pada Lark Base untuk order capture, dashboard, dan potensi integrasi ke Odoo.\\",\\"Customer tertarik pada translation untuk komunikasi dengan pihak luar atau supplier\\\\\\/buyer lintas bahasa.\\",\\"Customer menyadari value governance dari memindahkan komunikasi pekerjaan dari WhatsApp ke platform company-owned.\\",\\"Customer tetap berhati-hati terkait adopsi customer\\\\\\/distributor yang sudah terbiasa dengan WhatsApp dan terkait effort implementasi.\\"],\\"questions_objections\\":[\\"Apakah translation bisa digunakan di chat, docs, dan meeting, serta berapa akurasinya?\\",\\"Apakah approval finance bisa dibatasi agar tidak dapat dilihat oleh user lain yang tidak berwenang?\\",\\"Apakah Lark bisa diintegrasikan dengan Odoo, WhatsApp, omnichannel, marketplace, TikTok\\\\\\/Instagram analytics, dan email?\\",\\"Bagaimana customer\\\\\\/distributor bisa melihat histori order jika order dilakukan melalui form, bukan WhatsApp?\\",\\"Apakah implementasi harus untuk seluruh tim sekaligus atau bisa bertahap, dan bagaimana skema harga\\\\\\/trial\\\\\\/lisensinya?\\"],\\"key_takeaways\\":[\\"Positioning yang paling diterima adalah Lark sebagai layer kolaborasi dan workflow di atas\\\\\\/di samping Odoo, bukan mengganti ERP.\\",\\"Use case sales order capture sangat relevan, tetapi perlu desain yang mempertimbangkan SKU banyak, identitas customer, histori order, dan integrasi ERP.\\",\\"WhatsApp tetap mudah untuk customer, namun kurang ideal untuk governance, security, continuity, dan company data ownership.\\",\\"Mulai dari pilot kecil dengan core users lebih realistis dibanding roll-out langsung ke seluruh karyawan.\\",\\"Keputusan selanjutnya bergantung pada pemetaan use case, jumlah user awal, biaya implementasi, dan proof of value.\\"]},\\"bantc_json\\":{\\"budget\\":\\"Harga dibahas: Pro sekitar Rp225.000\\\\\\/user\\\\\\/bulan dengan kontrak tahunan, Frontline sekitar Rp95.000\\\\\\/user\\\\\\/bulan, Starter gratis sampai 20 user dengan limitasi, dan custom use case\\\\\\/POC disebut sekitar Rp8.000.000. Belum ada komitmen budget final.\\",\\"authority\\":\\"Beberapa stakeholder lintas fungsi hadir, termasuk management\\\\\\/Pak Hendru atau Andrew, finance\\\\\\/accounting\\\\\\/tax, HRD, procurement, warehouse, marketing\\\\\\/e-commerce. Pengambil keputusan final tidak dinyatakan secara eksplisit.\\",\\"needs\\":\\"Kebutuhan utama adalah kolaborasi company-owned, workflow approval, order capture sebelum ERP\\\\\\/Odoo, dashboard\\\\\\/reporting, HR attendance\\\\\\/recruitment support, procurement\\\\\\/vendor coordination, translation, dan kontrol akses\\\\\\/offboarding.\\",\\"timeline\\":\\"Belum ada timeline keputusan. Opsi trial 2 minggu dan\\\\\\/atau mulai dengan core paid users dibahas, tetapi tanggal mulai belum diputuskan.\\",\\"competitor\\":\\"Odoo sedang\\\\\\/akan digunakan sebagai ERP utama; Whats