47	1	26	transcript_evaluation_raw	{"transcript_id":27,"raw_content":"{\\"general_sections_json\\":{\\"executive_summary\\":\\"PT Katsushiro Indonesia, a manufacturing company, participated in a demo of Lark (a collaboration tool from ByteDance) presented by Fitrat Adiyuliandito and Kodrat Santoso from Prasetyo, an official Lark partner. The meeting focused on demonstrating Lark's messaging, calendar, video conferencing, AI meeting notes, and workflow approval features. The customer, currently using Microsoft Teams, expressed interest in transitioning to Lark for internal communication and process automation. Key discussions included licensing models (Enterprise vs. A2\\\\\\/Frontline), pricing (Rp 350,000 per user per month for Enterprise), storage, security, and integration with existing email systems. The customer showed strong interest in approval workflows and Lark Base, and requested a detailed proposal for 12 Enterprise users with potential expansion to 25 users. Next steps include sending a formal proposal and scheduling training sessions.\\",\\"overall_sentiment\\":{\\"positive\\":70,\\"neutral\\":25,\\"negative\\":5},\\"key_pain_points\\":[\\"Current Microsoft Teams lacks integrated workflow approval and automation features.\\",\\"Difficulty in managing meeting room bookings and approvals manually.\\",\\"Need for a unified collaboration platform that reduces email storage and improves efficiency.\\",\\"Concerns about data migration and backup for custom applications built in Lark.\\",\\"Limited budget and need for cost-effective licensing (e.g., considering A2 for managerial level).\\"],\\"customer_needs\\":[\\"A scalable collaboration tool with strong security and storage capabilities.\\",\\"Integrated approval workflows for purchase requests, travel orders, and other processes.\\",\\"Ability to create custom applications (e.g., visitor management, meeting room booking) without heavy IT involvement.\\",\\"AI-powered meeting summaries and live translation for multilingual teams (Japanese, English, Indonesian).\\",\\"Clear licensing model that allows mixing Enterprise and A2 for different user tiers to optimize costs.\\"],\\"key_discussions\\":[\\"Demonstration of Lark Messenger: bot notifications, task creation, pinning, and sharing emails via chat.\\",\\"Calendar and meeting room booking with approval processes.\\",\\"Video conferencing capabilities: up to 500 participants, lobby, recording, and live subtitles with translation.\\",\\"AI meeting notes (2 free per user per month for Enterprise) and transcript generation.\\",\\"Workflow approval system: customizable forms, conditional branching, parallel approval, and digital signatures.\\"],\\"decisions_agreements\\":[\\"Customer agreed to proceed with 12 Enterprise licenses for initial phase, with possibility to expand to 25 users.\\",\\"Pricing confirmed at Rp 350,000 per user per month for Enterprise, with potential 10% discount for 50+ users.\\",\\"Post-sales support includes two training sessions (admin and user), a dedicated chat group, and biannual reviews.\\",\\"Customer will receive a formal proposal with detailed service inclusions (license, training, support).\\",\\"Customer to evaluate proposal and aim for implementation start around September 1, 2025.\\"]},\\"meeting_type_sections_json\\":{\\"features_demonstrated\\":[\\"Lark Messenger: email integration, share-to-chat, task creation from messages, pinning, and flags.\\",\\"Calendar and video meetings: group availability view, lobby security, recording, live subtitles, and AI meeting summaries.\\",\\"Meeting room booking system with approval workflows for room allocation.\\",\\"Workflow approval builder: custom forms, conditional flows, parallel approval, digital signatures, and reminders.\\",\\"Lark Base: database-like spreadsheet with formulas, dashboards, and visualization for sales tracking, etc.\\"],\\"customer_reactions\\":[\\"Interested in the ability to create custom approval forms and automate processes like travel requests and purchase orders.\\",\\"Curious about data backup and deletion policies for custom apps built on Lark Base.\\",\\"Positive about the integration with existing email (IMAP\\\\\\/POP3) and potential to reduce email storage costs.\\",\\"Concerned about the limitation of A2 license (cannot create meetings or documents) for managerial users; suggested mixing Enterprise and A2.\\",\\"Appreciated the demo of live translation and AI meeting notes, especially for dealing with Japanese headquarters.\\"],\\"questions_objections\\":[\\"Can A2 license users join meetings created by others? (Yes, but they cannot create meetings themselves.)\\",\\"How does Lark handle email migration and storage? (Supports IMAP and POP3; storage is shared: 15 TB + 30 GB per Enterprise user.)\\",\\"Is there a limit on the number of concurrent meetings? (No known limit based on experience.)\\",\\"Can we export data from Lark Base or approval apps? (Yes, export to Excel\\\\\\/PDF is possible, but custom PDF generation may require third-party tools.)\\",\\"What happens when a user is deleted? (Data can be transferred; chats are lost, but records in approvals remain unless the entire approval is deleted.)\\"],\\"key_takeaways\\":[\\"Customer is actively evaluating Lark as a replacement for Microsoft Teams, driven by need for workflow automation.\\",\\"Initial deployment likely 12 Enterprise users, with potential to scale to 25 and beyond.\\",\\"Customer wants a clear proposal including licensing, training, and managed services for custom app development.\\",\\"Decision timeline is tight: aiming for September 1 start, suggesting urgency.\\",\\"Competition includes Microsoft Teams; Lark's advantage is integrated workflow and lower cost for certain tiers.\\"]},\\"bantc_json\\":{\\"budget\\":\\"Approved for initial 12 users at Rp 350,000\\\\\\/user\\\\\\/month; open to scaling up. Potential discount for 50+ users.\\",\\"authority\\":\\"Key decision-makers: Pak Galih and Pak Adam (IT\\\\\\/Management). Final approval likely from higher management (possibly Pak Darmawan).\\",\\"needs\\":\\"Replace Microsoft Teams with a platform that offers integrated workflow approvals, AI meeting summaries, and cost-effective licensing for different user tiers.\\",\\"timeline\\":\\"Target go-live September 1, 2025. Quick decision expected.\\",\\"competitor\\":\\"Microsoft Teams (currently in use). Lark is being evaluated as a more feature-rich and cost-effective alternative.\\"},\\"score_updates_json\\":{\\"lead_score\\":85,\\"eligibility_status\\":\\"eligible\\",\\"confidence\\":80}}"}	2026-08-30 11:06:11
48	1	26	transcript_evaluation_raw	{"transcript_id":27,"raw_content":"{\\"general_sections_json\\":{\\"executive_summary\\":\\"The demo meeting between PT Katsushiro Indonesia (manufacturing) and Prasetyo (official Lark partner) showcased Lark's collaboration tools, including messenger, calendar, video meetings, document collaboration, approval workflows, and Lark Base. The customer, currently using Microsoft Teams, is evaluating Lark for internal communication and workflow automation. Key discussions included licensing models (Enterprise vs. A2\\\\\\/Frontline), storage allocation, pricing (IDR 350,000\\\\\\/user\\\\\\/month), and implementation support. The customer expressed interest but raised concerns about storage, user management, and integration with existing email systems. The next step is for Prasetyo to provide a detailed proposal including training and manage service options, with a potential start date of September 1.\\",\\"overall_sentiment\\":{\\"positive\\":70,\\"neutral\\":25,\\"negative\\":5},\\"key_pain_points\\":[\\"Difficulty in scheduling meetings across large teams with varying availability.\\",\\"Limited meeting room availability and need for booking and approval system.\\",\\"High storage consumption from email forwarding behavior.\\",\\"Need for efficient AI translation and meeting transcription for multi-language audiences.\\",\\"Concerns about user management, data migration, and security when transitioning from Microsoft Teams.\\"],\\"customer_needs\\":[\\"A collaboration platform that integrates chat, meetings, documents, and workflow approvals.\\",\\"Flexible licensing to allocate enterprise features to heavy users and lighter licenses to managers.\\",\\"Robust AI features for real-time translation and meeting summaries.\\",\\"Adequate storage (15 TB + per-user allocation) with ability to set limits per department.\\",\\"Simplified user onboarding and offboarding, including resource transfer and data backup.\\"],\\"key_discussions\\":[\\"Demonstration of Lark messenger with email assistant, task creation, and pinning.\\",\\"Calendar and meeting room booking with availability view and approval flows.\\",\\"AI translation (subtitles) and meeting transcription with optional AI meeting notes (2 per user\\\\\\/month free).\\",\\"Lark Base for creating databases, dashboards, and approval applications.\\",\\"Licensing options: Enterprise (IDR 350k\\\\\\/user\\\\\\/month), Pro, Frontline (A2) \\\\u2013 cannot combine Enterprise and Pro but can combine with A2.\\"],\\"decisions_agreements\\":[\\"Customer agreed to start with 12-25 enterprise users, with possibility to later move managers to A2 licenses.\\",\\"Prasetyo will provide a formal proposal including training (admin & user) and manage service options.\\",\\"Customer requested comparison with other vendors (likely Microsoft) but Prasetyo cannot share competitor pricing per company policy.\\",\\"Agreed on a potential start date around September 1 if procurement process is quick.\\",\\"Customer will evaluate the proposal and make a decision after internal review.\\"]},\\"meeting_type_sections_json\\":{\\"features_demonstrated\\":[\\"Messenger with email assistant, share-to-chat, flags, pins, and task creation.\\",\\"Calendar integration showing team availability and one-click meeting creation (up to 500 participants).\\",\\"Meeting room booking with approval workflow for room allocation.\\",\\"Video meeting features: lobby, check-in, recording, live subtitles with AI translation, and meeting transcription.\\",\\"Lark Base for building custom databases, dashboards, and approval forms.\\"],\\"customer_reactions\\":[\\"Customer showed interest in AI translation and meeting summaries, asking about free quotas and setup.\\",\\"Customer raised practical questions about storage management, user deletion, and data backup.\\",\\"Customer appreciated the approval workflow demo and asked about output (PDF generation) and automation.\\",\\"Customer compared Lark to Microsoft Teams and expressed need for smooth migration.\\",\\"Customer seemed satisfied with the demo and requested a detailed proposal including manage service costs.\\"],\\"questions_objections\\":[\\"How does the AI translation work? Does it require setting primary language?\\",\\"What happens when storage is full? Is there auto-overwrite?\\",\\"Can Lark integrate with existing email (e.g., Outlook) without full migration?\\",\\"How many simultaneous meetings can be held? Is there a limit?\\",\\"Can approval forms be exported as PDF and automatically emailed to vendors?\\"],\\"key_takeaways\\":[\\"Customer has 25 users initially but expects growth; prefers all Enterprise license for now.\\",\\"Customer needs a solution that reduces email storage and improves internal communication.\\",\\"AI meeting notes are a strong interest point but only 2 free per user per month \\\\u2013 may need add-on.\\",\\"Prasetyo's after-sales support includes training, a dedicated CSM, and optional manage services.\\",\\"Customer is comparing Lark with Microsoft Teams and needs a competitive proposal.\\"]},\\"bantc_json\\":{\\"budget\\":\\"Customer did not specify exact budget but indicated need for cost comparison. Pricing is IDR 350,000\\\\\\/user\\\\\\/month for Enterprise, with discounts for volume (e.g., 10% for 50+ users). They are also considering manage service costs.\\",\\"authority\\":\\"Decision-makers appear to be Pak Galih and Pak Adam (likely IT\\\\\\/management). The customer mentioned involvement of BOD and procurement team.\\",\\"needs\\":\\"Need a unified collaboration platform to replace Microsoft Teams with better AI features, efficient storage, and customizable workflows (approvals, meeting room booking).\\",\\"timeline\\":\\"Target start date: September 1, 2026. Procurement process expected to be completed by end of August.\\",\\"competitor\\":\\"Microsoft Teams is the current incumbent. Customer also mentioned evaluating other partners (likely other Lark resellers or competing platforms).\\"},\\"score_updates_json\\":{\\"lead_score\\":75,\\"eligibility_status\\":\\"eligible\\",\\"confidence\\":80}}"}	2026-08-30 11:06:35
