on","Using multiple disjointed apps (Zoom, Gmail, etc.) causing inefficiency and context switching","Manual and paper-based approval processes slowing down operations","Difficulty in managing cross-departmental projects and tracking tasks","Need for a unified platform to reduce tool sprawl and improve employee productivity"],"customer_needs":["Integrated messaging, calendar, video meetings, and document collaboration in one tool","Automated approval workflows to digitize purchasing, leave requests, and other processes","A flexible database (Lark Base) to manage projects, CRM, and custom fields with automation","Real-time translation for multilingual meetings (English, Chinese, Indonesian)","Simple onboarding and training for non-technical users to ensure adoption"],"key_discussions":["Demo of Lark Messenger, Calendar, Meetings with translation, Lark Base, Approval, and Moments","Comparison of Lark Pro vs Enterprise editions: storage, meeting minutes, base rows, workflow limits, security features (watermark, IP restrictions)","Implementation roadmap: Kick-off, admin onboarding, user training, adoption, and quarterly reviews","SLA details: 99.15% uptime, support via official group and Lark support (17\\/7 for chat, 12\\/5 for technical)","Server location: Singapore and Japan, not China, with data security ISO certifications"],"decisions_agreements":["Customer agreed to receive a quotation for 80 Lark Pro users","Next step: Prasetya will send the quotation and a step-by-step timeline for implementation","Customer will share the contact person and decision-maker for the quotation (likely director\\/procurement)","Potential follow-up meeting to address technical questions and finalize pricing"]}	{"features_demonstrated":["Lark Messenger: chat-centric interface with reminders and calendar integration","Lark Calendar: schedule meetings, room booking with approval, and auto-generate meeting links","Lark Meetings: real-time translation (15 languages), screen sharing, and subtitle support","Lark Base: next-level Excel with automation, custom fields, reminders, and email triggers","Lark Approval: digital approval forms for purchasing, leave, etc., with drag-and-drop no-code setup"],"customer_reactions":["High interest in Lark Base, specifically its ability to replace Excel and automate tasks","Positive reaction to real-time translation feature, noting value for multilingual teams","Curiosity about room booking conflicts and approval hierarchy for meeting rooms","Expressed confusion about Lark Base terminology but willing to learn with proper training","Appreciated the structured implementation roadmap and dedicated support from Prasetya"],"questions_objections":["How does room booking handle simultaneous requests? (Answer: with approval active, both requests appear; without approval, first come first served)","Can Lark be integrated with existing ERP? (Answer: possible via APIs, but not yet implemented at customer's parent company)","What is the server location and data security? (Answer: Singapore\\/Japan, ISO 27001\\/27018 certified)","How many training sessions are included? (Answer: 1 admin onboarding + 1 basic user training, additional sessions flexible)","What is the difference between primary admin and feature admin? (Answer: primary admin has full authority, feature admin limited to specific modules)"],"key_takeaways":["Customer is motivated to move from fragmented tools to a unified platform to improve efficiency","Lark Base and Approval are the most compelling features for this customer","The decision will involve director-level approval; timeline is within a few weeks","Prasetya's role as a platinum partner with hands-on experience (300+ employees using Lark) builds trust","Customer needs a clear, phased training plan to ensure user adoption and ROI"]}	{"budget":"Not explicitly stated, but customer asked for pricing and is evaluating 80 users; likely within enterprise SaaS budget range.","authority":"Decision-maker is a director (likely procurement or operations director); the customer (Ibu) is the evaluator and will recommend to director.","needs":"Integrated collaboration, automated approvals, project management via Lark Base, real-time translation, and room booking.","timeline":"Implementation expected within 1-2 months after contract signing; decision within 1-2 weeks.","competitor":"Current tools include WhatsApp, Zoom, Gmail, and possibly Microsoft\\/Google suites; Lark is positioned as a comprehensive alternative."}	{"lead_score":75,"eligibility_status":"eligible","confidence":80}	Proceed with sending a detailed quotation for Lark Pro (80 users) including all services (training, support). Highlight Lark Base and Approval as key differentiators. Prepare a phased implementation plan focusing on quick wins. Engage the director-level decision-maker in a follow-up meeting to address security and integration concerns. Offer a reference call with a similar customer in the logistics/retail sector to build confidence.	meeting_summary_demo_prompt	1	ep-20260830094032-4smp5	ep-20260830094032-4smp5	2026-08-30 02:02:54	LARK	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	TRANSCRIPT_IMPORTED	\N	\N	\N	{"demo_highlights":[{"feature":"Lark Base","summary":"Demonstrated as a powerful database tool with custom fields, automation (reminders, email triggers), and ability to replace Excel for project management and CRM.","interest_level":5},{"feature":"Lark Approval","summary":"Digital approval workflow for purchasing, leave, etc., with drag-and-drop form builder and routing to managers.","interest_level":4},{"feature":"Real-time Translation in Meetings","summary":"Supports 15 languages, with primary language setting and per-participant language assignment for high accuracy.","interest_level":4},{"feature":"Room Booking via Calendar","summary":"Integrated room reservation with optional approval, conflict handling, and auto-release of unapproved slots.","interest_level":3},{"feature":"Lark Messenger & Calendar Integration","summary":"Unified interface with reminders from calendar, tasks, and approvals directly in chat.","interest_level":3}],"feature_interest_radar":{"workflow_approval":4,"dokumen_kolaboratif":3,"lark_base":5,"messenger_integrasi":3,"dashboard_laporan":2,"keamanan_akses":3},"action_items":[{"item":"Send quotation for 80 Lark Pro users to customer","pic":"Hanif (Prasetya)","due_date":"2026-08-17","status":"Open"},{"item":"Provide step-by-step implementation timeline and training plan","pic":"Hanif \\/ Mas Qodar (Prasetya)","due_date":"2026-08-17","status":"Open"},{"item":"Customer to confirm contact person and decision-maker for quotation","pic":"Ibu (PT TPLink Indonesia)","due_date":"2026-08-18","status":"Open"},{"item":"Schedule follow-up meeting to address technical questions (e.g., integration, security)","pic":"Prasetya team \\/ Ibu","due_date":"2026-08-21","status":"Open"}]}	{"conclusion":"The demo successfully showcased Lark's capabilities, with the customer showing strong interest in Lark Base and Approval features. The customer is motivated to replace their current fragmented tools with a unified platform. They have a clear need for 80 users and are open to proceeding with a pilot. The next steps involve sending a quotation and implementation timeline. The decision is expected within a week after internal director approval.","next_step":"Send quotation and implementation timeline to customer, then schedule a follow-up meeting to finalize details.","trial_poc_potensial":"Customer is likely to proceed with a paid pilot after quotation approval; no free trial mentioned.","decision_timeline":"Within 1-2 weeks after receiving quotation, subject to director approval."}	https://larksuite.com/docx/IRrDdlaStoBMt9xeRtclOCoUgpb	IRrDdlaStoBMt9xeRtclOCoUgpb
