e tools (Mandi.com, Google, Microsoft) leads to inefficiency and higher costs.","Budget constraints prevent full subscription to all current tools.","Difficulty in tracking project progress, team availability, and approvals.","Need for a unified platform that integrates seamlessly with existing systems.","Security and data control concerns when migrating to a new platform."],"customer_needs":["An all-in-one collaboration tool to replace or reduce multiple subscriptions.","Integrated project management with task tracking, approvals, and automation.","AI-powered features for content generation, knowledge management, and analysis.","Customizable security settings with role-based access and data labeling.","Seamless integration with Google Workspace and Microsoft 365 for gradual migration."],"key_discussions":["Comparison of Lark with Mandi.com, Google Workspace, and Microsoft 365.","Demonstration of Lark's messenger, meeting (magic share), calendar, base, approval, wiki, and AI features.","Customer questions about integration with external systems, automation, and security.","Discussion of user hierarchy, permission levels, and multi-legal administrator setup.","Review of pricing models and trial options for Lark."],"decisions_agreements":["Customer expressed interest in testing Lark for a subset of users.","Sales rep agreed to provide detailed pricing and proposal for a trial.","No final commitment made; next step is to prepare a tailored demo and pricing.","Customer noted they are currently in a trial phase with Mandi.com.","Agreed to follow up with a formal proposal after internal evaluation."]}	[]	{"budget":"Not explicitly discussed but customer mentioned budget constraints with current tools.","authority":"Speaker 1 appears to be a decision-maker (possibly IT or operations lead) with authority to evaluate and recommend.","needs":"All-in-one collaboration, project management, approvals, AI, security, integration.","timeline":"Interested in starting a trial within a month; full implementation depends on pilot results.","competitor":"Mandi.com, Google Workspace, Microsoft 365 (current tools)."}	{"lead_score":75,"eligibility_status":"potential","confidence":70}	Follow up quickly with a concise proposal focusing on how Lark addresses their specific pain points (budget, multiple tools, project management). Offer a free trial for a key project team (e.g., 10-20 users) with a guided setup. Highlight integration capabilities with Google/Microsoft and emphasize security features. Prepare a use case demo for construction project management with approval workflows and AI-driven reporting.	meeting_summary_discovery_prompt	1	ep-20260830094032-4smp5	ep-20260830094032-4smp5	2026-08-30 03:07:00	LARK	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	TRANSCRIPT_IMPORTED	\N	\N	\N	{"topics_discussed":[{"topik":"Current tool landscape and pain points","ringkasan":"The customer uses Mandi.com (only partially), Google Workspace, and Microsoft 365. They face budget issues and need a unified platform.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"Lark features demonstration","ringkasan":"Demonstrated messenger, meeting (magic share), calendar (availability), base (database\\/automation), approval, wiki, AI (knowledge AI, antigen).","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"Integration and migration concerns","ringkasan":"Customer asked about integration with Google\\/Microsoft, data migration, and coexistence. Lark offers open APIs and gradual adoption.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"Security and permissions","ringkasan":"Detailed discussion on document labeling, watermarking, role-based access, and advanced permission settings.","relevansi":"Medium"},{"topik":"Pricing and trial options","ringkasan":"Discussed Pro vs Enterprise plans, add-ons, and possibility of starting with a small user group trial.","relevansi":"Medium"}],"buying_signals_radar":{"kebutuhan":4,"urgensi":3,"budget_kesiapan":2,"decision_support":3,"solusi_fit":4,"niat_implementasi":3},"action_items":[{"item":"Prepare detailed pricing proposal and trial setup for Lark","pic":"Sales rep (Speaker 2)","due_date":"2026-07-20","status":"Open"},{"item":"Customer to internally evaluate Lark and identify pilot user group","pic":"Customer (Speaker 1)","due_date":"2026-07-27","status":"Open"},{"item":"Schedule follow-up meeting to demo specific use cases (e.g., project management, approval)","pic":"Sales rep","due_date":"2026-07-27","status":"Open"}]}	{"conclusion":"The meeting successfully identified PT Ciputra Development's need for an integrated collaboration platform to consolidate multiple tools and reduce costs. Lark's comprehensive features, especially its project management, approval workflows, and AI capabilities, align well with their requirements. However, migration from Microsoft\\/Google and budget constraints remain challenges. The customer is interested but cautious, and next steps involve providing a tailored proposal for a trial.","next_step":"Sales rep to send a formal proposal with pricing for a pilot of 50-100 users, including a demo of project management and approval features specific to construction projects.","expected_outcome":"Customer will trial Lark for a small team and evaluate its suitability before wider adoption.","target_implementation":"Q4 2026 (if pilot successful)"}	https://larksuite.com/docx/T9zPdoW1QocZ5KxbAqxlGey3gMh	T9zPdoW1QocZ5KxbAqxlGey3gMh
