:09 \nYa terima kasih mas andi pak antony. Terima kasih. Terima kasih semuanya. Selamat pagi.\n\nAnthony 01:30:11 \nTerima kasih menghina. Terima kasih pak handi. Terima kasih. Ya.\n\nAndika Yunisar - Mekari 01:30:13 \nMakasih. Sampai.\n\nHP Yacobus - Finance 01:30:17 \nYa, terima kasih pak.	2026-08-28 01:30:00	evaluated	2026-08-28 16:39:30	2026-08-28 16:41:06	412	Discovery and Demo Meeting	lead-transcripts/FYNBRoHcQIeZ7BIsoVWlvo7hNcbuInIKNauNTYnj.txt	OnlineMahabodhi Vidya SchoolProduct Demo.txt	text/plain	75615	Demo	Demo	{"executive_summary":"The meeting was a comprehensive demo of Lark (collaboration platform) and Mekari Jurnal (accounting system) for Mahabodhi Vidya School. The customer, Anthony, expressed a strong need for a single source of truth, integrated data flow between departments, approval workflows, SOP database, ticketing, and accounting. Lark demonstrated its chat-centric collaboration, Base for no-code apps, approval workflows, dashboards, wiki for SOPs, and learning management system. Mekari Jurnal demonstrated accounting features including purchase, sales, bank integration, and Mekari Pay. The customer was engaged, asked detailed questions about integration and functionality, and requested a formal proposal and quotation. The meeting concluded with plans to send materials and schedule a follow-up with the school's board. The customer indicated a decision timeline of approximately 2-3 months.","overall_sentiment":{"positive":80,"neutral":15,"negative":5},"key_pain_points":["Data silos between departments (finance, HR, clinic, library, etc.)","No single source of truth leading to inconsistent information","Manual processes and lack of tracking for documents and approvals","Difficulty in coordinating between academic and administrative teams","Previous accounting system (Accurate) was offline and not integrated"],"customer_needs":["A single source of truth for all school data","Integrated data flow and communication between all departments","Approval workflows (berjenjang) for purchase requests, leave, etc.","Centralized SOP database with forms that feed into approval systems","Ticketing system to manage IT, maintenance, and other requests with dashboards"],"key_discussions":["Lark demo: chat-centric platform, Base for no-code mini apps, approval workflows, customizable dashboards, wiki for SOPs, and learning management system (LMS)","Mekari Jurnal demo: accounting modules (purchase, sales, bank integration, Mekari Pay), import capabilities, and integration with Lark via API","Integration possibilities: purchase request from Lark can push data to Jurnal to create purchase records automatically","Customer's previous experience with Accurate (offline) and manual Excel for accounting","Security and data center locations for both Lark and Jurnal (ISO certified, data in Indonesia)"],"decisions_agreements":["Customer agreed to receive a proposal and quotation for Lark and Jurnal","Customer requested a presentation deck explaining how Lark can support their needs","Plans to create a WhatsApp group for ongoing support","Follow-up meeting with the school board to be scheduled after proposal review","Customer will evaluate both the option of self-development (after training) vs. professional services from the partner"]}	{"features_demonstrated":["Lark Base for no-code creation of approval workflows, databases, and dashboards","Lark Wiki for centralized SOP and knowledge management","Lark LMS (learning management system) with gamification and quizzes","Mekari Jurnal accounting: purchase, sales, bank reconciliation (BCA, CIMB, Danamon), Mekari Pay for payment collection","Integration between Lark and Jurnal via API for automated data flow"],"customer_reactions":["Very positive and engaged throughout the demo, asking detailed questions","Enthusiastic about the approval berjenjang and dashboard monitoring capabilities","Showed strong interest in the integration between Lark and Jurnal for purchase requests","Appreciated the security certifications and data localization in Indonesia","Requested a proposal to present to the board, indicating serious consideration"],"questions_objections":["Can the dashboard provide weekly summary of tickets and their status?","How does the LMS work for onboarding new employees?","What if internet goes down for cloud-based Jurnal?","Can payment reminders be sent via WhatsApp automatically?","What is the cost per student for using Mekari Pay?","How does the approval flow from Lark to Jurnal work for purchase requests?"],"key_takeaways":["Customer wants Lark as front-end collaboration and Jurnal as back-end accounting, integrated seamlessly","They value no-code tools to allow internal team to develop and customize workflows","Timeline for decision is not immediate (2-3 months); they need board approval","Security and data sovereignty are important considerations","The partner (Prasetya) offers both professional services and training for self-development"]}	{"budget":"Not explicitly discussed but customer is evaluating options and has previously invested in Accurate; likely has budget for a proper system.","authority":"Anthony is the key decision maker but needs board approval for final decision.","needs":"Single source of truth, integrated data flow, approval workflows, SOP database, ticketing, accounting integration, and learning management.","timeline":"Around 2-3 months, not immediate.","competitor":"Not mentioned directly, but previously used Accurate (offline) and manual Excel. Google Classroom is used for LMS currently."}	{"lead_score":85,"eligibility_status":"eligible","confidence":80}	Proceed with sending the proposal and presentation deck. Emphasize the integration value and no-code capabilities. Schedule a follow-up demo for the board if needed. Offer a pilot with the head office team first. Maintain engagement via the WhatsApp group and address any remaining questions about WhatsApp integration and internet dependency.	meeting_summary_demo_prompt