platform that integrates chat, meetings, documents, and workflow approvals.","Flexible licensing to allocate enterprise features to heavy users and lighter licenses to managers.","Robust AI features for real-time translation and meeting summaries.","Adequate storage (15 TB + per-user allocation) with ability to set limits per department.","Simplified user onboarding and offboarding, including resource transfer and data backup."],"key_discussions":["Demonstration of Lark messenger with email assistant, task creation, and pinning.","Calendar and meeting room booking with availability view and approval flows.","AI translation (subtitles) and meeting transcription with optional AI meeting notes (2 per user\\/month free).","Lark Base for creating databases, dashboards, and approval applications.","Licensing options: Enterprise (IDR 350k\\/user\\/month), Pro, Frontline (A2) \\u2013 cannot combine Enterprise and Pro but can combine with A2."],"decisions_agreements":["Customer agreed to start with 12-25 enterprise users, with possibility to later move managers to A2 licenses.","Prasetyo will provide a formal proposal including training (admin & user) and manage service options.","Customer requested comparison with other vendors (likely Microsoft) but Prasetyo cannot share competitor pricing per company policy.","Agreed on a potential start date around September 1 if procurement process is quick.","Customer will evaluate the proposal and make a decision after internal review."]}	{"features_demonstrated":["Messenger with email assistant, share-to-chat, flags, pins, and task creation.","Calendar integration showing team availability and one-click meeting creation (up to 500 participants).","Meeting room booking with approval workflow for room allocation.","Video meeting features: lobby, check-in, recording, live subtitles with AI translation, and meeting transcription.","Lark Base for building custom databases, dashboards, and approval forms."],"customer_reactions":["Customer showed interest in AI translation and meeting summaries, asking about free quotas and setup.","Customer raised practical questions about storage management, user deletion, and data backup.","Customer appreciated the approval workflow demo and asked about output (PDF generation) and automation.","Customer compared Lark to Microsoft Teams and expressed need for smooth migration.","Customer seemed satisfied with the demo and requested a detailed proposal including manage service costs."],"questions_objections":["How does the AI translation work? Does it require setting primary language?","What happens when storage is full? Is there auto-overwrite?","Can Lark integrate with existing email (e.g., Outlook) without full migration?","How many simultaneous meetings can be held? Is there a limit?","Can approval forms be exported as PDF and automatically emailed to vendors?"],"key_takeaways":["Customer has 25 users initially but expects growth; prefers all Enterprise license for now.","Customer needs a solution that reduces email storage and improves internal communication.","AI meeting notes are a strong interest point but only 2 free per user per month \\u2013 may need add-on.","Prasetyo's after-sales support includes training, a dedicated CSM, and optional manage services.","Customer is comparing Lark with Microsoft Teams and needs a competitive proposal."]}	{"budget":"Customer did not specify exact budget but indicated need for cost comparison. Pricing is IDR 350,000\\/user\\/month for Enterprise, with discounts for volume (e.g., 10% for 50+ users). They are also considering manage service costs.","authority":"Decision-makers appear to be Pak Galih and Pak Adam (likely IT\\/management). The customer mentioned involvement of BOD and procurement team.","needs":"Need a unified collaboration platform to replace Microsoft Teams with better AI features, efficient storage, and customizable workflows (approvals, meeting room booking).","timeline":"Target start date: September 1, 2026. Procurement process expected to be completed by end of August.","competitor":"Microsoft Teams is the current incumbent. Customer also mentioned evaluating other partners (likely other Lark resellers or competing platforms)."}	{"lead_score":75,"eligibility_status":"eligible","confidence":80}	Proceed with sending the detailed proposal as discussed. Emphasize Lark's AI capabilities and integrated workflow features that differentiate from Microsoft Teams. Offer a pilot program for 5-10 users to demonstrate value. Provide clear ROI on storage savings and productivity gains. Address customer's concerns about data migration and user management by outlining a step-by-step migration plan with support from Prasetyo's CSM team.	meeting_summary_demo_prompt	1	ep-20260830094032-4smp5	ep-20260830094032-4smp5	2026-08-30 11:06:35	LARK	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	TRANSCRIPT_IMPORTED	\N	\N	\N	{"demo_highlights":[{"feature":"Messenger and Email Assistant","summary":"Demonstrated how Lark messenger can integrate with email, allowing users to share emails to chat, reply directly, and reduce inbox storage. Also showed pinning, flags, and task creation from messages.","interest_level":5},{"feature":"Meeting Room Booking with Approval","summary":"Showed how to create meeting rooms, book them via calendar, and set approval workflows to prioritize room usage.","interest_level":4},{"feature":"AI Translation and Meeting Notes","summary":"Demonstrated live subtitles with translation (e.g., Indonesian to English) and meeting transcription. Mentioned AI meeting notes (summary) with a free quota of 2 per user per month.","interest_level":5},{"feature":"Lark Base and Approval Applications","summary":"Created a custom approval form for purchase requests or travel orders, showing conditional flows, parallel approvals, and digital signature. Also showed Lark Base for data visualization.","interest_level":4},{"feature":"Licensing and User Management","summary":"Explained Enterprise vs. Frontline licenses, per-user pricing (IDR 350k), storage allocation (15TB + 30GB\\/user), and user suspension\\/transfer process.","interest_level":3}],"feature_interest_radar":{"workflow_approval":4,"dokumen_kolaboratif":3,"lark_base":4,"messenger_integrasi":5,"dashboard_laporan":3,"keamanan_akses":4},"action_items":[{"item":"Prepare detailed proposal including licensing, training, and manage service options.","pic":"Fitrat Adiyuliandito \\/ Prasetyo","due_date":"2026-08-20","status":"Open"},{"item":"Send proposal to customer (via Mas Adit) with training schedule and manage service pricing.","pic":"Fitrat Adiyuliandito","due_date":"2026-08-20","status":"Open"},{"item":"Customer to evaluate proposal and compare with other vendors.","pic":"Customer (Pak Galih \\/ Pak Adam)","due_date":"2026-08-27","status":"Open"},{"item":"Arrange follow-up meeting to discuss proposal and address any remaining questions.","pic":"Prasetyo team","due_date":"2026-08-30","status":"Open"}]}	{"conclusion":"The demo was successful in showcasing Lark's capabilities relevant to PT Katsushiro Indonesia's needs, particularly in messaging, meetings, AI features, and workflow automation. The customer is interested but still evaluating against Microsoft Teams. The key decision will depend on pricing, migration ease, and the added value of Lark's integrated approach. Prasetyo needs to provide a compelling proposal with clear ROI and support plan.","next_step":"Prasetyo to send formal proposal with detailed pricing (licensing, training, manage service) and a comparison summary. Customer will review internally and aim for a decision by late August.","trial_poc_potensial":"Prasetyo offered a free trial period (implied) and mentioned a pilot could be started with a small group. The customer may consider a proof of concept with 5-10 users before full rollout.","decision_timeline":"Customer hopes to start using Lark by September 1, pending procurement and internal approval. Decision expected within 2-3 weeks."}	https://larksuite