ery	Discovery	{"executive_summary":"PT Thamrin Brothers, a Yamaha motorcycle distributor in Sumsel and Bengkulu with 600 salespeople across 30+ dealers, seeks a unified platform to improve sales productivity, centralize lead management, and eliminate double data entry. They currently use an in-house system and Mekari Kontak, and require integration with Oracle Fusion and Yamaha's principal system. The vendor proposed Lark as an all-in-one workspace with chat, project management, forms, dashboards, and reminders, offering a pilot project for 10 users. The prospect expressed interest but needs internal discussion before proceeding.","overall_sentiment":{"positive":65,"neutral":30,"negative":5},"key_pain_points":["Salesmen not disciplined in inputting leads daily, leading to data gaps and fictitious entries.","Double data entry into in-house system and principal's Yamaha mobile app, causing inefficiency.","Difficulty tracking follow-up activities and verifying salesmen's actual customer visits.","No centralized dashboard to monitor funnel conversion, sales performance, and event ROI.","Limited integration between existing tools (in-house system, Oracle Fusion, Mekari Kontak)."],"customer_needs":["A user-friendly, mobile-first platform that salespeople will adopt (like WhatsApp).","Centralized lead management with automated reminders and follow-up tracking.","Real-time dashboards for management to monitor sales funnel, inventory, and performance.","Integration with Oracle Fusion and principal's system to avoid double input.","Pilot project to test the solution in one dealership before wider rollout."],"key_discussions":["Presentation of Lark's features: chat, video meetings, docs, project management, forms, and dashboards tailored for dealerships.","Current challenges: manual lead input, fictitious data, lack of conversion tracking, and double entry.","Integration possibilities: Lark can connect with Oracle Fusion, Mekari Kontak, and export CSV for principal.","User adoption strategy: focusing on habit change and human factors; vendor offers workshops.","Pilot proposal: 10-user trial for one dealership to build workflows and prove ROI."],"decisions_agreements":["Vendor to provide 10 free seats for a trial and create a Lark group for ongoing support.","Vendor will send a presentation and comparison document after the meeting.","Prospect to conduct internal discussion before deciding on pilot project.","Next step: prospect will inform vendor of interest to proceed with pilot in one dealership."]}	[]	{"budget":"Not explicitly discussed but implied willingness based on ROI conversation; budget likely exists but not disclosed.","authority":"Ricardo Valentino appears to be the key decision-maker, with input from Rusman Hadi (operations) and Dannis (sales).","needs":"Centralized sales platform with chat, forms, dashboards, reminders, and integration with Oracle Fusion and principal's system.","timeline":"No specific timeline; pilot proposed as next step.","competitor":"Not mentioned; prospect currently uses in-house system and Mekari Kontak."}	{"lead_score":70,"eligibility_status":"potential","confidence":75}	Proceed with pilot project in one dealership as proposed. Provide 10-user trial, build a sample workflow for their sales funnel, and closely support adoption. Focus on demonstrating ROI through conversion tracking and reduced double entry. Engage with their IT team for integration feasibility with Oracle Fusion and Yamaha's system. Follow up within two weeks for internal decision.	meeting_summary_discovery_prompt	1	ep-20260830094032-4smp5	ep-20260830094032-4smp5	2026-08-30 08:12:17	LARK	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	TRANSCRIPT_IMPORTED	\N	\N	\N	{"topics_discussed":[{"topik":"Company Overview of Prasetyadi Dharma","ringkasan":"Shah Reza introduced the company as a tech provider since 2008, focusing on telecom, ERP, and now Lark (by Bytedance). They are partners with Oracle NetSuite and investors in Mekari, Kiskas, and other startups.","relevansi":"Medium"},{"topik":"Current State of PT Thamrin Brothers","ringkasan":"They operate 30+ dealers, 40+ channels, 600 salesmen. Use in-house system for leads, Oracle Fusion for ERP, and Mekari Kontak (5 users) for WhatsApp comms. They face double entry with Yamaha's principal system and lack integrated sales funnel visibility.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"Lark Features and Use Cases","ringkasan":"Demonstrated Lark's chat-centric workspace with forms, dashboards, client visit tracking, and reminders. Showed a dealership dashboard example (Wuling) with lead status, conversion rates, and performance rankings.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"Integration Capabilities","ringkasan":"Discussed API integration with Oracle Fusion, Mekari Kontak, and CSV export for principal's system. Vendor emphasized flexibility via open API and MCP connectors.","relevansi":"High"},{"topik":"Pilot Project Proposal","ringkasan":"Vendor suggested starting with one dealership to build workflow automation and prove concept before scaling. Offered 10 free seats for trial.","relevansi":"High"}],"buying_signals_radar":{"kebutuhan":5,"urgensi":3,"budget_kesiapan":3,"decision_support":4,"solusi_fit":4,"niat_implementasi":3},"action_items":[{"item":"Send presentation and comparison document to PT Thamrin Brothers","pic":"Shah Reza Effendi","due_date":"2026-08-17","status":"Open"},{"item":"Activate 10 Lark trial seats for PT Thamrin Brothers","pic":"Shah Reza Effendi","due_date":"2026-08-17","status":"Open"},{"item":"Create Lark group chat for ongoing questions and support","pic":"Shah Reza Effendi","due_date":"2026-08-17","status":"Open"},{"item":"Internal discussion at PT Thamrin Brothers regarding pilot project","pic":"Ricardo Valentino","due_date":"2026-08-31","status":"Open"},{"item":"Inform vendor of decision to proceed with pilot","pic":"Ricardo Valentino","due_date":"2026-08-31","status":"Open"}]}	{"conclusion":"The meeting successfully identified PT Thamrin Brothers' key pain points in sales data management and the need for a unified, user-friendly platform. Lark's capabilities align well with their requirements, especially for lead tracking, reminders, and integration. The prospect is interested but cautious, preferring a pilot project before full commitment. The next steps involve trial activation and internal review.","next_step":"Vendor to send materials and activate 10-user trial; prospect to conduct internal discussion and decide on pilot dealership.","expected_outcome":"Pilot project in one dealership to validate Lark's effectiveness in improving sales efficiency and data accuracy, with potential full rollout across all dealers.","target_implementation":"Pilot within 1-2 months; full rollout dependent on pilot success."}	https://larksuite.com/docx/Hbkdd2Xg7o1o98xakNGlsw3KgLb	Hbkdd2Xg7o1o98xakNGlsw3KgLb
