 WhatsApp for external and internal communication","AI capabilities for automated meeting summaries and knowledge management","Customizable approval and automation workflows","Smooth migration path from Google Workspace with minimal disruption"],"key_discussions":["Demo of Lark messenger, calendar, meeting management, and approval features","Migration process from Google Workspace using dedicated tools","Integration with WhatsApp via API and webhooks","AI features including meeting notes, knowledge AI, and custom agents","Pricing structure and free trial availability"],"decisions_agreements":["Customer agreed to sign up for Lark free trial to test the platform","Lark team will send pricing details and migration documentation","Further technical assessment required for integration with existing systems","Customer's IT team will evaluate the platform internally","A follow-up meeting to discuss implementation plan and timeline"]}	[]	{"budget":"Not explicitly discussed; pricing per user per month mentioned, but customer is evaluating cost. Free trial available.","authority":"Multiple stakeholders involved (IT, management). Decision-maker not clearly identified.","needs":"Unified collaboration platform with integration to WhatsApp, AI features, and customizable workflows. Current pain: fragmented tools.","timeline":"Not specified; trial and evaluation expected within 2-3 weeks. Potential implementation in Q4 2026.","competitor":"Google Workspace (current), Microsoft Teams (likely considered), and other collaboration tools."}	{"lead_score":70,"eligibility_status":"eligible","confidence":80}	Proceed with free trial and provide dedicated support during evaluation. Focus on demonstrating integration with WhatsApp and migration from Google Workspace. Offer a proof-of-concept for approval workflows and AI meeting summaries to highlight value. Follow up with a technical deep-dive to address any integration concerns.	meeting_summary_discovery_prompt	1	ep-20260830094032-4smp5	ep-